sent banner builder'=>'Olùkọ́lé àtẹ́gùn ìtẹ́wọ́gbọ́ kuki','Site health and clean-up report'=>'Ìlera ojula ati iroyin mimọto','Staging and local sites don\'t use up a licence'=>'Àwọn ojúlé ìdánwò àti ti ìbílẹ̀ kò ní lo ìwé àṣẹ kan','Docs site and short video guides'=>'Ojula àwọn ìwé àti àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́nà fídíò kúkúrú','Feedback and feature-request button'=>'Bọtìni fún èrò sí i àti ìbéèrè ẹ̀yà ara','Beta updates channel'=>'Ọna imudojuiwọn Beta','Priority support'=>'Atileyin pataki','Bug reporter and support tickets'=>'Olùròyìn kokoro àti àwọn tikẹti ìtìlẹyìn','Use Freemius fully'=>'Lo Freemius ni kikun','Footprint-free front end, on by default'=>'Ojú-òpó ti ko ni àmì ìṣàwárí, ti o wa ni titan nipasẹ aiyipada','Foundation'=>'Ìpìlẹ̀','Speed and SEO'=>'Iyara ati SEO','Layout and design system'=>'Ètò àti ètò ìṣẹ̀dá','Blocks (free)'=>'Àwọn Ìdènà (ọ̀fẹ́)','Blocks (Pro)'=>'Àwọn ìdènà (Pro)','Theme builder (Pro)'=>'Aláyà ìṣẹ̀dú (Pro)','Dynamic data (Pro)'=>'Àwọn dátà agbára-míìsì (Pro)','WooCommerce (Pro)'=>'WooCommerce (Pro)','Forms, popups and motion (Pro)'=>'Àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù, àwọn agbájọ pópù, àti ìṣípòpọ̀ (Pro)','Templates and cloud'=>'Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ àti àwọn ẹ̀rọ ayélujára','Accessibility'=>'Wíwọlé','Workflow and agency'=>'Iṣẹ́ ìṣàn àti ilé-iṣẹ́ aṣojú','AI inside the builder'=>'AI nínú olùkọ́lé ojú opó','Developers'=>'Àwọn olùṣẹ̀dá sọfùtìwèrè','AI keys and models'=>'Àwọn bọ́tìnnì AI àti àwọn àwòṣe','Admin and licensing'=>'Alábàkúsè àti ìwé àṣẹ','More blocks'=>'Àwọn àkójọpọ̀ tó pọ̀ sí i','More features'=>'Awọn ẹya ara ẹni miiran','Licensing and support'=>'Àṣẹ àti ìtìlẹ́yìn','Hosting built for fast, multilingual WordPress'=>'Ìgbàlejò tí a kọ́ fún WordPress tó yára, tí ó sì ń sọ èdè púpọ̀','Managed WordPress hosting from the team that makes this plugin, tuned for speed and for sites in many languages.'=>'Ìgbékalẹ̀ wẹ́bù WordPress tí a ṣàkóso láti ọ̀dọ̀ ẹgbẹ́ tó ṣe plọ́gìn yìí, tí a ṣètò fún iyára àti fún àwọn ojú-wọ́wé ní ọ̀pọ̀ èdè.','See Zinn Digital® hosting'=>'Wo ibi igbalejo Zinn Digital®','Hire a WordPress expert on ZinnHub'=>'Gbba amoye WordPress kan sori ZinnHub','A freelance marketplace for WordPress design, development, translation and SEO work.'=>'Ọjà aládàáni fún apẹrẹ, ìdàgbàsókè, ìtumọ̀ ati iṣẹ́ SEO ti WordPress.','Visit ZinnHub'=>'Ṣẹ̀bẹ̀wò sí ZinnHub','Bulk site and PBN hosting'=>'Ìgbàlejò ojula púpọ̀ àti PBN','PBN.ltd is our platform for hosting and managing many sites at once.'=>'PBN.ltd jẹ pẹpẹ wa fun gbigbalejo ati iṣakoso ọpọlọpọ awọn aaye ni ẹẹkan.','Visit PBN.ltd'=>'Ṣẹ́ abẹ́wọ̀ si PBN.ltd','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro and Tranzly Pro together'=>'Gbà Page Builder Sandwich Pro ati Tranzly Pro pọ̀','The bundle costs less than buying both plugins separately, on the same plans and site limits.'=>'Iye àpapọ̀ náà din Kéré ju rira àwọn àfikún méjèèjì lọtọ̀, lórí àwọn ètò kan náà àti àwọn ààlà ojú òpó wẹ́bù kan náà.','See the bundle'=>'Wo àpòtì náà','Get %s'=>'Gba %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Ìsopọ̀ ti ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́: %1$s àti %2$s ń ṣiṣẹ́ pọ̀','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s nṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii, nitorinaa awọn afikun mejeeji pin eto kan ti awọn bọtini olupese AI ati iboju awọn eto kan fun wọn.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Tú ojula yii pẹlu Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Fi awọn oju-iwe sori pẹlu Page Builder Sandwich','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, láti ọwọ́ Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Tẹ gbogbo ojú-ewé jáde ní ọ̀pọ̀ èdè, pẹ̀lú àwọn àdírẹ́sì tí a túmọ̀, dátà SEO àti bọtìni yíyí èdè. Ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú àwọn ojú-ewé tí o kọ́ níhìn-ín.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Ṣe apẹrẹ awọn oju-iwe taara ninu olutunṣe pẹlu awọn bulọọki ti o yara, ti ko ni footprint. Ohun gbogbo ti o kọ ni a tumọ pẹlu Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'Ẹgbẹ kan náà ló ṣe %s, ó sì ń bá àlọ́ kíkọ yìi ṣiṣẹ́ pọ̀.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Gbà láti so ojula yii pọ̀ kọ́kọ́.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi imeeli ti o wulo sii.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Gbà láti kọ́kọ́ rán ìsọ̀wọ́ ìtìlẹ́yìn jáde.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Kọ àkọlé kan àti ifẹ̀ran kan.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi imeeli kan wọle tí ẹgbẹ́ ìtìlẹ́yìn lè fèsì sí.','Choose 1, 3 or 7 days.'=>'Yan ọjọ 1, 3 tabi 7.','Temporary support access created by the site owner. It is deleted automatically when it expires.'=>'Wiwọle ìtìlẹ́yìn fúngbẹ̀gbẹ̀kan tí olówó ojú-wọ́wọ́ dá sílẹ. Ó ń pa á rẹ́ fúnra rẹ̀ nígbà tí ó bá parí àkókò rẹ̀.','Only a site administrator, signed in to this screen, can create temporary support access.'=>'Olùṣàkóso ojú-wẹ́bù nìkan, tí ó wọlé sí ojú-ìwé yìí, ni ó lè ṣẹ́dá ààyè ìrànlọ́wọ́ fún ìgbà díẹ̀.','This site already has the most temporary support logins it can have at once. Revoke one below, or send the request without a login.'=>'Ojula yii ti ni ọpọlọpọ awọn wọle atilẹyin igba diẹ ti o le ni ni ẹẹkan. Fagilee ọkan ni isalẹ, tabi ranṣẹ ibeere naa laisi wọle.','A unique user name could not be chosen. Try again.'=>'A ko le yan orukọ olumulo alailẹgbẹ kan. Tun gbiyanju siwaju sii.','Zinn Digital® support (temporary)'=>'Atileyin Zinn Digital® (ti akoko)','This temporary support access has expired.'=>'Wiwọle atilẹyin ìgbà díẹ̀ yìí ti kọjá àsìkò rẹ̀.','AI providers'=>'Àwọn olùpèsè AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Awọn oluṣe ChatGPT. Oluranlọwọ ti o dara ni gbogbo ọna.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Àwọn olùṣẹ̀dá Claude. Wọ́n lágbára nínú kíkọ̀wé àti ẹ̀kọ́ ìṣọ́ra.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Awọn awoṣe Gemini ti Google. Yara ati olowo poku.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Ile-iṣẹ AI kan ti Ilu Yuroopu pẹlu awọn awoṣe ti o yara, ti ko si gbowolori.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Àwọn àwòṣe iye owó kékeré tí ó dára fún kíkọ àti kóòdù.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Bọtini kan fun awọn awoṣe lati ọpọlọpọ awọn olupese oriṣiriṣi.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Èyíkéyìí iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́ tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ bíi API ti OpenAI, títí kan àwṣ àwòkùṣe tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí kọmpútà tàbí sẹ́fà rẹ.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Ngbogbogbo (a n lo ti ko ba si nkankan pato ti a gbe kalẹ)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kikọ ati tun-kikọ','Translation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','Code and CSS'=>'Koodu ati CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Má bínú, a kò yọ̀ǹda fún ọ láti wọ ojú ewé yìí.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Gbogbo àwọn plugin tó ń lò wọ́n pín àwọn ètò yìí: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Awon key re wa ni ipamo ninu ibi ifipamọ data aaye yii, a si n fi won ranṣẹ nikan si olupese ti o yan — ki i se si wa laelae.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ 1 nínú 2: yan olùpèsè AI kan','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'O mu kọ́kọ́ra rẹ wa, nitorina o sanwo taara fun olupese fun ohun ti o lo. Ko ni idaniloju? Eyikeyi ninu wọnyi ṣiṣẹ daradara; o le ṣafikun diẹ sii nigbamii.','Next'=>'Nísinsìnyìí','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Igbesẹ 2 ti 2: sopọ %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ OpenAI-compatible rẹ sii, ti o pari pẹlu /v1. Bọtini kan nikan ni a nilo ti iṣẹ naa ba beere fun.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Ṣí %s kí o sì wọlé (tàbí kí o ṣẹ̀dá àkọọ̀lẹ̀ ọ̀fẹ́ kan).','the %s API keys page'=>'oju eka awọn bọtini API %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá kọ́kọ́rọ́ tuntun kan kí o sì da a si.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Lẹ̀ẹ́ mọ́ nínú rẹ̀ kí o sì tẹ "Save and test". A máa ń rán ìbéèrè kékeré kan láti ṣàyẹ̀wò pé ó ń ṣiṣẹ́.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀ jù lọ àwọn olùpèsè nílò ìdíwọ̀n owó díẹ̀ lórí àkáǹtì náà kí kọ́ọ̀sì kan tó lè ṣiṣẹ́: %s.','add credit'=>'fi kun kirẹditi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Yan olupese miiran','Address'=>'Àdíréṣì','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Bọtìnì tí a fi pamọ́ parí sí …%s — lẹ́ẹ̀kan bọtìnì tuntun láti rọ́pò rẹ̀','Key (optional)'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ (aṣàyàn)','API key'=>'Bọtìnì API','Save and test'=>'Fipamọ ki o si danwo','Providers'=>'Àwọn Olùpèsè','Provider'=>'Olupese','Status'=>'Ipo','Key'=>'Bọtìnì (Key)','Get a key'=>'Gbọ́ bọ́tìnnì kọ́kọ́ṣẹ́','Test'=>'Idanwo','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'A ti fi ẹ̀yà àfikún tuntun pamọ́: ṣe ìgbàsílẹ̀ àfikún yìí, tàbí kí o tún bọtínì náà sílẹ̀.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Bọtìnì tí a ti fi pamọ́ kò ṣe é ṣí mọ́ (àwọn bọtìnì ààbò ojú-wẹ́bù náà yípadà). Tẹ ẹ sii lẹẹkan si.','Not connected'=>'Ko sopọ','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ti sopọ — àdánwò tó kẹhin kọja %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Idanwo ti o kẹhin kuna: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Tí a sopọ̀ — a kò tíì dán wò','Which model to use'=>'Èwo nínú àwọn àpẹẹrẹ náà ni láti lò','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ jẹ́ àmì ìṣedúró wa fún iṣẹ́ yẹn. Àtòjọ náà ní gbogbo àwọn àwòṣe tí kọ́ọ̀sì rẹ lè lò, tí a kà ní tààràtà láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè náà.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— A ṣe iṣeduro fun olupese —','Save models'=>'Fi awọn awoṣe pamọ','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sọ àwọn àkọlé àwọn àwòṣe di tuntun láti ọ̀dọ̀ àwọn olùpèsè','Images'=>'Àwọn àwòrán','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'So OpenAI tabi Google Gemini lati ṣe awọn aworan.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Awoṣe aworan tuntun ti olupese ti a sopọ akọkọ —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Wiwá ojula (àwọn ìṣẹ̀dá)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'So Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tabi OpenRouter lati kọ Atọka wiwa ti aaye rẹ.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Awoṣe ifibọ tuntun ti olupese akọkọ ti a sopọ —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Yíyí èyí padà tún atọka ìwárí ti gbogbo plọọgìì (plugin) tó ń lò ó ṣe.','best quality'=>'èpò tó dára jùlọ','lowest cost'=>'iye ti o kere ju','fastest'=>'tètè jù','Add a model yourself'=>'Fi àwoṣé kún un fún ra rẹ','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Ṣé àwẹ àwòṣe tuntun jáde lónìí? Fi orúkọ rẹ̀ gangan sílẹ̀ láti lò ó lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Model name'=>'Orúkọ àwòṣe','Add model'=>'Fi awoṣe kun','Recommended models list'=>'Àtòjọ àwọn àwoṣe tí a gbani nímọ̀ràn','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'A ko le rii daju pe atokọ awọn awoṣe ti a niyanju ni o tọ, nitorina a ko fihan awọn imọran kankan. Tun fi ẹnẹ-iṣẹ ṣiṣẹ (plugin), tabi tan awọn imudojuiwọn ojoojumọ ni isalẹ.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Àtòkọ tí a ń lò ni a tẹ̀ jáde ní %s. Ìgbékalẹ̀ ìgbékalẹ̀ pílúgì kọ̀ọ̀kan mú tuntun wá.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Ẹ tún ṣàyẹ̀wò Zinn Digital® lẹ́ẹ̀kan lọ́jọ́ kan fún àkójọ tí a sọ di tuntun.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìṣàwọlẹ̀ tí ó rọrùn nìkan ni a ń ránṣẹ́: kò sí kọ́kọ́rọ́, kò sí àdírẹ́sì ojú ẹ̀rọ, kò sí ohunkohun nípa àkóónú rẹ. A tọwọ́ si àkójọ náà, a sì máa ń gbójú fo àkójọ tí kò bá kọjá àyẹ̀wò ìtọwọ́sí náà.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Ìgbẹ̀yẹ̀gbẹ́ tí a ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ kẹ́yìn %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Fi pamọ, ki o si ṣayẹwo ni bayi ti a ba tan','a newer list was installed'=>'a fi àkọ̀sílẹ̀ tuntun kan sori rẹ̀','already up to date'=>'ti ni imudojuiwọn tẹlẹ','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'gba download naa kuna ayẹwo ibuwọlu ati pe a foju si i','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital®; àkójọ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ yẹn ni a óò máa lo','turned off'=>'a pa','Open'=>'Ṣí','Check their status page'=>'Ṣẹ̀wò ojú ìwé ipò wọn','Open your billing page'=>'Ṣí ojúewé ìwé-owó rẹ','Open your API keys page'=>'Ṣí ojú ewé àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ','Open the AI settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Ẹ jẹ̀wọ́, a ò yọ̀ǹda fún un yín láti ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀.','Unknown provider.'=>'Olupese ti a ko mọ.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ rẹ sii, fún àpẹẹrẹ http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Iyẹn kò dà bí bọ́tìnnì API. Ṣàkọṣẹ́ rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, láìsí ààyè àárín.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Fi bọtìni API rẹ sori ẹrọ kọkọ.','Key removed.'=>'A ti yọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà kúrò.','Models saved.'=>'Àwọn àwòṣe ti a fi pamọ́.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Tẹ orúkọ gangan àwoṣe náà sílẹ̀, fún àpẹẹrẹ bí ìwé àfikún olùpèsè náà ṣe kọ ọ́.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'A fi %s kun. Yan ni abẹ́ "Which model to use".','Model removed.'=>'Àwòṣe náà ti kúrò.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Àwọn ìgbékalẹ̀ ojúmọ́ ti wà ní pípa. A ń lò àkójọ tí ó wá pẹ̀lú plugin náà.','Checked: %s.'=>'A ti ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'A tún àwọn àkójọ àwṣẹ́ sọ di tuntun.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ẹya tuntun ti ọkan ninu awọn afikun rẹ lo fipamọ bọtini AI rẹ. Ṣe imudojuiwọn afikun yii, tabi tẹ bọtini naa sii lẹẹkan si ninu awọn eto AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'A kò lè tú bọ́tìnnì AI tí o ti fi pamọ́ sílẹ̀ mọ́ (àwọn bọ́tìnnì ààbò ojú-wẹ́bù náà yí padà). Tún tẹ ẹ́ sínú àwọn ètò AI náà.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'A kò tíì ṣètò AI. Fi bọ́tìnnì kọ́kọ́ra fún olùpèsè AI sínú àwọn ètò AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'A kò yàn àpẹẹrẹkankan fún iṣẹ́ yìí. Yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn ẹ̀ka ìtòsí AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Àwọn oníbàárù AI yẹn kò ní ìṣègè rẹ̀ lọ́wọ́ ẹ̀dà yìí fún plọ́gìn náà.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ko si olupese AI ti o le ṣe awọn aworan ti o ni asopọ. Fi bọtini OpenAI tabi Google Gemini kun ninu awọn eto AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Olupese AI yii ko le ṣe awọn aworan. Yan OpenAI tabi Google Gemini fun awọn aworan ni awọn eto AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Bọtínì AI rẹ kò lè lo ètò àwòrán kankan. Ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn àṣẹ bọtínì náà pẹ̀lú olùpèsè, tàbí kí o yan olùpèsè míràn fún àwọn àwòrán.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Kò sí olùpèsè AI tí ó sopọ̀ tí ó lè kọ́ atọ́ka wákiri kan. Fi bọ́tìnì Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tàbí OpenRouter kún nínú àwọn ètò AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Bọtìlì AI rẹ ko le lo eyikeyi awoṣe embedding. Ṣayẹwo awọn the awọn aṣẹ bọtìlì pẹlu olupese, tabi yan olupese miiran fun wiwa aaye.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Olupese AI yii ko le kọ atọka wiwa kan. So Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tabi iṣẹ ti o ni ibamu pẹlu rẹ fun wiwa aaye.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Ojula yi ko le de ọdọ iṣẹ AI rẹ. Ṣayẹwo pe o nṣiṣẹ ati pe adirẹsi rẹ le de si lati ọdọ sẹ́fà wẹẹbu rẹ (iṣẹ kan lori kọmputa tirẹ ko le de si lati oju opo wẹẹbu ti a gbalejo).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Aaye yii ko le de %s. Ṣayẹwo oju-iwe ipo wọn; ti wọn ba wa lori ayelujara, agbalejo rẹ le n dina awọn asopọ ti n jade, tabi adirẹsi naa jẹ aṣiṣe.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s sọ pé kò sí káàdì tàbí kòótà tó kù ní ìpamọ́ rẹ. Fi owó kún un tàbí gbé ìwọ̀n rẹ sókè ní ìpamọ́ rẹ pẹ̀lú wọn, lẹ́yìn náà tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kò gba kọ́ọ̀sì tí o fi sílẹ̀ náà. Ó lè jẹ́ pé ó jẹ́ àṣìṣe kíkọ, wọ́n ti fagilé rẹ̀ tàbí ó ti pé ọjọ́. Ṣẹ́da kọ́ọ̀sì tuntun kan kí o sì lẹ mọ́ ibi yìí.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kọ ìbéèrè yìí fún bọtínì rẹ. Bọtínì náà le má ní ààyè sí àwṣ̀rọ̀ tabi ẹ̀ya yìí, tàbí kí akántì rẹ nílò ìmúdájú.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'A ko le ri awoṣe "%1$s" latiọdọ %2$s fun bọtọ̀ rẹ. Yan awoṣe miiran ninu awọn eto AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Ètò %2$s rẹ ko ni awoṣe "%1$s" ninu. Yan awoṣe miiran ninu awọn eto AI, tabi sọ eto rẹ di tuntun pẹlu wọn.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s n ṣe ìdíwọ́ fún ìyára tí bọ́tìnnì rẹ lè fi ránṣẹ́ àwọn ìbéèrè. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú kan kí o sì tún gbiyanju rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, tàbí kí o gbe ìwọ̀n tí o lè ránṣẹ́ sókè pẹ̀lú wọn.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s nìírírí àwọn ìṣòro báyìí (ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ ìdúró tàbí ìjẹ́jù lórí apá wọn). Kò sí ohun tí kò tọ́ pẹ̀lú àwọn ètò rẹ. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i láìpẹ́.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ìbéèrè AI náà kùnà fún ìdí kan tí a kò lè mọ̀. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; tí ó bá ń ṣẹlẹ̀ sí i, kàn sí àtìlẹ́yìn pẹ̀lú àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Olupese AI naa dahun ni ọna ti pḷọọgìì ni ko le ka. Tun gbiyanju si tun; ti o ba n tẹsiwaju, yan awoṣe miiran tabi kan si atilẹyin.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Aṣeṣe (ti o ni ibamu pẹlu OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Fi bọtínì kan pamọ́ fún olùpèsè yìí kọ́kọ́.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Bọtini rẹ ṡe iṣẹ, ṣugbọn olupese naa ko ṣe at তালিকা awoṣe ọrọ kankan fun un. Ṣafikun awoṣe kan funrararẹ ni isalẹ.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ti sopọ. %1$s ti dahun nipa lilo %2$s. Awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ AI rẹ ti ṣetan lati lo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ko si ni ipa olumulo rẹ lati lo AI lori aaye yii. Bi olùṣàkóso kan lọ́wọ́.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojula yii ti de opin inawo AI rẹ fun oṣu yii. Alabojuto le gbe e soke ni awọn eto AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojula yii ti de opin opin oṣooṣu rẹ ti awọn ibeere AI. Alabojuto le gbe e soke ni awọn eto AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Lilo ati idiyele','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀, àwọn ààlà, àti àwọn àṣẹ ipa wúlò fún AI tí a lò nípasẹ̀: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Àwọn iye náà jẹ́ àìnílọ́fà, a ṣe àkọọ́lẹ̀ wọn láti inú àwọn iye owó tí a tẹ̀ jáde; àwọn àwòṣe tí kò ní iye owó tí a mọ̀ ni a kà sí ojofo.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Oṣù yìí: %1$s àwọn ìbéèrè, nǹkan bí %2$s.','When'=>'Nigbati','Who'=>'Ta ni','Used for'=>'Ti a lo fun','Model'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ','Tokens in / out'=>'Awọn àmì ìdámọ̀ wọlé / jáde','About'=>'Nipa','Result'=>'Èsi','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ko ti si awọn ibeere AI kankan ti a ṣe sibẹsibẹ.','Done'=>'Ti pari','Limits and permissions'=>'Àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Ààlà owó tí a ń ná lóṣù (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ láìsí ààlà. AI yóò dúró fún ìyókù oṣù náà ní kété tí iye owó tí a fẹ́ fẹ́ dé ibẹ̀.','Monthly request limit'=>'Ìwọ̀n ìbéèrè lóṣooṣù','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Fi o fo si oju opo wẹbẹ fun aini opin.','Who may use AI'=>'Tani o le lo AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Ko kankan si silẹ lati jẹ ki gbogbo eniyan ti o le lo awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ plugin na lo AI. Awọn oludari le lo o nigbagbogbo.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ṣe ìpamọ́ àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn opin ati awọn àṣẹ.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Aṣiṣe ààbò, jọ̀ọ́ sọ ojú-ewé náà di tuntun kí o sì tún gbiyanju rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan si.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Àwọn ètò ìwé ìròyìn kò sí. Jọ̀wọ́ kàn sí aláṣẹ náà.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Àwọn ètò ìwé ìròyìn kò tọ́. Jọ̀wọ́ kàn sí olùṣàkóso náà.','Invalid email address.'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli ti ko tọ.','Please tick the box to agree before subscribing.'=>'Jọwọ samisi apoti naa lati gba tẹlẹ ṣaaju ki o to ṣe alabapin.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Àwọn ìgbìyànjú pọ̀ jù. Jọ̀wọ́ gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan si ní ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ sẹ́yìn.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Nkan kan ko tọ. Jọwọ kan si oluṣakoso na.','Map'=>'Ṣe àmì ojú-òpó','Background video'=>'Fidio abẹlẹ','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: %2$d awọn faili fọọti ti a fipamọ, iwe ara (stylesheet) %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'A kò tọ́jú ìdílé yẹn.','Removed.'=>'Ti yọ kuro.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Orúkọ ìdílé fọ́ǹtì yẹn kò wúlò.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google kò dá ìdílé yẹn padà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò orúkọ náà kí o sì tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Awọn faili fọọti naa ko le ṣe igbasilẹ tabi fipamọ. Ṣayẹwo pe folda igbasilẹ data (uploads folder) le ni kikọ si i.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Àwòse òrùkà fɔ́ntì náà kò lè fipamọ́. Ṣe ìvèwò pé a lè kó sínú folda àwòse ti a s̀e àpò sí.','D