̀n ara rẹ','Practical online courses taught by working professionals. Learn in short lessons, practise with real projects and earn a certificate.'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀kọ́ orí ayélujára tó wúlò tí àwọn aṣojú iṣẹ́ tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́ ń kọ́ni. Kọ́ nínú àwọn ẹ̀kọ́ kúkurú, fi àwọn iṣẹ́ gidi ṣe ìṣe, kí o sì gba ìwé ẹ̀rí.','Browse courses'=>'Ṣàwẹ́ àwọn ẹ̀kọ́','Every course includes'=>'Gbogbo ẹ̀kọ́ ní','Short video lessons'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀kọ́ fídíò kúkúrú','Real-world projects'=>'Àwọn iṣẹ́ gidi-gidi','Mentor feedback'=>'Èrò lọ́wọ́ olùkọ́','Certificate on completion'=>'Ìwé ẹ̀rí lẹ́yìn parí ọ̀rọ̀','Popular courses'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀kọ́ gbajúmọ̀','Web development'=>'Ìdàgbàsókè wẹ́bù','HTML, CSS and JavaScript from first principles to projects.'=>'HTML, CSS ati JavaScript lati aawon ilana akoko ti o wa pẹlu awọn iṣẹ-anṣan.','Digital marketing'=>'Ọjà títà lórí ẹ̀rọ ayélujára','SEO, content, email and social campaigns that work.'=>'SEO, àwọn ohun àkóṣe, imeeli àti àwọn ipolongo lórí ẹ̀rọ alágbèéká tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa.','Data analysis'=>'Ayẹwo data','Spreadsheets, SQL and dashboards for better decisions.'=>'Àwọn ìwé ìṣirò, SQL àti àwọn pátákó ìṣàkóso fún àwọn ìpinnu tó dára jù lọ.','UX design'=>'Apẹrẹ UX','Research, wireframes and prototypes users love.'=>'Ìwádìí, àwọn àwòrán ìpìlẹ̀ àti àwọn ohun èlò ìdánwò tí àwọn oníbàárà fẹ́ràn.','Project management'=>'Ìṣàkóso iṣẹ́ náà','Plan, deliver and lead projects with confidence.'=>'Ètò, múuṣẹ́, kí o sì tọ́ ọwọ́ iṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú ìgbọ́kànlé.','Business writing'=>'Ìkọ̀wéòwò','Clear emails, reports and proposals.'=>'Ko awọn imeeli, awọn ijabọ ati awọn aṣoju kuro ni kedere.','Niche Authority Site'=>'Ààyè Ògbóni Kúlẹ̀tọ̀','Start here'=>'Bẹrẹ ibi','The topics readers ask about most.'=>'Awọn akori ti awọn olukawo n beere nipa julọ.','Growing vegetables'=>'Wíwọ gbẹ̀gẹ́gẹ́','Raised beds, soil, sowing calendars and harvests.'=>'Àwọn ibùsùn tí a gbé sókè, ilẹ̀, àwọn kàlẹ́ndà ìgbìn àti ìkórè.','Lawn care'=>'Itọju papa koriko','Feeding, mowing and fixing patchy grass.'=>'Fífúnni ní oúnjẹ, lílé ewe àti títún koríko tí kò déédé ṣe.','Garden tools'=>'Awọn irinṣẹ ọgba','What is worth buying and how to look after it.'=>'Ohun ti o tọ si rira ati bi o ṣe le tọju rẹ.','Small gardens'=>'Àwọn ọgbà kékeré','Balconies, patios and containers.'=>'Awọn baliani, awọn patio ati awọn apoti.','Practical guides to home gardening'=>'Awọn iwe ilana to wulo fun iṣẹ-ọgbà ni ile','Straightforward advice on growing vegetables, caring for lawns and choosing the right tools, written by people who garden every weekend.'=>'Imọran tọ́ rọrùn lórí bí a ṣe ń gbìn ẹ̀fọ́, bí a ṣe ń tọ́jú koríko àti bí a ṣe ń yan àwọn irinṣẹ́ tó tọ́, tí àwọn ènìyàn tí wọ́n ń ṣe iṣẹ́ ẹ̀dágbẹ́ ní gbogbo ìparí ọ̀sẹ̀ kọ.','Read the latest guides'=>'Ka awọn itọnisọna tuntun','About the author'=>'Nipa onkọwe yẹn','Estate Agency'=>'Ilé-iṣẹ́ Ìdúró','What is your home worth?'=>'Elo ni iye ile rẹ?','Book a free, no-obligation valuation.'=>'Ṣe ìṣiròye iye owó lọ́fẹ̀ẹ́, láìsí ìpèsè.','Book a valuation'=>'Fi iye ṣe iye','Free valuation'=>'Ìwọ̀n ọfẹ́','An agent visits and prices your home.'=>'Aṣojú kan wá sí ilé rẹ, ó sì ṣe ìṣirò owó rẹ̀.','Launch'=>'Ṣe ìfilọ́lẹ̀','Photos, floor plan and listing live within days.'=>'Awọn fọto, ètò ilẹ ati atokọ naa wa laaye laarin awọn ọjọ.','Sold'=>'Ti ta','We negotiate and manage the sale to completion.'=>'Awa ń seleri loju ejo ati lati se akoso titaja naa titi di opin.','Bistro'=>'Bistro','Open Tuesday to Sunday'=>'Ṣí ní Ọjọ́ Ìṣẹ́gun títí di Ọjọ́ Àìkú','Seasonal cooking, made for sharing'=>'Sise ounjẹ akoko, ti a ṣe fun pinpin','Local produce, a wood-fired oven and a wine list chosen by people who love it. Lunch and dinner, six days a week.'=>'Awọn ohun ọgbin agbegbe, adiro onigi ati atọnisọna ọti-waini ti awọn eniyan ti o nifẹ rẹ yan. Ounjẹ ọsan ati ale, awọn ọjọ mẹfa ni ọsẹ kan.','Book a table'=>'Se abọ','See the menu'=>'Wo akojọ aṣayan','From our kitchen'=>'Lati ibi idana wa','A short menu that changes with the seasons. Ask us about allergies: we are happy to adapt.'=>'Àtòjọ oúnjẹ kúkurú kan tí ń yí padà gẹ́gẹ́ bí àkókò ṣe rí. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ wa nípa àwọn ohun tí ń fa àìlera oúnjẹ: inú wa yóò dùn láti mú kí ó bá a mu.','Small plates'=>'Àwo kékeré','Charred flatbreads, cured meats and garden vegetables to start.'=>'Akàrà fẹlẹfẹlẹ tó jona diẹ, ẹran tí a pa mọ́, àti ẹ̀fọ́ ọgbà láti bẹ̀rẹ̀.','From the fire'=>'Lati inu ina','Whole fish, aged steaks and roasted vegetables from the wood oven.'=>'Ẹja gidi, àwọn ẹran tí wọ́n ti pọ́n (aged steaks), àti àwọn ẹ̀fọ́ tí a sè nínú ìkokò igi.','Fresh pasta'=>'Pasta tuntun','Made by hand every morning, served with seasonal sauces.'=>'A fi ọwọ́ ṣe é ní gbogbo òwúrọ̀, a sì ń fi omi-bẹ̀bẹ̀ tí ó bá àkókò mu ṣọ́ ọ lọ́wọ́.','Desserts'=>'Àwọn oúnjẹ alùdù','Tarts, ices and a cheese board from local makers.'=>'Àwọn tarts, ices àti àpótọ̀ kílììṣì láti ọwọ́ àwọn oníṣòwò asepọ̀ agbègbè.','Set lunch'=>'Ṣeto ounjẹ ọsan','Two or three courses at a fixed price, Tuesday to Friday.'=>'Awọn iṣẹ́ ẹ̀kọ́ meji tabi mẹta ni owo ti o wa titi, lati Ọjọ Ìṣẹgun si Ọjọ Ẹtì.','Private dining'=>'Gbọngan ìjẹun ikọkọ','A private room for up to 18 guests with a tailored menu.'=>'Yàrá aládàánì fún àwọn àlejò tó tó méjìdínlógún (18) pẹ̀lú àkójọ àwọn oúnjẹ tí a pèsè sílẹ̀ pàtàkì.','SaaS Product'=>'Ọja SaaS','Is there a free plan?'=>'Ṣé ètò ọ̀fẹ́ wà?','Yes, free for small teams, and every paid plan starts with a 14-day trial.'=>'Bẹẹni, o jẹ ọfẹ fun awọn ẹgbẹ kekere, ati pe gbogbo ètò ti o sanwo bẹrẹ pẹlu idanwo ọjọ 14.','Can I cancel any time?'=>'Ṣe mo lè fagile nígbàkúùgbà?','Yes. Monthly plans can be cancelled at any time.'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni. A lè fagile àwọn ètò oṣooṣù ní ìgbà èyíkéyìí.','Where is my data stored?'=>'Nibo ni a ti n tọju data mi?','In secure, encrypted data centres, with daily backups.'=>'Nínú àwọn ilé ìpamọ́ dátà tó ní ààbò, tí a fi ẹ̀rọ ìpamọ́kọ̀ kọ̀, pẹ̀lú àwọn àwòkọ ẹ̀dà ojoojúmọ́.','Everything your team needs'=>'Gbogbo ohun ti ẹgbẹ rẹ nilo','Boards and timelines'=>'Awọn awo and àkókò-ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀','Switch between kanban boards and timelines in one click.'=>'Yipada laarin awọn apero kanban ati awọn aago ni tẹ kan soso.','Automations'=>'Àwọn ìṣètò aláìlẹ̀ṣẹ','Move tasks, assign owners and send reminders automatically.'=>'Gbe awọn iṣẹ ṣiṣe, yiyan awọn oniwun ati firanṣẹ awọn et leti laifọwọyi.','Shared files'=>'Awọn aṣọ kikoṣe','Keep documents next to the work they belong to.'=>'Tọju awọn iwe-ipamọ sẹgbẹ iṣẹ ti wọn jẹ mọ.','Reports'=>'Àwọn Ìròyìn','Live dashboards for workload, progress and deadlines.'=>'Awọn dasibodu laaye fun iṣẹ-ṣiṣe, ilọsiwaju ati awọn akoko ipari.','Integrations'=>'Àwọn Ìsopọ̀','Connect the email, chat and storage tools you already use.'=>'So awọn irinṣẹ imeeli, aṣọ (chat) ati ibi ipamọ ti o ti n lo tẹlẹ.','Security'=>'Ààbò','Single sign-on, audit logs and encrypted data.'=>'Ìwọlé ẹnì kan, àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ àyẹ̀wò àti data tí a fipamọ́ fún ààbò.','14-day free trial, no card needed'=>'Idanwo ọfẹ fun ọjọ mẹrinla, ko si kaadi ti o nilo','Plan projects, not spreadsheets'=>'Gbèrò àwọn iṣẹ́, kìí ṣe àwọn tábìlì ìṣirò','One workspace for tasks, deadlines and files. Your team sees what matters today, and you see progress without asking for updates.'=>'Ibùṣẹ iṣẹ kan ṣoṣo fún àwọn iṣẹ́, àkókò ìkẹyìn, àti àwọn fáìlì. Ẹgbẹ́ rẹ rí ohun tó ṣe pàtàkì lónìí, ìwọ sì rí ìtẹ̀síwájú láìbéèrè fún àwọn ìsọfonni tuntun.','Start free trial'=>'Bẹrẹ ìdánwò ọ̀fẹ́','See features'=>'Wo awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ','Up and running in minutes'=>'Ó ti ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ láàárín ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀','Create a workspace'=>'Ṣẹ́dì agbègbè iṣẹ́','Sign up and invite your team in minutes.'=>'Forukọsilẹ ki o pe ẹgbẹ rẹ ni iṣẹju diẹ.','Import your work'=>'Gbe iṣẹ rẹ wọle','Bring tasks in from a spreadsheet or another tool.'=>'Mu awọn iṣẹ wa lati inu iwe pẹlẹpẹlẹ tabi irinṣẹ miiran.','Get moving'=>'Bẹrẹ irin-ajo rẹ','Templates and automations do the busywork.'=>'Àwọn àdàkọ àti ìṣètò lẹ́ẹ̀kan-fún- gbogbo ṣe iṣẹ́ alárèéṣe náà.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'A kọ̀ ọ́ lọ́wọ́ láti ṣàtúnṣe ohun yìí.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'A kò yọ̀ǹda fún ọ láti ṣe èyí.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'A ti pa ipo àìléwu rẹ (Safe mode) kúrò nítorí kò bá ìwọlé rẹ mu mọ́. Ṣe àtúnṣe ojú-ewé náà.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Olùṣàkóso nìkan ni ó lè lo ipò àìléwu.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Ipo ààbò nílò ìwọlé aṣàwákiri déédéé.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'A kò lè ṣètò ipò àìléwu.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Modo ailewu nilo aṣẹ kikọ si folda wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Ipo ailewu ko le kọ si folda wp-content/mu-plugins.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Ojú-ewé yẹn kò sí, tàbí a ti pa á rẹ́.','Sandwich Studio works with the block editor, and the block editor is switched off for this item. A plugin such as Classic Editor does that: allow the block editor for this item in its settings (Settings → Writing), then open Sandwich Studio again.'=>'Sandwich Studio nṣiṣẹ pẹlu olùṣàtúnṣe blọọku, ati pe a ti pa olùṣàtúnṣe blọọku yìí fun ohun elo yii. Pẹpẹ kan bi Classic Editor n ṣe bẹẹ: jẹ ki olùṣàtúnṣe blọọku ṣiṣẹ fun ohun elo yii ninu awọn eto rẹ (Eto → Kíkọ), lẹhinna ṣii Sandwich Studio lẹẹkan si.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ẹ bẹ̀ ọ́, a ò fún ọ ní àṣẹ láti ṣe àtúnṣe sí ohun èlò yìí ní Sandwich Studio.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'A kò mọ Sandwich Studio. Tun fi plọọgi-in ná sori ẹrọ rẹ.','Add title'=>'Fi akọle kun','Type / to choose a block'=>'Tẹ / láti yan bálóòkùù','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Ṣíṣe ìgbékalẹ̀ Sandwich Studio…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio nilo JavaScript. Lo olootu deede dipo rẹ.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Ṣatọ “%s” pẹlu Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe pẹ̀lú Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Fọ́tò tí kò ní ohunkóhun lórí rẹ̀','Skip to content'=>'Fò lọ sí apá tí ó ní àkóópọ̀','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Ìgbòòrò wídìí (tablet width) gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ nọ́mbà pípé ti píhẹ̀sì láti 480 dé 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Fífẹ̀ mobile gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ nọ́mbà pípé ti àwọn pixel, ó kéré tán 240 ó sì kéré sí fífẹ̀ tablet náà.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Ikọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan tí a ṣe àṣàyàn rẹ̀ nílò id tirẹ̀: àwọn lẹ́tà kékeré 2 sí 12 tàbí àwọn nọ́mbà, tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Àfọwọ́ṣe breakpoint kan nlo boya soke si iwọn kan (200 si 4000 pixels) tabi lati iwọn kan (200 si 6000 pixels), ki i ṣe mejeeji.','Tablet'=>'Peleti','Mobile'=>'Alagbeka','Site design'=>'Apẹrẹ aaye','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀, àwọn fọ́ǹtì, àwọn àṣà àti ìrísí tí wọ́n pín fún gbogbo ojú ewé lórí ojú alagbeka náà àti fún ti àkòrí rẹ.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'A ko le ṣii awọn àṣà agbaye ti oju-iwe naa.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Fọntì yẹn kí n ṣe ọ̀kan lára ​​àwọn fọntì ojú-wọ̀ọ́gbùn náà.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Àwùjọ àwọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan nílò orúkọ àrà ọ̀tọ̀ tí a fi àwọn lẹ́tà kékeré, nọ́mbà, àti àmì ìfàmọ̀ ìsopọ̀ ṣe.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Àwọ̀ "%s" kì í ṣe àwọ̀ CSS tó wúlè.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Gbọdọ jẹ pe lẹta kọọkan ni orúkọ alailẹgbẹ ti a fi lẹta kekere, nọmba ati hyphen ṣe.','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Stack fonti fún "%s" lè ní àwọn orúkọ fonti, àwọn àmì ìtọ́kasí, àwọn àmì ìkọ̀silẹ̀, àti ààyè nìkan.','Uploaded icons'=>'Àwọn àmì tó ti wọlé','Icon'=>'Àmì','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Fáìlì yìí kò jẹ́ àmì ìdánimọ̀ SVG kan tí a lè lò. Ó lè jẹ́ pé ó bàjẹ́, tàbí pé ó ní àwọn ohun àkóópọ̀ nìkan nínú tí a ti yọ kúrò fún ààbò (àwọn ìwé afọwọkọ, àwọn àsopọ̀, àwọn àwòrán tàbí fọ́ǹtì tí a fi sínú rẹ̀).','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'A kò lè pa àmì náà rẹ́.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'bọtìn ìwé-àṣẹ','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'A ko tii fi olumulo kan sopọ pọ mọ iwe-ašẹ náà, èyí ti o ṣe pataki lati ṣe idiwọ imuṣiṣẹ laisi aṣẹ. Lati sọ iwe-aṣẹ náà bayii fun olumulo rẹ, o gba lati pin orukọ kikun ati adirẹsi imeeli olumulo WordPress rẹ.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'awọn aaye ti a mẹnuba loke','Account'=>'Akawọ','Account Details'=>'Àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ Àkáántì','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Amuroyẹ rẹ wa ni isunmọ lati muu ṣiṣẹ. Jọwọ ṣayẹwo imeeli rẹ ki o tẹ ọna asopọ naa lati muu amuroyẹ rẹ ṣiṣẹ lẹhinna tun fọọmu alabaṣepọ ranṣẹ lẹẹkan si.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ṣé o fẹ́ láti da %1$s pọ̀ mọ́ %2$s?','Actions'=>'Àwọn Ìgbésẹ̀','Activate'=>'Mu ṣiṣẹ́','Activate Free Version'=>'Mu Ẹya Ọfẹ Ṣiṣẹ','Activate License'=>'Mu Ìwé-àṣẹ ṣiṣẹ','activate a license here'=>'mú ìwé-àṣẹ ṣiṣẹ́ níhìn-ín','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ bọ́tìnnì ìwé-àṣẹ tí o gbà nínú imeeli lẹ́yìn rira náà tààrà:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Mú kíìsìnáìsì náà ṣiṣẹ́ lórí gbogbo àwọn ojú òpó w