ọ ati mu ṣiṣẹ kuro ninu apoti. Laanu, cURL ko ṣiṣẹ (vtabẹ ko lagbara) lori ṣeefa rẹ.','data'=>'data','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'A ti yọọ t\'iwọ̀nyí sípò iṣẹ́ aṣìṣe (debug mode) yoo si parẹ laifọwọyọ ni iṣẹju 60. O tun le pa a run ni kutukutu nipa titẹ ọna asopọ "Stop Debug" náà.','Date'=>'Ọjọ́','Deactivate'=>'Mu kuro niṣẹ','Deactivate the free version'=>'Pa ẹ̀yà ọfẹ́ náà kúrò láìṣiṣẹ́ mọ́','Deactivate License'=>'Mú ìwé-àṣẹ kúrò níṣẹ́','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Gbígbé ìwé àṣẹ rẹ kúrò yóò dí gbogbo àwọn ànímọ̀ pàtàkì lọ́nà, ṣùgbọ́n yóò jẹ́ kí ó ṣe é ṣe láti mú ìwé àṣẹ náà ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojú òpó wẹ́bù mìíràn. Ṣé o dá a lójú pé o fẹ́ tẹ̀ síwájú?','Deactivation'=>'Ìṣeàìmúṣẹ','Yes - %s'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Fi silẹ & %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Pipa tabi mimu %s kuro yoo jẹ ki iwe-aṣẹ naa dẹkun iṣẹ laifọwọyi, eyiti o le lo lori aaye miiran.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Bí o bá ní àkókò díẹ̀, jọ̀wọ́ jẹ́ kí á mọ̀ pé kí lo dé tí o fi jẹ́ %s','Debug Log'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ Ìṣòro-wíwá','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Ṣíṣe àtúnṣe aṣìṣe','delegate'=>'fi funni ni aṣẹ','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Tí o bá tẹ́ ẹ, a ó fi ìpinnu yìí lé àwọn alábòjútó ojú-opó wọ̀nyí lọ́wọ́.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Fi le lọ si Awọn olutọju Aaye','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'Fi lé Àwọn Olùṣàkóso Ìtàkùn & Tẹ̀síwájú','Delegating, please wait'=>'Fífúnni níṣẹ́ lọ, jọ̀wọ́ dúró','verbDelete'=>'Paarun','Delete All Accounts'=>'Pa gbogbo awọn akọọlẹ rẹ jẹ','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Ṣe o ni idaniloju pe o fẹ pa gbogbo data Freemius rẹ́