i fáìlù kún un.','Please choose at least one.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ yan o kere ju ọkan lọ.','Please agree to continue.'=>'Jọwọ gba lati tẹsiwaju.','This field is required.'=>'Aaye yii se pataki.','Please use at most %d characters.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ lò pọ̀ jù lọ àwọn lẹ́tà %d.','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ adirẹsi imeeli ti o wulo sii.','Please enter a valid web address.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ adirẹsi wẹbu to wulo sii.','Please enter a valid phone number.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ nọ́mbà tẹlifoonu tó péye.','Please enter a number.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ nọmba kan sii.','Please enter a number in the allowed range.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ nọmba kan wọle laarin iwọn ti a gba laaye.','Please enter a valid date.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ ọjọ to tọ sii.','Please choose one of the options.'=>'Jọwọ yan ọkan ninu awọn aṣayan naa.','The file could not be uploaded. Please try again.'=>'Ko le ṣe igbasilẹ faili naa. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','The file is too large (at most %d MB).'=>'Fáìlì náà tóbi jù (ó kéré tán %d MB).','This type of file is not accepted here.'=>'A ko gba iru faili yii nibi.','This form is no longer available.'=>'Fọ́mù yìí kò sí mọ́.','This form was open for a long time. Please send it again.'=>'Fọ́ọ̀mù yìí ti wà ní ṣíṣílẹ̀ fún ìgbà pípẹ́. Jọ̀wọ́ fi ránṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Too many submissions. Please wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Ọpọlọpọ àwọn ìfọwọ́sọ́pọ̀ jù. Jọ̀wọ́ dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí o sì tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan si.','Please check the highlighted fields.'=>'Jọwọ ṣayẹwo awọn aaye ti a tẹ numọ.','Thank you. Your message has been sent.'=>'Ẹ ṣe ni. A ti rán iṣẹ́ rẹ si.','Send'=>'Fi ranṣẹ','Leave this field empty'=>'Fi aaye yii si afoju','Back'=>'Padà','Please choose an option.'=>'Jọwọ yan aṣayan kan.','The form could not be sent. Please check your connection and try again.'=>'A ko le fi fọọmu naa ranṣẹ. Jọwọ ṣayẹwo asopọ rẹ ki o tun gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','Sending…'=>'Ńfiṣẹ́ ránṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́...','Choose…'=>'Yan…','You cannot edit that page.'=>'O o le ṣatunkọ oju-iwe yẹn.','You cannot publish pages.'=>'O ko le tẹ awọn oju-iwe jade.','The form could not be saved.'=>'A kò lè fi fọ́ọ̀mù náà pamọ́.','That form is not on that page.'=>'Fọ́ọ̀mù yẹn kò sí lórí ojú ewé yẹn.','You cannot publish popups.'=>'O le o tẹ awọn agbejade jade.','The popup could not be saved.'=>'A kò lè fi àpótí ojú-wé yìí pamọ́.','That page does not exist.'=>'Ojú-ewé yẹn kò sí.','Popups'=>'Àwọn àgbékẹ̀gbẹ́','Popup'=>'Awon oju-iwe ti n yọ jade','Add popup'=>'Fi agbejade kun','Edit popup'=>'Ṣatunkọ popup naa','No popups yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí àwọn pópù kankan rárá.','Form submissions'=>'Àwọn tí a fi sílẹ nínú fóómù','Form submission'=>'Ifihan fọọmu','No submissions yet.'=>'Ko si awọn ifisilẹ kankan sibẹsibẹ.','Search submissions'=>'Àwọn ìfọwọ́sọ́pọ̀ ìwádìí','Submitted values'=>'Àwọn ohun tí a fi sílẹ̀','Sent from %s'=>'A fi ranṣẹ láti %s','Webhook'=>'Webhook','Mailing list'=>'Àtòjọ ìfiránṣẹ́','sent'=>'firanṣẹ','failed'=>'kù sí ikùn','Submission'=>'Ìfihàn','The file is no longer available.'=>'Ko si faili naa mọ.','Export CSV'=>'Gbe CSV jade','There are no live reviews here.'=>'Ko si awọn atunyẹwo gidi nibi.','Too many requests. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Awọn ibeere pọ ju. Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si ni iṣẹju diẹ.','That is not a Google place ID. It looks like ChIJN1t_tDeuEmsRUsoyG83frY4.'=>'Iyẹn kii ṣe ID aye ti Google. O dabi ChIJN1t_tDeuEmsRUsoyG83frY4.','That is not a Trustpilot business unit ID. It is 24 letters and digits, from your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Iyẹn kii ṣe ID ẹka iṣowo Trustpilot. O jẹ awọn lẹta 24 ati nọmba, lati akọọlẹ Iṣowo Trustpilot rẹ.','That does not look like an API key: it should be one line of letters, digits and symbols, with no spaces.'=>'Ìyẹn kò rí bí bọ́tìnnì API: ó yẹ kí ó jẹ́ ìlà kan ṣoṣo tí ó ní àwọn lẹ́tà, nọ́mbà àti àmì, láìsí ààyè kankan.','Google reviews are not set up.'=>'A ko ti toju Google reviews sílẹ̀.','The review service could not be reached. The last reviews stay on the site; the next refresh tries again.'=>'A kò lè dé bá iṣẹ́ àyẹ̀wò náà. Àwọn àyẹ̀wò tó kẹ́yìn wà lórí ojú-wẹ́bù náà; ìgbà tó tẹ̀ lé e tí a tún ṣe àyẹ̀wò yóò tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The review service refused the request (HTTP %d). Check the API key and the ID.'=>'Iṣẹ àyẹ̀wò náà kọ̀ láti gbà ìbéèrè náà (HTTP %d). Ṣàyẹ̀wò bọ́tìkì API àti ID náà.','The review service says the API quota is used up. The last reviews stay on the site.'=>'Iṣẹ àyẹ̀wọ̀ sọ pé ìpín API ti tán. Awọn àyẹ̀wọ̀ tó kẹhin yoo wa lori aaye naa.','The review service answered with an error (HTTP %d). The last reviews stay on the site.'=>'Iṣẹ abojuto naa fesi pẹlu aṣiṣe kan (HTTP %d). Awọn abojuto ti o kẹhin wa sori aaye naa.','We are doing some maintenance on this site. Please check back soon.'=>'A n ṣe iṣẹ atunṣe lori aaye yii lọwọlọwọ. Jọwọ ṣayẹwo lẹẹkan si laipẹ.','This site is launching soon.'=>'Aaye yii n bọ laipẹ.','Maintenance mode is on'=>'Ọ̀nà ìtọ́jú wà ní títàn','Pre-launch mode is on'=>'Ipò ṣaju ìfilọlẹ ti tan','Network templates'=>'Àwọn àdàkọ ẹnì netiwọ́kì','That find-and-replace job no longer exists.'=>'Iṣẹ wa-ati-rọ́pò yẹn kò sí mọ́.','That step is not available for this job right now.'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ yẹn kò sí fún iṣẹ́ yìí báyìí.','Enter what to find.'=>'Tẹ ohun ti o fẹ wa.','Colours must be hex codes such as #1a73e8 or #fff.'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀ gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ kóòdù hex bíi #1a73e8 tàbí #fff.','The new link must be a full web address (https://…), a path starting with /, or an anchor starting with #.'=>'Ọna asopọ tuntun gbọdọ jẹ adirẹsi wẹẹbu ni kikun (https://…), ọna ti o bẹrẹ pẹlu /, tabi aṣakoko ti o bẹrẹ pẹlu #.','Client review comments'=>'Àwọn àlàyé àtúnyẹ̀wò oníbàárà','Write a comment first.'=>'Kọ àlàyé kan ní àkọkọ.','Client'=>'Onibara','That comment no longer exists.'=>'Àlàyé náà kò sí mọ́.','New review comment on “%s”'=>'Àlàyé àyẹ̀wò tuntun lórí “%s”','%1$s wrote:

%2$s

Open the page in the editor to answer or resolve it:
%3$s'=>'%1$s kọ:

%2$s

Ṣii oju-iwe naa ninu oluṣatunṣe lati dahun tabi yanju rẹ:
%3$s','This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one.'=>'Ọna asopọ atunyẹwo yii ko wulo mọ. Bi o tilẹ jẹ pe o le beere fun tuntun kan.','Too many comments from this link in the last hour. Try again later.'=>'Àwọn àlàyé púpọ̀ jù lọ wá láti ọ̀nà àjápọ̀ yìí ní wákàtí tó kọjá. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i nígbà míì.','Your role cannot create templates or patterns.'=>'Ipa rẹ ko le ṣẹda awọn awoṣe tabi awọn apẹẹrẹ.','You can change the text and images on this page, but not its layout or design. Your change was not saved.'=>'O le yipada ọrọ ati awọn aworan lori oju-iwe yii, ṣugbọn kii ṣe apẹrẹ tabi iṣeto rẹ. A ko fipamọ iyipada rẹ.','Your role cannot change styles. Undo the style changes and save again.'=>'Ko le yipada awọn àṣà ipa rẹ. Fa awọn ayipada àṣà naa sẹhin ki o tun fipamọ lẹẹkansi.','Your role cannot add or change custom code (custom CSS or HTML blocks). Undo those changes and save again.'=>'Ipò rẹ ko le fi kún tabi yipada koodu aṣa (CSS aṣa tabi awọn apoti HTML). Mu awọn ayipada wọnyẹn kuro ki o tun fi pamọ lẹẹkansi.','This is not an export file from this plugin.'=>'Èyí kì í ṣe fáìlì ìwọlé láti inú plọ́ọ̀gìn yìí.','This export file was made by a newer version of the plugin. Update the plugin on this site, then import it again.'=>'Wọ́n fi ẹ̀yà tuntun tiplọ́gì̀n yìí ṣe fáìlì ìkejáde yìí. Ṣe imudojuiwọn plọ́gì̀n náà lórí ojula yii, lẹhinna tun gbe e wọle lẹẹkansi.','The export file is damaged: its list of items is missing.'=>'Fáìlì wíwọlé náà bàjẹ́: àkọsílẹ̀ àwọn ohun èlò rẹ̀ ti sọnù.','The export file is damaged or was edited after it was made (its checksum does not match). Export it again from the other site.'=>'Fáìlì wíwọlé náà ti bà jẹ́ tàbí a ti yí i padà lẹ́yìn tí a dá a (àmì ìfẹsẹ̀ẹ́ rẹ̀ kò bá mu). Tun wọlé rẹ̀ jade láti ojula miiran.','“%s” was not imported: this site does not have that kind of item.'=>'A kò kó “%s” wọlé: ojula yii ko ni iru ohun kan na.','“%s” was not imported: you are not allowed to create that kind of item.'=>'A ko gbe “%s” wọle: a o gba ọ laaye lati ṣẹda iru ohun kan bẹẹ.','“%s” was not replaced: you are not allowed to edit the one on this site.'=>'A kò rọ́pò “%s”: a ò gba ọ láyè láti ṣàtúnṣe èyí tí ó wà lórí ojú-wẹ́bù yìí.','“%1$s” was not imported: %2$s'=>'“%1$s” ko wọlé: %2$s','Settings were not imported: only an administrator can change them.'=>'A ko wọ àwọn ètò ná الأصل: olùṣàkóso nìkan ló lè yí wọn pa dà.','The image %1$s was not copied: %2$s'=>'A ko da aworan %1$s kọọ: %2$s','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Tun fi awọn imọran ti o farasin han lori Ìpamọ́ lẹẹkansi','%d selected'=>'%d ti yan','Nothing matches.'=>'Ko si ohun ti o baamu.','Select all on this page'=>'Yan ohun gbogbo lori oju-iwe yii','Select'=>'Yan','Pages'=>'Àwọn Ojúewé','Previous'=>'Tẹ́lẹ̀','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ojú-ìwé %1$d ti %2$d','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'Ṣètì %s ní ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀','Start setup'=>'Bẹrẹ iṣeto','This site'=>'Ojula yii','Edition'=>'Àtúnṣe','Sites on this licence'=>'Awọn oju opo wẹẹbu lori iwe-ašẹ yii','Version'=>'Ẹya','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Eyi dabi ẹni pe o jẹ ajọṣepọ tabi ẹ̀ka agbegbe, nitorina ko ni lo aaye kan lori iwe-ašẹ rẹ.','See what Pro adds'=>'Wo ohun ti Pro fi kun un','Go to'=>'Lọ sí','Personal'=>'Ti ara ẹni','Business'=>'Onísòwò','Agency'=>'Ilé-iṣẹ́ ajọ','Any number of sites'=>'Gbogbo iye awọn oju opo wẹẹbu','Unlimited sites'=>'Àwọn ojula aláìlópin','%d site'=>'%d ojula','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'Ayẹwo %s','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Ìdánwò rẹ ti bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ṣe àtúnṣe ojú-ewé náà láti rí gbogbo ẹ̀yà ara Pro.','The trial could not be started.'=>'A kò lè bẹ̀rẹ̀ àdánwò náà.','Feature'=>'Ẹ̀yà ara','Your licence'=>'Ìwé-àṣẹ rẹ','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%1$d ninu %2$d ti n lo','Renews'=>'Túnṣe rẹ̀','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀dà ìpìlẹ̀ (staging), ìdánwò, ati localhost ti ojú-opó kan jẹ́ ọ̀fẹ́, wọn kì í sì í ka sí i nínú àlà ojú-opó rẹ.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Ètò rẹ pẹ̀lú ìtìlẹ́yìn àkọ́kọ́.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Ṣàkóso ìwé-àṣẹ àti owó rẹ','Get more with Pro'=>'Gbà jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ pẹ̀lú Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Bẹrẹ idanwo ọfẹ ọjọ %d, ko si kaadi ti o nilo','See plans and prices'=>'Wo awọn eto ati awọn owo rẹ','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Lo Tranzly ati Page Builder Sandwich papọ? Apapọ naa ni awọn afikun Pro mejeeji ninu fun idiyele kekere.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Ìwé àṣẹ rẹ ti parí. Sọ ọ́ di tuntun láti máa gba àwọn ìsọdọ̀tun àti àwọn ẹ̀yà Pro lọ́wọ́.','Renew now'=>'Se atunṣe ni isisiyi','Compare the plans'=>'Ṣe afiwe awọn ètò náà','Search features'=>'Àwọn ànímọ́ ìwárí','Area'=>'Agbègbè','Included in'=>'Wọn nínú','No feature matches.'=>'Kò sí ànímọ́ tí ó bá mu.','Features by plan'=>'Àwọn ànímọ́ nípa ètò iṣẹ́','Hide'=>'Pa mọ́','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Mú u ṣiṣẹ lori iboju Awọn afikun (Plugins)','Install it'=>'Fi sori ẹ','Overview'=>'Àkópọ̀','Setup'=>'Ìṣètò','Plans and licence'=>'Àwọn ètò àti ìwé àṣẹ','Add-ons'=>'Àfikún','Feedback'=>'Èsì','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Àכוֹyọ̀ rẹ kò lè se é gbà sí sílẹ̀.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'A kò lè fipamọ́ ipò ìṣètò náà.','Match my computer'=>'Bá kọmpútà mi mu','Light'=>'Imọlẹ','Dark'=>'Òkùnkùn','Colour scheme'=>'Àwòrán àwọ̀','Help'=>'Iranlowo','Guide to this screen'=>'Itọsọna si oju-iwo yii','Take the tour'=>'Gbà ìṣẹ̀wò náà','Get help or report a bug'=>'Gbà ìrànlọ́wọ́ tàbí jábọ̀ àṣìṣe kan','Plugin screens'=>'Awọn oju-iwe afikun','That could not be saved.'=>'Ko ṣe e fipamọ́ náà.','Before you contact support'=>'Ṣáájú kí o tó kàn sí ìrànlọ́wọ́','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Awon ibeere re ni a fi ranse lati ojula yi si %s, awon ti o se afikun yi. A n ranse:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'adirẹsi e-mail àti orúkọ rẹ, kí a lè dáhùn;','the subject and message you write;'=>'àkọlé àti ìránṣẹ́ tí o kọ;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'ID ìṣẹ́-oṣù rẹ, nítorí náà àwọn oníbàárà tí wọ́n ń sanwó ń gba àǹfààní àkọ́kọ́;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'kiki ti o ba fi aami si i: awọn alaye aaye (awọn ẹya WordPress ati PHP, akori, awọn afikun, apakan kan ti log aṣiṣe pẹlu awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle ati awọn adirẹsi e-mail ti yọ kuro), eyiti o le ka ṣaaju fifiranṣẹ;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'nikan ti o ba fi kun wọn: awọn ìwọlé fun aaye rẹ, ti a fipamọ sori aabo ati ti a paẹ rẹ 30 ọjọ lẹhin ti ibeere rẹ ti ni pipade.','I agree, continue'=>'Mo gba, tẹsiwaju','The connection could not be checked.'=>'A kò lè yẹ àsopọ̀ náà wò.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Ìyẹn ò ṣiṣẹ́. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Atileyin Zinn Digital® ti ge isopọ aaye yii.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Atileyin Zinn Digital® kò mọ ojula yii mọ.','You disconnected this site.'=>'O ti yọ aaye yii kuro.','Connect this site to support'=>'So pọ si ojula yii si atilẹyin','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'A ti sopọ. Awọn idahun lọ si %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Ko sopọ. O tun le firanṣẹ ibeere kan pẹlu adirẹsi imeeli rẹ ni isalẹ; sisopọ gba ọ laaye lati má ṣe tun tẹ e ni akoko kọọkan.','E-mail address'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli','Your name (optional)'=>'Oruko re (ti o ba fe)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Mo gba lati sopọ aaye yii pẹlu atilẹyin Zinn Digital®. O n ran adirẹsi aaye yii, awọn ẹya WordPress ati PHP ati ẹya pugin naa, o si le ge asopọ nigbakugba lati ibi tabi nipasẹ Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'So pọ̀','I need help'=>'Mo nilo iranlọwọ','Report a bug'=>'Ṣe ijabọ aṣiṣe kan','Send feedback'=>'Fi ero sílẹ̀','Request a feature'=>'Bere lọ́wọ́ fún ẹ̀yà kan','The site details could not be read.'=>'A kò lè ka àwọn àlàyé ojú òpó wọ̀nyí.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'A kò lè fi ìbéèrè rẹ ránṣẹ́. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i ní ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ sẹ́yìn.','WordPress admin'=>'Alámojútọ WordPress','File manager'=>'Olùṣàkóso fáìlì','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Èrò àti àwọn ìbéèrè fún àfikún ẹ̀yà','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'A ránṣẹ́. Ìtọ́kasí rẹ ni %s, ìdáhùn wa yóò sì dé nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì.','What is it about?'=>'Kini nipa rẹ?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Fidahun sí (imeeli)','Subject'=>'Àkọlé','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Kí lo ṣe, kí lo retí, kí sì ni ó wáyé dípò bẹ́ẹ̀?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Fi alaye aaye kun (awọn ẹya, akori, awọn afikun, apakan akọọlẹ aṣiṣe)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Wo gan-an ohun ti a ranṣẹ','Loading…'=>'Ó ń gbé wọlé…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Àwọn ìwọlé fún ìtìlẹ́yìn (kò pandan, a ti kó wọn pamọ́ pẹ̀lú ìpamọ́)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'A fi ìwọlé ránṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà rẹ̀ nìkan. Fi ara kan sílẹ̀ dípò kí o fi ìyẹn sílẹ̀ ní bọ́bọ́.','Login address'=>'Adirẹsi ìwọlé','Add a login'=>'Fi wọlé kún rẹ','Create a temporary support login'=>'Ṣẹda iwọle àtìlẹyìnfún ìgbà díẹ̀','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Olumulo lọtọ fun ẹgbẹ atilẹyin wa, laisi iwọle si awọn olumulo, fifi sori awọn afikun tabi ṣiṣatunkọ koodu. A pa a rẹ ni adaṣe nigbati o ba pari, tabi nigbakugba ti o ba sọ ọ di asan ni isalẹ.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Bẹẹni, fún ọjọ́ %d','The list could not be loaded.'=>'A le gbe àkọlé náa kalẹ̀.','That login could not be removed.'=>'A kò le yọ ìwọlé yẹn kúrò.','Temporary support logins'=>'Àwọnwọlé ìtìlẹ́yìn fún ìgbà díẹ̀','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Ko si. Atileyin le wole si aaye yii nikan ti o ba seda iwole kan nibi.','expired, being removed'=>'ti pari akoko re, a n yọ kuro','expires %s'=>'kọja akoko ni %s','Revoke now'=>'Fagile báyìí','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Igbese %1$d ti %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Pa ìrin-àjò náà mọ́lẹ̀','Everything in one place'=>'Gbogbo rẹ̀ ní ibi kan','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Awọn taabu wọnyi yori si gbogbo iboju ti pọọgi-in naa: iṣeto, awọn eto, iwe-ašẹ rẹ, iranlọwọ ati diẹ sii.','Help on every screen'=>'Iranlọwọ lori gbogbo iboju','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Ṣí àkójọ yìí fún ìtọ́sọ́nà sí ojú-ìwé tí o wà, ìtọjú yìí, tàbí láti béèrè ìrànlọ́wọ́ lọ́wọ́ wa.','Light or dark'=>'Imọlẹ tabi òkùnkùn','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Yan ìmọ́lẹ̀, òkùnkùn, tàbí kí o jẹ́ kí ó bá ti kọmpútà rẹ mu. A óò rántí àṣàyàn rẹ fún ìwọ nìkan.','Welcome'=>'Ẹ káàbọ̀','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Irin-ajo kukuru yii fihan ibi ti awọn nkan wa. O le jade kuro ninu rẹ nigbakugba pẹlu bọtini Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Ojula oju opo wẹẹti rẹ','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Ilọsiwaju iṣeto ati eto rẹ ni a fihan nibi, pẹlu ohun ti o tẹle ti o tọ lati ṣe.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Ètò rẹ, iye àwọn ojú-wọ́gbẹ̀ ti ó bo, àti pé bóya ẹ̀dà ojú-wọ́gbẹ̀ yìí ka sí iye tó ní lọ́kàn.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Gbiyanju Pro tabiṣe igbega si ipele giga','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Bẹrẹ ìdánwò ọ̀fẹ́ láìní káàdì, mú kí ó sunwọ̀n sí i, tàbí sọ di tuntun, gbogbo rẹ̀ láti ibi yìí.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Gbogbo ẹ̀ya àti ètò tí ó ní i nínú. Wá ẹ̀ya kan tàbí fi agbègbè kan hàn ní ẹ̀ẹ̀kan.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Àfikún láti ọwọ́ Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Awọn ohun itanna ti o ṣiṣẹ pẹlu eyi, ati awọn iṣẹ lati ẹgbẹ kanna. Awọn kaadi ti o farasin ni awọn iboju miiran ni a le tun fi han nibi.','Connect for faster help'=>'So pọ̀ mọ́ra fún ìrànlọ́wọ́ tó yára jù','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Asopọ jẹ aṣayan. O jẹ ki o firanṣẹ awọn ibeere laisi titẹ imeeli rẹ ni akoko kọọkan, ati pe o le ge asopọ nigbakugba ti o ba fẹ.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni ìrànlọ́wọ́ tàbí jábọ̀ àṣìṣe kan','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Ṣapejuwe ohun ti o ṣẹlẹ. O yan boya lati so alaye aaye pọ, ati pe o le rii daju deede ohun ti o ni ninu ni akọkọ.','Temporary support access'=>'Ìwọ̀lé ìtìlẹ́yìn fún ìgbà díẹ̀','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Tí àwọn olùrànlọ́wọ́ bá nílò láti wọ inú ojú-wọ̀ọ̀sùn rẹ, dá ìwọ̀lé-sílẹ̀ fúngbà-díẹ̀ sílẹ̀ níbí. Ó ń pa ara rẹ̀ rẹ́ nígbà tí àkókò bá parí, o sì lè yọ ọ́ kúrò nígbàkigbà.','Tell us what to build'=>'Sọ fún wa ohun tí a ó kọ́','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Fi èrò, ìbéèrè fún ẹ̀yà kan tàbí ìdáhùn èyíkéyìí ránṣẹ́. Ó lọ taara sí ẹgbẹ́ náà.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Eyi gba iṣẹju diẹ yoo si ṣeto %s ki o le ṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii lẹsẹkẹsẹ. O le yipada ohun gbogbo nigbamii.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'O ti ṣetan. Bí ohunkohun kò bá ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí a ṣe retí rẹ̀, a wa lójú kanṣoṣo.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ %1$d nínú %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Paríwò','Skip setup'=>'Fò ètò lọ','Import “%s”'=>'Wọlé “%s”','%d page imported.'=>'%d oju-iwe ti wọle.','edit'=>'ṣatitun','Pages to import'=>'Awọn oju-iwe lati wọle','Publish the pages now (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Ṣe àtẹ̀jade àwọn ojú-ewé na báyìí (bí kò bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́ a óò pamọ́ wọn gẹ́gẹ́ bí àkọọ́lẹ̀ àkọ́kọ́)','Use the kit’s home page as the site’s front page'=>'Lo oju-ewe ile ohun elo gẹgẹ bi oju-ewe iwaju aaye naa','Create a menu with the imported pages'=>'Da akojọ aṣayan kan pẹlu awọn oju-iwe ti a gbe wọle','Importing never changes your existing pages. Importing the same kit again updates the pages it created before.'=>'Iwonu ko ni yi awọn oju-iwe rẹ ti o wa tẹlẹ pada. Iwonu ohun elo kanna lẹẹkansi ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn oju-iwe ti o ṣẹda tẹlẹ.','Import'=>'Wọlé','Complete websites you can import in one click: pages, sections and a menu, ready for your own words and pictures. Kits come from Zinn Digital® and new ones are added every month.'=>'Àwọn ojú òpó wẹ́bù pípé o lè gbé wọlé ní ìtẹ́lé kan ṣoṣo: àwọn ojú ìwé, àwọn apá àti àkójọ aṣààyàn, tí ó ti ṣetan fún àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àti àwọn àwòrán rẹ. Àwọn ohun èlò wá láti ọwọ́ Zinn Digital® àti pé a nfi àwọn titun kún un oṣù kọọkan.','Search kits'=>'Wá àwọn ohun èlò kíti','Category'=>'Ẹka','All categories'=>'Gbogbo ẹ̀ka','Free and Pro'=>'Ọfẹ ati Pro','Go Pro to import'=>'Lo Pro lati gbe wọle','No kit matches these filters.'=>'Kò sí ohun èlò tí ó bá àwọn àlẹmọ wọ̀nyí mu.','My library'=>'Ilé-kíkọ́ mi','Team'=>'Ẹgbẹ́','Storage'=>'Ibùpamọ́','Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital® quota applies.'=>'Awon ika si o wa ninu apoiho ipamọ rẹ, nitorina ko si kuota Zinn Digital® ti o kan.','%1$s of %2$s used (%3$d%%)'=>'%1$s ninu %2$s ti a lo (%3$d%%)','%1$d of %2$d designs · up to %3$s per design · images are resized to 2560 px and stored once'=>'%1$d ninu %2$d awọn apẹrẹ · o to %3$s fun apẹrẹ kọọkan · a tun iwọn awọn aworan ṣe si 2560 px a si fipamọ wọn lẹẹkanọṣo','Deleted from your library.'=>'Ti parẹ kuro ninu ile-ikawe rẹ.','Save any section or page from the editor: open the block’s ⋮ menu and choose “Save to cloud library”. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.'=>'Fipamọ apakan tabi oju-iwe eyikeyi lati inu olutunṣe: ṣii akoṣọ ⋮ bulọọki naa ki o si yan “Fipamọ si ile-ikawe awọṣẹ”. Fi awọn apẹrẹ ti a fipamọ sinu lati inu igbimọ ile-ikawe Awọṣẹ ti o wa ninu olutunṣe, sori eyikeyi ninu awọn aaye ayelujara rẹ.','Show'=>'Fi hàn','Everything'=>'Gbogbo rẹ̀','Sections'=>'Apakan','Styles'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀dà irísí','Size'=>'Iwọn','Nothing saved yet.'=>'Kò tíì fipamọ́ kankan.','Delete'=>'Paarun','Write a test file'=>'Kọ fáìlì ìdánwò lọ́wọ́','Read it back'=>'Ka a pada','Delete it'=>'Pa rẹ rẹ','In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example “my-pbs-library”). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.'=>'Nínú daṣíbọ̀dù Cloudflare rẹ, ṣí R2 Object Storage kí o sì ṣẹ̀dá bọ́kítì kan (fún àpẹẹrẹ “my-pbs-library”). Jẹ́ kí ó wà ní ìkọkọ̀: má ṣe sọ aṣọ mọ́ agbègbè gbogbo ènìyàn.','Open “Manage API tokens” in R2 and create an API token with “Object Read & Write” permission, limited to that one bucket.'=>'Ṣí “Manage API tokens” nínú R2 kí o sì dá àmì ìdánimọ̀ API kan sílẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àṣẹ “Object Read & Write”, tí ó ní opin sí apágbé kan náà.','Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).'=>'Da ID Bọtini Wiwọle ati Bọtini Wiwọle Aṣiri ti o fihan (a fi aṣiri naa han lẹẹkan soso).','Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is “auto”.'=>'Ṣe ẹ̀akọ́ (copy) ìparí (endpoint) S3 fún àkáǹtì rẹ. Ó rí bí https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Agbègbè (region) náà jẹ́ "auto".','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.'=>'Ṣe àfikún àwọn iye wọnyi si isalẹ, fi pamọ́, lẹhinna tẹ “Test connection”. Yi ilé-kika pada si ibi ipamọ rẹ nikan nigbati idanwo naa ba kọja.','Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).'=>'Ṣẹda garawa ti ara ẹni pẹlu olupese rẹ (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO tabi eyikeyi iṣẹ ibaramu S3).','Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.'=>'Ṣẹ́dẹ̀ bọ́tínì ìwọ̀lé kan tí ó lè kà, kọ àti pa àwọn ohun inú bọ́tínì yẹn rẹ.','Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: https://s3.<region>.amazonaws.com) and the bucket’s region.'=>'Wa ibi-iwọle S3 (fun Amazon S3: https://s3.<region>.amazonaws.com) ati agbegbe agba fọọmu naa.','Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off “Path-style addresses”. Most other services use path-style.'=>'Amazon S3 nlo awọn adirẹsi ti a gbalejo foju: pa “Path-style addresses” (awọn adirẹsi aṣa-ọna). Ọpọlọpọ awọn iṣẹ miiran nlo aṣa-ọna.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”.'=>'Lẹ́yìn náà, kó awọn iye tí ó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ sinú, fi pamọ́, lẹ́yìn náà tẹ “Idanwo asopọ”.','Storage settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto ibi ipamọ.','Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital® storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital® quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital® storage.'=>'Awon ile-ka asiri afefe re wa ninu ibi ipamowọ Zinn Digital® pelu aaye ti eto re ni ninu. O le ma fi si Cloudflare R2 ti ara re tabi oko-ipamọ ti o ni ibamu pẹlu S3 dipo: nigbana kò si ipin Zinn Digital® ti yoo kan, ati pe gbogbo aaye ti o sopọ mọ oko-ipamọ kanna ni yoo pin ile-ka naa. Awọn ile-ka egbe nlo ibi ipamọ Zinn Digital® nigbagbogbo.','Connect your own storage: step by step'=>'So pọ ibi ipamọ rẹ: nípa ṣíṣe ìgbésẹ̀ báyìí','Another S3-compatible service'=>'Iṣẹ miiran ti o ni ibamu pẹlu S3','Read the full guide'=>'Ka itọsọna ni kikun','S3 endpoint'=>'Ibùdó S3','Bucket'=>'Apoti','Region'=>'Agbegbe','Cloudflare R2: auto.'=>'Cloudflare R2: aifọwọyi.','Access key ID'=>'ID bọtínì wọlé','Stored. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Ti fipamọ. Fi silẹ ni ofo lati tọju rẹ.','Secret access key'=>'Bọtìnì iwọle aṣiri','Stored encrypted on this site and never shown again. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'A fi ìpamọ́ pamọ́ pẹ̀lú ìdáàbòbò sori ojúewé yí tí a kò sì ní fi hàn mọ́ láé. Fi í sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo láti tọ́jú rẹ̀.','Stored encrypted on this site. It is never sent to Zinn Digital®.'=>'A tọ́ sí ojula yìí pẹ̀lu ìpamọ́ to muna. A kò fi ran Zinn Digital® rí láelae.','Path-style addresses'=>'Àwọn àdírẹ́sì tí ó rí bẹ́ẹ̀','Folder in the bucket'=>'Fálà nínú bọ́tììtì kẹ́tì','Save'=>'Fi pamọ́','Test connection'=>'Ìdánwò asopọ̀','Remove these settings'=>'Yọ awọn eto wọnyi kuro','Keep my library in this storage'=>'Fi ile-ikawe mi sori ibi ipamọ yii','The connection test passed.'=>'Ìdánwò ìsopọ̀ náà yọrí sí rere.','Run “Test connection” first.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ ṣe “Test connection”.','Invite a site'=>'Pe ojula kan','Who is it for? (optional)'=>'Ta ni ó jẹ́ fún? (aṣàyàn)','Access'=>'Wọlé','Use designs (read only)'=>'Lo awọn apẹrẹ (kika nikan)','Use and save designs'=>'Lo ati fipamọ awọn apẹrẹ','Create invite code'=>'Ṣẹ́ kóòdù ìpè','Give this code to the site owner. It works once, for 7 days, and is shown only now:'=>'Fún olówó ojú-wẹ́bù yìí ní kóòdù yìí. Ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan pépẹ́, fún ọjọ́ méje, a sì fi hàn báyìí nìkan:','Copy'=>'Daako','Members'=>'Àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́','No site has joined yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí ojú-wọ́wọ́ kankan tí ó ti darapọ̀ mọ́ra.','use and save'=>'lo ki o si fi pamọ́','read only'=>'kika nikan','Delete team'=>'Pa ẹgbẹ rẹ ĸúrọ','Delete this team and every design in its library?'=>'Ṣe o fẹ́ pa ẹgbẹ́ yìí rẹ́ àti gbogbo àwọn àwòrán apẹrẹ tó wà nínú ilé-ìkàwọ́ rẹ̀?','This site joined the team library.'=>'Ojula yii ti darapọ mọ ìkàwé ẹgbẹ naa.','This site uses the team library:'=>'Ojula yìí nlo ìkàwé ẹgbẹ́ náà:','Leave'=>'Fi silẹ','Join a team with an invite code'=>'Darapọ mọ ẹgbẹ kan pẹlu koodu ifiwepe kan','Join'=>'Darapọ̀ mọ́','Your teams'=>'Awọn ẹgbẹ rẹ','New team name'=>'Orúkọ ẹgbẹ́ tuntun','Create team'=>'Ṣẹ́ Ẹgbẹ́','Creating team libraries comes with the Agency plan.'=>'Ṣíṣẹ̀dá àwọn ilé kíkà sí i ti ẹgbẹ́ wà pẹ̀lú ètò Agency.','Save sections, pages and styles to your cloud library and reuse them on all your sites. Agencies can share a library with their team and clients. You can keep the library in Zinn Digital® storage or in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket.'=>'Fipamọ awọn apakan, awọn oju-iwe ati awọn aṣa si ile-ikawe awọsanma rẹ ki o tun lo wọn lori gbogbo awọn aaye rẹ. Awọn ile-iṣẹ le pin ile-ikawe kan pẹlu ẹgbẹ wọn ati awọn alabara. O le tọju ile-ikawe naa sinu ibi ipamọ Zinn Digital® tabi ninu Cloudflare R2 tirẹ tabi apo ibaramu S3.','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro'=>'Gba Page Builder Sandwich Pro','Website kits'=>'Àwọn ohun elo ojú opó wẹ́bù','Cloud library'=>'Ibi kika awọsanmọ','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Tirẹ nipasẹ Neil Lock, Alaga ti Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Ẹya %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Wọ́ọ̀bùsìtì Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Ojula oju opo wẹbusiti Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ẹ̀yà ara pamọ́.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Wo awọn ètò Pro ati awọn owo rẹ','Front-end output'=>'Abajade iwaju-ipari','Class name prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ orúkọ kílàsì','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Gbogbo orúkọ kilásì tí plọ́gìnnì náà tẹ̀ jáde sórí ojú ewé rẹ bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àfikún yìí, kí àwọn ojú ewé náà má bàa fi hàn pé èwo ni plọ́gìnnì tí ó kọ́ wọn. Lédè tàbí nọ́mbà kékeré 1 sí 8, tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan.','Beta updates'=>'Àwọn ohun ìgbàlejò tí wọ́n ṣẹ̀ṣẹ̀ ń dánwò','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ojula itanna yii n gba awọn ẹya beta gẹgẹ bi imudojuiwọn.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya iduro nikan.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Yi eyi pada sori oju-iwe Akawunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Awon ẹya beta ni a n fún awọn fifi sori ẹrọ Pro ti o ni iwe-ašẹ ti o si ni asopọ si akọọlẹ wọn. Ni kete ti o ba ni asopọ, o le darapọ mọ lati oju-iwe Akọọlẹ.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'Àwọn ibi ìfojúsùn ti fipamọ́. Àwọn ojúewé náà yóò mú àwọn ìbú tuntun náà nígbà tí wọ́n bá tún ṣí i.','Breakpoints'=>'Àwọn ìlà ìdúró','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Àwọn àṣà tí a ṣètò fún Tábìlì wúlò dé ìwọ̀n ìbú tábìlì, àti àwọn àṣà fún Móbìlì dé ìwọ̀n ìbú móbìlì. Àwọn àṣà Desktop wúlò ní gbogbo ibòmíràn.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Tábìlì: tó pọ̀ jù (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Alagbeka: o pọ ju (px) lọ','Save breakpoints'=>'Fipamọ awọn aaye iduro','Use the default widths'=>'Lo awọn iwọn aiyipada','Settings'=>'Ètò','Templates & kits'=>'Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ & ohun èlò','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ìbéèrè fún yíyí àpilẹ̀kọ yìí padà dáwọ́ dúró kí ó tó parí, nítorí náà a fò á kọjá. Ṣí i láti yí i padà, tàbí kí o tún yí i padà láti ibi yìí.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Ko si afẹyinti ifiweranṣẹ yii lati mu pada sipo.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'A kò lè fi àwọn ohun tí a yí padà sí pamọ́.','Unknown error.'=>'Àṣìṣe àìmọ̀.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Àכו́nù ìصàìnìì tí a ti ṣe àyèwò fún kò tìì wà.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Mu ohun ti a jogun pada: %1$d ninu %2$d awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Yí akópawé atijọ padà: %1$d nínú %2$d àwọn àfikún.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Ìṣẹ̀dá padà parí: %1$d ti padà bọ̀ sípò, %2$d kùnà.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Ìyípadà parí: %1$d ti yí padà, %2$d kò yí padà, %3$d kùnà.','Legacy content'=>'Akoonu atijọ','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Awọn ojú-ewé tí a fi àwọn ẹ̀yà Page Builder Sandwich tẹ́lẹ̀ṣẹ̀ ṣe ni a ń yí padà sí àwọn blọọku lẹ́yìn. A ṣe àfikún afẹ́yinti fún gbogbo post ní àkọ́kọ́, nitorinaa a le da ìyípadà kọ̀ọ̀kan padà.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Fífọ́kànsì %d ṣì ní àkóովé àtijọ́ nínú.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d post ni afẹyinti kan.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Kò ṣeé ṣe láti ṣe àkóso àpilẹ̀kọ %d kan','Post %d'=>'Ifihan %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ìyípadà bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ó ń tẹ̀ síwájú ní ẹ̀yìn; o le kúrò lórí ojú-ewé yìí.','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe gbogbo àpilẹ̀kọ tí a ti yí padà sí ohun àlùmọ́ni wọn tẹ́lẹ̀? Àwọn àtúnṣe tí a ṣe sí àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ yẹn láti ìgbà tí a ti yí wọn padà yóò sọnù.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ìṣẹ̀dá sẹ́yìn bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ó ń tẹ̀ síwájú ní ẹ̀yìn; o le kúrò ní ojú ewé yìí.','Undo all conversions'=>'Pa gbogbo iyipada rẹ kuro','Item'=>'Ohun kan','Open when the page loads'=>'Ṣíṣílẹ̀ nígbà tí ojúewé bá gbé sórí ayélujára','Title is a heading'=>'Akọle jẹ àkọlé kan','Make the title a heading when the items are sections of the page, so visitors can jump between them.'=>'Jọ̀ọ́ sọ àkọlé náà di àkọlé ńlá nígbà tí àwọn ohun tí ó wà níbẹ̀ jẹ́ apá kan ojú-ewé náà, kí àwọn alábẹ̀wò lè fò láàárín wọn.','Heading %d'=>'Àkọlé %d','Question or section title'=>'Ìbéèrè tàbí àkọlé apá','Accordion'=>'Àpótí tí ń gbòòrò sí i','Only one item open at a time'=>'Ohun kan nìkan ni ó sí ni ẹ̀ẹ̀kan','Mark up as FAQ for search engines'=>'Fi aami si bi FAQ fun awọn ẹrọ iwadii','Adds FAQ structured data built from the titles (questions) and their text (answers).'=>'Ó fi data tí a ṣètò ti FAQ kún tí a kọ́ láti ara àwọn àkọlé (àwọn ìbéèrè) àti ọ̀rọ̀ wọn (àwọn ìdáhùn).','Alert'=>'Ìkìlọ̀','Information'=>'Alaye','Success'=>'Àṣeyọrí','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Awon ikilo ati asise ni a n fi to awon olumulo to n lo ero kika iboju leti lojukanna; a n ka awon akọsilẹ alaye ati ti asori nipa igba ti wọn ba pari ohun ti wọn n se.','Show icon'=>'Fi àwòrán hàn','Visitors can close it'=>'Àwọn àlejò lè pa á','Title (optional)'=>'Àkọlé (aṣàyàn)','Write the message…'=>'Kọ ifiranṣẹ na…','Centre'=>'Àárín','Badge'=>'Àmì Ìdánimọ̀','Colour'=>'Àwọ̀','Theme accent'=>'Àwọ̀ àfihàn kókó','Neutral'=>'Kò sí ẹgbẹ́ kan','Position'=>'Ipò','Label'=>'Àmì','Booking calendar'=>'Kàlẹ́ndà ìpamọ́fún','Service'=>'Iṣẹ','Booking page address'=>'Adirẹsi ojú-ewé ìpamọ́','For example %s'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ %s','What the calendar is for, read out by screen readers and shown under it.'=>'Ohun ti kalẹnda jẹ fún, tí àwọn olùkà ojú-ibò ń kà jáde tí wọ́n sì ǹ fi hàn lábẹ́ rẹ̀.','This is not a %s booking page address, so nothing will show on the page.'=>'Eyi kii ṣe adirẹsi oju-iwe ìpamọ fun %s, nitorina ko si ohun ti yoo han lori oju-iwe naa.','Preview the calendar'=>'Ṣe àyẹ̀wò kalẹ́ndà náàájẹ́lẹ́kọ̀ọ́','Link address'=>'Àdírẹ́sì ìjápọ̀','The button shows when it has both a label and an address.'=>'Bọtìnì náà máa ń yọjú nígbà tí ó ní àmì àti àdírẹ́sì méjèèjì.','Open in a new tab'=>'Ṣíṣí ní taabu tuntun kan','Layout'=>'Àgbékalẹ̀','Buttons below'=>'Àwọn bọ́tìnnì tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀','Buttons beside the text'=>'Bọtìnì lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ ọ̀rọ̀ náà','Alignment'=>'Àgbékalẹ̀','Main button'=>'Bọtìnì àkọ́kọ́','Second button'=>'Bọtini keji','Heading…'=>'Akọlé…','One sentence on why…'=>'Gbólọhùn kan lórí ìdí tí…','Second button (optional)'=>'Bọtìnì keji (aṣayan)','Checklist'=>'Àyẹ̀wò','Tick colour'=>'Àwọ̀ àmì ìmúṣẹ','Lines'=>'Àwọn ìlà','Line %d'=>'Ahọ́n %d','Task…'=>'Iṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́…','Add line'=>'Fi ila kun','Language'=>'Èdè','Detect automatically'=>'Ṣe àwárí fúnra rẹ̀','No highlighting'=>'Kò sí àmì siṣẹ́','File name'=>'Oruko faili','Shown above the code, for example functions.php.'=>'A han loke koodu naa, fun apẹẹrẹ functions.php.','Line numbers'=>'Àwọn nọ́mbà ìlà','Copy button'=>'Bọtìnì ẹ̀dà kọ̀ọ̀tù','Wrap long lines'=>'Fi àwọn ìlà gígùn wé ara wọn','Write or paste code…'=>'Kọ tabi lẹ koodu…','Text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀','Columns'=>'Àwọn kọlọmù','Highlight %s'=>'Se àmì sí %s','Add column'=>'Fi kọlọmọ kun','Rows'=>'Àwọn Ìlà','Row %d'=>'Ọ̀wọ̀ %d','Add row'=>'Fi ìlà kún un','Caption (what is being compared)'=>'Àkọlé (ohun tí a ń fi wé ara wọn)','Cell type: %s. Change'=>'Iru sẹ́lì: %s. Yí padà','Phone call'=>'Ìpè tẹlifóònù','Text message'=>'Ifiranṣẹ ọrọ','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Buttons'=>'Awọn bọtini','Phone number, with country code'=>'Nọmba foonu, pẹlu koodu orilẹ-ede','Button text'=>'Ọrọ bọtini','Remove this button'=>'Yọ bọtìnì yii','Add a button'=>'Fi bọtini kun','WhatsApp message to start with (optional)'=>'Ifiranṣẹ WhatsApp lati bẹrẹ pẹlu (aṣayan)','Contact buttons'=>'Bọtìnì olubasọrọ','Add a phone number, an email address or a WhatsApp number in the sidebar.'=>'Fi nọmba tẹlifoonu kan, adirẹsi imeeli kan tabi nọmba WhatsApp kun si apakan ẹgbẹ.','Dual heading'=>'Àkọlé méjì','Heading level'=>'Ìpele àkọlé','Use H1 once per page, for its main title.'=>'Lo H1 lẹẹkan pẹlu oju-iwe kọọkan, fun akọle akọkọ rẹ.','Second part look'=>'Wiwo apá keji','Accent colour'=>'Àwọ̀ ìjẹmí','Gradient'=>'Gradiẹnti','Outline'=>'Akojọ','Underline'=>'Fa abẹ́ rẹ','Second part on its own line'=>'Apakan keji lori ila rẹ','First part'=>'Apá akọkọ','second part'=>'apakan keji','Marker pen'=>'Kọ̀sọ́ ìkọ̀wé','Thick underline'=>'Ìṣàlẹ̀ ìlà tó nipọn','Background'=>'Ẹ̀yìn-ilé','Highlight'=>'Ṣe àmì sí','Remove highlight'=>'Yọ àmì ìmọ́lẹ̀','Drop cap'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ àkọ́kọ́ nlá','Large first letter'=>'Lẹta akọkọ ti o tobi','For the first letter in a box, choose the "Drop cap in a box" style.'=>'Fun lẹta akọkọ ninu apoti kan, yan aṣa "Drop cap in a box".','Drop cap in a box'=>'Lẹ́tà àkọ́kọ́ ńlá nínú àpótíì','Accent bar'=>'Ọpa àmì ìdánimọ̀','Pull quote (accent bar)'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ ayọ̀ (igi ìforúkọsilẹ̀)','A quote from the text, set large beside a coloured bar to draw the eye.'=>'Gbólóhùn àti fọ́ọ̀mù láti inú ìkọ̀wé náà, tí a gbé kalẹ̀ ní ẹ̀gbẹ́ kan pẹ̀lú ọ̀pá aláwọ̀ kan láti fà á sọ́dọ̀ ojú.','quote'=>'fa ẹ̀kọ́','Feature list'=>'Àkójọ àwọn ẹ̀yà ara','On phones the features always stack.'=>'Lori awọn foonu awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ ma n wa lori ara wọn nigbagbogbo.','Feature %d'=>'Ẹ̀ka %d','Own icon'=>'Ami ti ara ẹni','Feature…'=>'Ànímọ́…','Describe it…'=>'Ṣe àpèjúwe rẹ̀…','Add feature'=>'Fi ẹ̀yà ara kún un','Install and activate Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms or Fluent Forms, then choose one of its forms here.'=>'Fi sori ẹrọ kí o sì mú Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms tàbí Fluent Forms ṣiṣẹ́, lẹ́yìn náà yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù rẹ̀ níhìn-ín.','Form plugin'=>'Plọọgi fọọmu','Choose a form…'=>'Yan fọọmu kan...','%s has no forms yet'=>'%s ko ti ni fọọmu kankan rara','%s is not active on this site, so this form cannot be shown.'=>'%s kò ṣiṣẹ́ lori aaye yii, nitorinaa a ko le fi fọọmu yii han.','The form list could not be loaded.'=>'A ko le kó àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ fọ́ọ̀mù náà jáde.','Form style'=>'Àṣà fọ́ọ̀mù','Fields'=>'Àwọn ààyè','Outlined'=>'Ti a kọ̀ si tẹlẹ','Filled'=>'Ti kún','Underlined'=>'Abẹ́là','Button width'=>'Gbòòrò bọtìnnì','Fit the text'=>'Mu ọrọ naa mu','Full width'=>'Gbogbo iwọn','Colours, fonts, spacing and corners come from your site design and this block’s design settings.'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀, àwọn fọ́ǹtì, ààyè àti àwọn igun wá láti apẹrẹ ojúsówọ̀ rẹ àti àwọn ètò apẹrẹ àkọsílẹ̀ yìí.','Show a form from your form plugin, styled to match your site.'=>'Fi fọọmu han lati inu fọọmu plugini rẹ, ti a ṣe ọṣọ lati ba aaye rẹ mu.','Need a form plugin? Contact Form 7 is free.'=>'Ṣe o nilo fọọmu plugin kan? Contact Form 7 jẹ ọfẹ.','Glossary'=>'Gbólóhùn Ìtumọ Ọ̀rọ̀','Sort A to Z'=>'Tito lẹ́sẹẹsẹ láti A dé Z','The page shows the terms in alphabetical order; here they stay in the order you wrote them.'=>'Ojú-ewé náà fi àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ hàn ní ìtòsí àtẹ́lẹsẹ̀ àlfábẹ́tì; níhìn-ín wọ́n dúró sí ìtòsí tí o kọ wọ́n sí.','Show an A–Z index'=>'Fi atọka A–Z hàn','Link terms used elsewhere on this page'=>'Sopọ awọn ọrọ ti a lo ni ibi miiran lori oju-iwe yii','The first time each term appears in the page text it links to its definition. Headings, buttons, code and existing links are left alone.'=>'Àkọkọ ìgbà tí ìgbékalẹ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan bá farahàn nínú ọ̀rọ̀ ojú-ewé náà, ó ní ìsopọ̀ mọ́ ìtumọ̀ rẹ̀. A fi àwọn àkọlé, bọ́tìnì, kódù, àti àwọn ìsopọ̀ tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀ sílẹ̀.','Terms'=>'Awọn ipo ati ofin','Term %d'=>'Àkókò %d','Term'=>'Akoko','What it means…'=>'Ohun ti o tumọ si…','Add term'=>'Fi ọrọ kun un','Icon list'=>'Àkójọ àwọn àwòrán kékeré','One below the other'=>'Ọkan lẹhin ekeji','Side by side'=>'Ẹgbẹ́-kẹgbẹ́','List item…'=>'Atọka ohun kan…','Info box'=>'Apoti alaye','Or choose any icon from the library:'=>'Tab àìyẹ èrò yínlátiúé ìkàwé náà:','Link text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ àjápọ̀','Say where the link goes ("See our prices"), not "Read more".'=>'Sọ ibi tí ìjápọ̀ náà ń lọ ("Wo àwọn owó wa"), kì í ṣe "Ka sí i".','A sentence or two…'=>'Gbolohun kan tabi meji…','section — a thematic section'=>'apakan — apakan akori kan','div — no meaning'=>'div — kò sí ìtumọ̀','header — introductory content'=>'àlàyé — àkóbá ìbẹ̀rẹ̀','footer — closing content'=>'àlàyé ìpínlẹ̀ – àfikún ìparọ̀','article — self-contained content'=>'nkan tí ó wà nínú ara rẹ̀ — àkóónú tí ó dúró fún ra rẹ̀','aside — related content'=>'apakan — akoonu ti o jọmọ','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'akọkọ — akọkọ akoonu (lẹẹkan fun oju-iwe kan)','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — àwọn ìjápọ̀ ìwakọ̀','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Stack (flexbox, kọlọmọ)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Ahọn (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Giriidu','Editing: %s'=>'Gbígbà sí àtúnṣe: %s','Lay out children as'=>'Tẹ awọn ọmọ bii','Inherited (%s)'=>'Wọn ti jogun (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Awọn bulọọki ti a kojọpọ','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Fa si inu kanfasi naa, tabi tẹ́','Content width'=>'Ìgbòòrò àkóónú','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'Fífín (ìbú ohun tí ó wà nínú akori náà)','Minimum height'=>'Giga tó kéré jù','HTML tag'=>'Aami HTML','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Ṣe gbòǹgbò àkójọpọ̀ yìí ní ìjápọ̀ sí','Link text for screen readers'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ ìjápọ̀ fún àwọn olùkà ibrènsi','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Ohun ti ọna asọfun n se, fun awọn alejò ti ko le ri bulọọki na.','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Má ṣe fi àwọn àpèjọ (links) tàbí àwọn bọ́tìnnì sí inú àpèjọ tí a ti sopọ̀ mọ́: àpèjọ kan tó wà nínú àpèjọ míì kì í ṣiṣẹ́ nínú àwọn wẹ́bù àṣàwádìí (browsers).','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Fa lati tun iwọn awọn iwe yii ṣe','Drag to resize this row'=>'Fa lati tun iwọn ila yii ṣe','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'Fa sẹ̀lẹ̀ kọjá láti ṣètò iye àwọn kọlọmù àti rọ́wọ́ tí bálókù yìí gba','+ Column'=>'+ Ọwọ́-ìtò sí','− Column'=>'− Òpó','+ Row'=>'+ Ìlà','− Row'=>'− Àtẹ','Place'=>'Gbọ̀dọ̀','Paste coordinates or an OpenStreetMap link'=>'Fi àwọn kọ́ọ̀dìnètì tàbí ìjápọ̀ OpenStreetMap sílẹ̀','On openstreetmap.org, find the place, then copy the address from the browser bar, or right-click the map and choose "Show address".'=>'Lori openstreetmap.org, wa ibi naa, lẹhinna da adirẹsi naa kọja lati inu Pẹpẹ aṣàwákiri, tabi tẹ-ọtun sori maapu naa ki o yan "Fi adirẹsi han".','Latitude'=>'Latitude','Longitude'=>'Ògùgùn-ìlà-oòrùn','Zoom'=>'Sun-un','Name of the place'=>'Orúkọ ibẹ̀ náà','Shown under the map and read out by screen readers.'=>'Wọn fi hàn lábẹ́ mápìì náà, a sì ka ẹ̀rọ amóhùn-máwòrán náà sókè.','Paste coordinates (for example 51.5074, -0.1278) or an OpenStreetMap link.'=>'Fi awọn asopọ sílẹ̀ (fún àpẹrẹ 51.5074, -0.1278) tàbí àsopọ̀ OpenStreetMap kan.','Coordinates or link'=>'Àwọn kọ́ọ̀dìnsì tàbí ìjápọ̀','Preview the map'=>'Ṣe àkọ́wò apẹrẹ maapu náà','Check %1$s, %2$s on OpenStreetMap'=>'Ṣayẹwo %1$s, %2$s lori OpenStreetMap','Published date'=>'Ọjọ́ ìtẹ̀jáde','Updated date (when it differs)'=>'Ọjọ́ tí a ṣe àtúnṣe rẹ̀ (nígbà tí ó bá yà tọ̀rọ̀)','Categories'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀ka','Tags'=>'Àwọn tágì','Reading time'=>'Akoko kika','Comment count'=>'Iye àwọn àlàyé','Details to show'=>'Àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ láti fi hàn','Choose at least one detail to show.'=>'Yan o kere ju alaye kan lati fi han.','Progress bar'=>'Bari ilọsiwaju','Maximum'=>'O pọ jùlọ','100 for a percentage; any other number for a count, such as 8 of 10.'=>'100 fún ìpín ọgọ́rùn-ún; nọ́mbà mìkàn fún ìka, bíi 8 nínú 10.','Show the percentage'=>'Fi ogorun-un han','A password is set. Visitors see a password form instead of this content until they enter it.'=>'A ti ṣètò ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà kan. Àwọn alábàbẹ́wò máa ń rí fọ́ọ̀mù ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà dípò àkóbá yìí títí tí wọ́n fi máa tẹ́ ẹ sí abẹ́.','No password is set yet, so visitors see nothing here.'=>'Àכו́ ìg̀bàkúrò kò tíì še, nítorí náà àwọn àbẹ̀wò kò ní rí ǹkan kan níbi yìí.','New password'=>'Ọrọ igbaniwọle titun','Set the password'=>'Ṣe àfikún ọ̀rọ̀ aṣírí náà','Password set. Save the page to apply it; visitors who had unlocked it will need the new one.'=>'O ti ṣeto ọrọ igbaniwọle. Fi oju-iwe naa pamọ lati lo; awọn alejo ti o ti ṣii rẹ yoo nilo tuntun naa.','If Page Builder Sandwich is ever switched off, this content is shown to everyone.'=>'Tí A bí Page Builder Sandwich bá ti pa, a ó máa fi àkóópọ̀ yìí hàn sí gbogbo ènìyàn.','Message above the password form (optional)'=>'Firanṣẹ loke fọọmu ọrọ igbaniوەle (ti o ba fẹ)','A/B test'=>'Idanwo A/B','Test name'=>'Orúkọ ìdánwò','Visitors who see version B (%)'=>'Àwọn àbẹ̀wò tí wọ́n rí ẹ̀dà B (%)','Goal (optional)'=>'Ìfojúsùn (kò pandan)','A conversion is a click on a link or button, or a form sent, inside the version. To count a click elsewhere on the page instead, enter its CSS selector, for example #buy-now.'=>'Ìyípadà jẹ́ títẹ lórí ìjápọ̀ tàbí bọ́tìnnì kan, tàbí fọ́ọ̀mù tí a ránṣẹ́, ní inú ẹ̀dà náà. Láti ka títẹ lórí ibòmíràn lórí ojú-ewé náà dípò rẹ̀, tẹ olùṣàyẹ̀wò CSS rẹ̀ sílẹ̀, fún àpẹẹrẹ #buy-now.','See the results'=>'Wo awọn abajade','An A/B test needs exactly two versions.'=>'Idanwọ A/B nilo awọn ẹ̀yà meji gangan.','Button'=>'Bọtìnì','Visit site'=>'Ṣẹ̀wẹ̀ sí ojú-wọ́ọ̀bù','Style'=>'Àwòrán Ìrísí','Affiliate button'=>'Bọtìnì alájọṣepọ','Give the button its text and the offer’s address in the sidebar.'=>'Fi ọrọ si bọtini náà ati adirẹsi ipese naa sinu igbanu ẹ̀gbẹ.','Age check'=>'Ayẹwo ọjọ-ori','Put this block on every page that needs it, or in your header template part to cover the whole site.'=>'Fi àkójọpọ yìí sori gbogbo ojú-ewé tí ó nílò rẹ̀, tàbí sínú àwoṣe aṣọ orí rẹ̀ (header template part) láti bo gbogbo ojú-opó náà mọ́lẹ̀.','Minimum age'=>'Ọjọ́ orí tó kéré jù','Ask for'=>'Bere lọ́wọ́','A yes or no answer'=>'Idahun bẹẹ tabi kọẹ','The date of birth'=>'Ọjọ́ ìbí rẹ̀','Remember the answer for (days)'=>'Rántí ìdáhùν fún (days)','Texts'=>'Àwọn Ọ̀rọ̀','Leave a text empty to use the standard one. {age} is replaced by the minimum age.'=>'Fi ọrọ kan sí silẹ lati lo eyi ti o jẹ iwọn. {age} ni a rọpo pẹlu ọjọ ori ti o kere ju.','Question'=>'Ìbéèrè','When the visitor is too young'=>'Nígbà tí àlejò náà bá kéré jù','Countries'=>'Orílẹ̀-èdè','A different minimum age for visitors from a country, or 0 to close the site to it. The country comes from your host or CDN (for example Cloudflare); where it is unknown, the minimum age above applies. A page cache must keep one copy per country for these rules to apply to cached pages.'=>'Ọjọ ori kéré jù lọ tó yàtọ̀ fún àwọn alábèwò láti orílẹ̀-èdè kan, tàbí 0 láti pa ojú òpó wẹ̀bù náà dé fún un. Orílẹ̀-èdè náà wá láti ọ̀dọ̀ agbéró rẹ tàbí CDN (fún àpẹẹrẹ Cloudflare); níbi tí kò ti mọ̀, ọjọ ori kéré jù lọ tó wà lókè yìí ni yóò lò. Ikún aṣẹ (cache) ojú-ewé gbọdọ̀ tọ́jú ẹ̀dá kan fún orílẹ̀-èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan kí àwọn àṣẹ wọ̀nyí lè kàn sí àwọn ojú-ewé tí a ti kó pamọ́.','Add a country'=>'Fi orilẹ-ede kun','Country code (two letters)'=>'Koodu orilẹ-èdè (lẹta meji)','For example US, GB, DE.'=>'Fun apẹẹrẹ US, GB, DE.','Minimum age (0: closed)'=>'Ọjọ ori to kere julọ (0: ti niipa)','Age gate'=>'Ibu Bodè Ọjọ-ori','The age question shows here.'=>'Ìbéèrè nípa ọjọ́ orí máa ń hàn níbí yìí.','Changing words'=>'Yiyipada awọn ọrọ','Word'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀','Add a word'=>'Fi ọ̀rọ̀ kún un','Animated headline'=>'Àkọlé tó ń yí padà','Text before'=>'Ọrọ ṣaju','Text after'=>'Ọrọ lẹhin','Effect'=>'Àbájáde','Fade'=>'Fi ojiji bo','Slide up'=>'Fà sókè','Typing'=>'Tí tẹ́','Time per word (milliseconds)'=>'Àkókò fún ọ̀rọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan (ìṣẹ́jú ààyá kékeré)','Add the words that change in the block settings.'=>'Fi awọn ọrọ ti o yipada kun ninu awọn eto bulọọki naa.','Typewriter'=>'Mọ́tò ìtẹ̀wé','Words fade in'=>'Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í hàn díẹ̀díẹ̀','Words rise in'=>'Awọn ọrọ dide ni','Plays once, when the text scrolls into view. Visitors who ask their device for less motion see the text still.'=>'Yoo ma ṣeré lẹ́ẹ̀kan, nígbà tí ìkọ̀wé náà bá yọ hàn lórí ojú-iṣẹ́. Àwọn alábàábẹ̀wò tí wọ̀n bẹ ẹ̀rọ wọn fún ìgbéṣẹ̀dẹ díẹ̀ máa rí ìkọ̀wé náà láìlọ́ṣẹ̀dẹ.','Speed'=>'Iyara','Slow'=>'Lẹ́yìn','Normal'=>'Iṣe deede','Fast'=>'Yara','Write the text to animate…'=>'Kọ ọrọ lati fi bẹrẹ iṣipopada…','Audio player'=>'Olùṣe ohùn','Show or album name'=>'Oruko show tabi album','Replace artwork'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ àwòrán náà','Choose artwork'=>'Yan aworan','Add an episode'=>'Fi ėpísóòdù kún un','Choose audio file'=>'Yan fáìlì ohùn','Replace audio file'=>'Rọ́pò fáìlì ohùn','or its address'=>'tab aadi rẹ','Add episodes in the sidebar.'=>'Fi awọn apakan kun ninu igbimọ apakan.','Author box'=>'Apamọ onkọwe','Profile picture'=>'Àwòrán profáìlì','Picture size (pixels)'=>'Ìwọ̀n àwòrán (pixels)','Biography'=>'Ìtàn Ìgbésí Ayé','Link to the author’s posts'=>'Ọna aṣopọ si awọn ifiweranṣẹ onkọwe náà','Link to their website'=>'Ọna asopọ si oju opo wẹẹbu wọn','Name as'=>'Orukọ bi','Heading 2'=>'Ori 2','Heading 3'=>'Orí Kẹta','Heading 4'=>'Orí 4','Paragraph'=>'Ẹ̀ka Ọ̀rọ̀','The author of the post shows here.'=>'Olùkọ̀wé fi hàn níbí.','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'Àwọn olùkàwé ojú-ìwé ló ń kọ́ ọ jáde, a sì ń fi hàn nígbà tí “Fi àmì hàn” bá wà ní títàn.','Show label'=>'Ṣe afihan àmì','Corner'=>'Igun','End (right in English)'=>'Ìparẹ̀ (ọtún ní èdè Gẹ̀ẹ́sì)','Start (left in English)'=>'Bẹrẹ','Appear after scrolling (pixels)'=>'Han sẹ́yìn lẹ́yìn ìyípo (àwọn píxẹlì)','Before: alternative text'=>'Ṣáájú: ọ̀rọ̀ àfikún fún àwòrán','Before: label'=>'Ṣaju: label','After: alternative text'=>'Lẹhin: àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ mìíràn tí ó rọ́pò èyí','After: label'=>'Lẹ́yìn:','Slider'=>'Sílídà','Starting position (%)'=>'Ipò ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ (%)','Before and after'=>'Ṣáájú àti lẹ́yìn','Choose the two images in the block settings. Use images of the same size.'=>'Yan awọn aworan meji ninu awọn eto bulọọki naa. Lo awọn aworan ti iwọn kanna.','Start with the home page'=>'Bẹrẹ pẹ̀lú ojú ìwé ilé','Home page label'=>'Àlámọ̀ ojú ewé ilé','Separator'=>'Olupín','Chevron ›'=>'Káfọ ›','Slash /'=>'Pẹlẹ /','Arrow →'=>'Ọfà →','Dot ·'=>'Àmì ·','End with the current page'=>'Parí pẹlu oju-ewe lọwọlọwọ','Structured data for search engines'=>'Àwọn dátà tó wà létòlétò fún àwọn ẹ̀rọ àwárí','Adds BreadcrumbList data to the page. Turn it off if an SEO plugin already adds breadcrumb data.'=>'Fi data BreadcrumbList kun oju-iwe na. Pa a mọ bi pọlọgi-in SEO ba ti n fi data breadcrumb kun tẹlẹ.','The path to the current page shows here. The home page has none.'=>'Ojú-ọ̀nà sí ojú-ewé lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ hàn níhìn-ín. Ojú-ewé ilé kò ní èyíkéyìí.','From'=>'Lati','To'=>'Si','Remove these hours on %s'=>'Yọ awọn wakati wọnyi kuro ni %s','Add hours (for a break)'=>'Fi àwọn wákàtì kún (fún ìsinmi)','Copy Monday to Tuesday–Friday'=>'Ṣakoda Ọjọ Aje si Ọjọ Aje-Ọjọ Etẹ','Hours that end after midnight (18:00 to 02:00) belong to the day they start. Times are in the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'Àwọn wákàtí tí ó parí lẹ́yìn ọ̀gànjọ́ òru (18:00 sí 02:00) jẹ́ ti ọjọ́ tí wọ́n ti bẹ̀rẹ̀. Àwọn àkókò wà ní agbègbè àkókò ti ojú-ewé webù náà (Àwọn àtúnṣe › Àgbájọ).','Display'=>'Fi hàn','Empty: read out by screen readers only.'=>'Òfo: àwọn olùkà ojú-ìwé nìkan ló máa ka èyí jáde.','Say whether it is open now'=>'Sọ bóya ó ti sí báyìí','Highlight today'=>'Sàmì sí òní','Note under the hours'=>'Àkíyèsí lábẹ́ àwọn wákàtí','Closed on public holidays.'=>'Wɔ́n ti pa á tì dé ìsinmi gbogbo ènìyàn.','Offers'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀bùn','Add an offer'=>'Fi àfikún ìfunni lọ','New offer'=>'Ìpèsè tuntun','Table'=>'Tábìlì','Caption'=>'Àkọlé ìwé','Shown above the table and read out by screen readers.'=>'Wọ́n fi hàn sí òkè tábìlì náà, wọ́n sì ka a jáde fún àwọn olùkà ojú-ibò.','Rank column'=>'Ẹ̀ka ipò iṣẹ́','Rating column'=>'Kọlọmu iwọn','Highlights column'=>'Kɔlɔmù Àwọn Àmì Ayọ̀','Notice under the table'=>'Àkíyèsí tí ó wà lábẹ́ tábìlì náà','Casino comparison table'=>'Tábìfiwé àwọn kásínò','Add the offers in the sidebar, best first.'=>'Fi awọn ipese kun ninu ọpa ẹgbẹ, eyiti o dara julọ ni akọkọ.','Kind'=>'Orisi','Bars'=>'Àwọn ọ̀pá','Line'=>'Ìlà','Pie (first series only)'=>'Pai (jíjọ àkọ̀ọ́ nìkan)','Shown above the chart and read out as its name.'=>'Ó hàn lókè àwọ̀ náà, a sì kà á gẹ́gẹ́ bí orúkọ rẹ̀.','Before each value'=>'Ṣáájú iye kọọkan','For example $ or €.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ $ tàbí €.','After each value'=>'Lẹ́yìn iye kọ̀ọ̀kan','For example kg, or the percent sign.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ kg, tàbí àmì ìdá.','Show a legend'=>'Fi àlàyé hàn','Print each value on the chart'=>'Tẹ iye kọọkan lori apẹrẹ naa','Height'=>'Giga','Short'=>'Kúrú','Tall'=>'Giga','Add categories and numbers below to draw the chart.'=>'Fi awọn ẹka ati awọn nọmba kun ni isalẹ lati fa aworan atọka naa.','Add category'=>'Fi ẹ̀ka kún un','Add series'=>'Fi jara kun','Click to share quote'=>'Tẹ lati pin ọrọ̀-àyọ̀','Quote'=>'Ìsọ̀rọ̀','X username'=>'Oruko olumulo X','Added as "via @name". Without the @.'=>'Fi kun gẹgẹ bi "via @name". Laisi @ náà.','Link to share'=>'Ọna asopọ lati pin','Left empty, the address of this page.'=>'Ti a ba fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo, àdírẹ́sì ojú ewé yìí.','Write the quote in the block settings.'=>'Kọọ ọ̀rọ̀ náà sínú àwọn ètò bálọ́ọ̀kì náà.','Content switcher'=>'Ayipada akoonu','Name for screen readers'=>'Orúkọ fún àwọn olùkà Ẹ̀rọ Ìfihàn','What the switch chooses, for example "Billing period".'=>'Ohun tí yíìtììṣì náà yan, fún àpẹrẹ "Àkókò ìdíyelé".','Add an option'=>'Fi aṣayan kun','Countdown'=>'Àkókò tí ń dín kù','Count down to'=>'Ka si isalẹ si','A date and time'=>'Ọjọ́ àti àkókò','A time after each visitor arrives'=>'Àkókò lẹ́yìn tí àlejò kọ̀ọ̀kan dé','Ends at'=>'Ó parí ní','In the time zone set under Settings, General.'=>'Nínú agbègbè àkókò tí a ṣètò lábẹ́ Ètò, Ìpìlẹ̀.','Hours after the first visit'=>'Àwọn wákàtí díẹ̀ lẹ́yìn ìbẹ̀wò àkọ́kọ́','Text above'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ tó wà lókè','Text once it has ended'=>'Ọrọ nígbà tí ó parí','Show seconds'=>'Fi àwọn ìṣẹ́jú ààyá hàn','Choose the date and time it counts down to.'=>'Yan ọjọ ati akoko ti o nka si isalẹ.','Counter'=>'Olùkà','Count to'=>'Ka si','Count from'=>'Ka lati','Decimal places'=>'Awọn aaye eleemewa','Before the 