 kò lè rí i.','Play'=>'Ṣiṣẹ','When it scrolls into view'=>'Nígbà tí ó bá yọ sí ojú ìwòran','As soon as the page loads'=>'Ni kete ti oju-iwe naa ba kojọ','While the pointer is over it'=>'Nígbà tí tọ́kasí bá wà lórí rẹ̀','Loop'=>'Yii','Marquee'=>'Maki','Moves'=>'Àwọn Ìgbésẹ̀','Towards the start of a line'=>'Ni ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ìlà kan','Towards the end of a line'=>'Si opin ila kan','Between items'=>'Láàárín àwọn ohun èlò','Nothing'=>'Kò sí ohun kankan','Name read out by screen readers'=>'Orúkọ tí àwọn aṣàyẹ̀wò ojú-ìwé ǹ kà jáde','Visitors get a pause button, and it stops while they point at it. It stays still for visitors who ask for less motion.'=>'Àwọn alábèwò rí bọtìnì ìsinmi kan, ó sì ń dúró nígbà tí wọ́n bá tọ́ka sí i. Ó máa ń dúró fún àwọn àlejò tí wọ́n béèrè fún ìrìn-àjò díẹ̀.','Item %d'=>'Ohun %d','Remove item %d'=>'Yọ nkan %d kuro','Add item'=>'Fi ohun kun','Mega menu'=>'Mega menu','Show under'=>'Fi hàn labẹ','The top-level menu item that opens this panel.'=>'Ohun elo ako akojọ aṣayan ti o ga julọ ti o ṣii nronu yii.','Choose an item…'=>'Yan nkan kan…','As wide as its content'=>'Gẹgẹ bi iwọn akoonu rẹ̀','As wide as the menu bar'=>'Gbooro bi ọpa akojọ aṣayan','Mega menu for “%s”'=>'Mẹga mênu fún “%s”','Mega menu: choose its menu item in the sidebar.'=>'Menyu nla: yan ohun menu rẹ ni ibi iwaju.','Phones'=>'Àwọn fóònù','Accordion on phones'=>'Àkọ̀ṣọ́ lórí àwọn fóònù','On narrow screens each tab becomes a section that opens and closes on its own.'=>'Lori awọn iboju dín, taabu kọọkan di apakan ti o ṣii ti o si n pa titi ti ara rẹ.','3D model'=>'Apẹẹrẹ 3D','Choose a model (GLB or glTF)'=>'Yan àwoṣe kan (GLB tabi glTF)','Description (required)'=>'Àlàyé (pọ̀ndìdọ̀)','What the model shows: it is what a screen reader announces.'=>'Ohun tí àpẹẹrẹ náà fi hàn: ohun tí olùkà aṣàfihàn ojú-iṣẹ́ ń kéde ni.','Poster image shown while it loads'=>'Àwòrán Àfihàn nígbà tó ń ṣe agbérù','Turn slowly on its own'=>'Yí lọ́kọ̀ọ̀kan ní títẹlẹra lọ́rọ̀ tìkọ̀ tìkọ̀','Offer "view in your space" (AR) on phones'=>'Fi "wo ninu aaye rẹ" (AR) han lori awọn foonu','Choose a 3D model in the sidebar.'=>'Yan awo 3D kan ninu pẹpẹ apakan.','Choose a menu…'=>'Yan akojọ aṣayan kan…','Only people who can edit the site’s menus can choose one here.'=>'Awọn eniyan nikan ti o le ṣatunkọ awọn aṣyn aaye naa ni o le yan ọkan nibi.','Navigation menu'=>'Àtòjọ ìtọ́sọ́nà ìlọsíwájú','Choose which WordPress menu to show.'=>'Yan aṣayan akojọ aṣayan WordPress lati fi han.','This site has no menus yet. Create one, then choose it here.'=>'Ojula yii ko ni awọn akojọ aṣayan kankan sibẹsibẹ. Ṣẹda ọkan, lẹhinna yan nibi.','Edit menus'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn aṣayan ounjẹ','Tells screen reader users which menu this is, for example “Main” or “Footer”.'=>'Ó sọ fún àwọn olùṣe àfikún ojú-ìwé rẹ pé èyí ni àkójọ àṣàyàn náà, fún àpẹẹrẹ “Main” tàbí “Footer”.','Direction'=>'Àìṣẹ','In a row'=>'Nínú ìlà kan','In a column'=>'Nínú òpó kan','Mobile menu button'=>'Bọtìnì àkójọ aṣọ alagbeka','Below this width the menu folds into a button that opens it over the page.'=>'Nísàlẹ̀ ìwọ̀n yìí, àkójọ àṣàyàn náà máa ń pọ̀ mọ́ ara rẹ̀ di bọ́tìnnì kan tó ń ṣí i sí ojú ewé náà.','On phones'=>'Lórí fóònù','On phones and tablets'=>'Lori awọn foonu ati awọn tabulẹti','Always'=>'Nigba gbogbo','Never'=>'Rárá kí láé','Open submenus'=>'Ṣí akojọ atẹle abẹlẹ','When the arrow is clicked'=>'Nígbà tí a bá tẹ àmì ọfà náà','On hover, or when the arrow is clicked'=>'Nígbà tí o bá kọjá lórí rẹ̀, tàbí nígbà tí o tẹ ọfà náà','Mega menus'=>'Àwọn àtòjọ ńlá','A mega menu shows any blocks under a top-level item, instead of its submenu. Add a panel below the menu and choose its item.'=>'Àtòjọ ńlá kan fi èyíkéyìí nínú àwọn blọ́ọ̀ùkù tó wà lábé kókó kan tó wà ní ìpele òkè hàn, dípò àtòjọ rẹ̀ kékeré. Fi pánẹ́lì kan kún ìsàlẹ̀ àtòjọ náà kí o sì yan ohun èlò rẹ̀.','“%s” has a mega menu.'=>'“%s” ni akojọ aṣayan nla kan.','Add a mega menu panel'=>'Fi pátákì akoonu nla kun','Saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ.','Mailchimp API key'=>'Bọtìni API ti Mailchimp','A key ending in %s is saved for the whole site.'=>'Bọtìni kan tó parọ́ mọ́ %s ni a fi pamọ́ fún gbogbo ojula náà.','No key is saved yet: the form will not appear on the page until one is.'=>'Kò tíì fipamọ́ kọ́kọ́ṣẹ́ kankan: fọ́ọ̀mù náà kò ní hàn lórí ojú-ewé náà titi di ìgbà tí ẹnì kan bá wà.','New key'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ tuntun','Save key'=>'Fipamọ bọtọki','Remove key'=>'Yọ bọtín náà','Only an administrator can change it.'=>'Olùṣàkóso nìkan ló lè yí i padà.','Send signups to'=>'Fi àwọn tí wọ‍lé síle ránṣẹ́ sí','List ID'=>'Àmì Ìdánimọ̀ Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ','MailPoet: the list number. Mailchimp: the audience ID. AWeber: the list name.'=>'MailPoet: nọmba àkójọ náà. Mailchimp: ID àwọn olùgbọ́ náà. AWeber: orúkọ àkójọ náà.','Wording'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀','Heading'=>'Orí-ọ̀rọ̀','Consent box'=>'Apoti ìfọwọ́sọ́pọ̀','Visitors must tick it to subscribe. Say what they will receive.'=>'Àwọn alábẹ̀wò gbọ́dọ̀ tẹ bọ́tìnnì náà láti ṣe àforúkọsílẹ̀. Sọ ohun tí wọn yóò gbà.','Message after signing up'=>'Ifijiṣẹ lẹhin iforukọsilẹ','Stacked'=>'Tí a kó jọ','Address and button on one line'=>'Àdíréèsì àti bọ́tìnnì lórí ìlà kan','Newsletter signup'=>'Ìforúkọ sílẹ̀ fún ìwé ìròyìn','Choose the service and enter the list ID (and, for Mailchimp, the API key) in the block settings.'=>'Yan iṣẹ náà kí o sì tẹ àkọsílẹ̀ ID (àti, fún Mailchimp, bọ́tìnnì API) sínú àwọn ètò àkójọ.','Offer'=>'Àfikún','Logo and link'=>'Aami ati asopọ','Under a heading of its own, choose the next level down.'=>'Labẹ àkọlé tirẹ̀, yan ìpele tó tẹ̀ lẹ̀ rẹ̀.','Age notice'=>'Àkíyèsí ọjọ́ orí','Offer card'=>'Káàdì ìfẹ́nsílẹ̀','Give the offer a name in the sidebar.'=>'Fún ìpèsè náà ní orúkọ kan nínú pákó apá òsì.','People'=>'Àwọn ènìyàn','Add a person'=>'Fi eniyan kun','Role'=>'Ipò','Add a photo'=>'Fi fọ́tò kún un','Reports to'=>'Tọ si','Nobody (top of the chart)'=>'Kò sí ẹni tí ó wà ní (tó ga jù lọ ní orí chart)','Add the first person in the sidebar.'=>'Fi eniyan akọkọ kun si ọpa-apakan.','Parallax image'=>'Àwòrán Parallax','Describe the image; leave empty if it is only decoration.'=>'Ṣapejuwe aworan naa; fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo ti o ba jẹ́ ohun ọṣọ nikan.','Movement'=>'Ìsípò','Subtle'=>'Fẹ́lẹ̀fẹ́lẹ̀','Strong'=>'Lagbara','Particles'=>'Àwọn Pátìkì','How many'=>'Èló ni','A few'=>'Diẹ́','Some'=>'Diẹ','Many'=>'Ọpọlọpọ','Join nearby dots with lines'=>'Darapọ̀ mọ́ àwọn àmì tó súnmọ́ tòsí pẹ̀lú àwọn ìlà','The dots stop when the section is off screen, and stay still for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Àwọn àmì àlejò náà dúró nígbà tí apá apá kan bá kúrò lórí ojú-ìwé, wọ́n sì máa ń wà ní ìdúróṣinṣin fún àwọn àlejò tí wọ́n béèrè fún ìgbéṣe díẹ̀ láti ọ̀dọ̀ ẹ̀rọ wọn.','Dots'=>'Àwọn àmì ìṣírò','Dot colour (empty: the text colour)'=>'Àwọ̀ àmì (tí kò bá ní ⱥwọ̀: àwọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ náà)','PDF'=>'PDF','Replace PDF'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ PDF','Choose a PDF'=>'Yan PDF kan','Choose a PDF in the sidebar.'=>'Yan PDF kan ninu ọpa ẹ̀gbẹ.','Carousel'=>'Kárọ́sìùlì','Buttons above the cards show one category at a time — a filterable portfolio.'=>'Àwọn bọ́tìnnì tó wà lókè àwọn káàdì fi ẹ̀ka kan hàn nígbà kan — àkójọ iṣẹ́ tí a lè yọ kúrò tàbí ṣe àlẹ̀mọ́.','More items'=>'Awọn ohun miiran mọ','Page numbers'=>'Àwọn nọ́mbà ojú-ewé','"Load more" button'=>'Bọtìnì "Fifún si i"','Card titles are'=>'Awọn akọle kaadi jẹ','Post carousel'=>'Kárúsẹ́lìì fọ́nrán','Your latest posts as a carousel of cards.'=>'Àwọn àtẹ̀jáde rẹ tuntun bíi Kárúsẹ̀lì àwọn kádì.','Masonry posts'=>'Àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ masonry','Cards of different heights, packed into columns.'=>'Àwọn káàdì tí gíga wọnà yàtọ̀ síra, tí wọ́n rọ̀ mọ́ ara wọn ní kọlọ́mù.','Filterable portfolio'=>'Àpò iṣẹ́ tí a lè yọ kúrò tàbí ṣe àtúnṣe sí','Cards with category buttons that filter them.'=>'Àwọn káàdì tí ó ní àwọn bọ́tìnnì ẹ̀ka tí ń yọ wọ́n lẹ́yìn.','Items'=>'Àwọn ohunèlò','Add an item'=>'Fi ohun kan kun','Price'=>'Iye owo','Price list'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ owó','Add an item in the block settings.'=>'Fi ohun kan kun ninu awọn eto bulọọki.','Plans'=>'Àwọn Ètò','Add a plan'=>'Fi ètòkun kun','Plan name'=>'Orúkọ ètò','Short description'=>'Àpèjúwe kúkúrú','A figure such as 19 or 19.99, or a word such as Free.'=>'Iye bii 19 tabi 19.99, tabi ọrọ bii Ọfẹ.','After the price'=>'Lẹ́yìn iye owó náà','For example "/ month". Left empty, the billing period is used.'=>'Fún àpẹrẹ "/ oṣù". Tí a bá fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo, a óò lo àkókò ìsanwó náà.','Yearly price'=>'Iye owo lododun','Shown when the visitor switches to yearly billing.'=>'A han nígbà tí alábẹwò bá yí padà sí ìsanwọ́ ọdọọdún.','After the yearly price'=>'Lẹ́yìn owó ọdọọdún','Add a feature'=>'Fi ẹ̀ya kan kún un','Open the link in a new tab'=>'Ṣí ọ̀nà-sopọ̀ náà ní taabu tuntun kan','Highlight this plan'=>'Ṣe àmì sí ètò yìí','A short label above the plan, such as "Most popular".'=>'Àmì kúkurú kan tó wà lókè ètò náà, bíi "Tó gbajúmọ̀ jù lọ".','Pricing table'=>'Tabili iye owo','Currency symbol'=>'Àmì owó','Monthly / yearly switch'=>'Ayipada oṣooṣu / ọdọọdun','Shows a switch when at least one plan has a yearly price.'=>'Ó fi iyipada kan hàn nígbà tí ó kéré tán ètò kan bá ní owó ọdọọdún kan.','Monthly button text'=>'Ọrọ bọtini ti oṣooṣu','Yearly button text'=>'Ọrọ bọtọni ọdọọdún','Yearly saving'=>'Ìpamọ́ ọdọọdún','For example "Save 20%".'=>'Fún àpẹrẹ "Famọ̀ 20%".','Add a plan in the block settings.'=>'Fi ètò kan kun ninu awọn eto bulọọki.','Out of'=>'Nínú','A percentage'=>'Ìpín kan','The value out of the total'=>'Iye ninu apapọ','Ring'=>'Orí ẹ̀rọ','Thickness'=>'Ìṣùpọ̀','Thin'=>'Tẹ́rẹ̀','Thick'=>'Kíní','Label (optional)'=>'Aami (ti ko dandan)','Promo bar'=>'Pẹpẹ ìpolówó','Top, stays in view'=>'Ó ga jùlọ, ó dúró lójú ojúewé','Bottom of the screen'=>'Isalẹ iboju naa','Where it is placed'=>'Ibikęti a gbe si','Colours'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀','Accent'=>'Ìfihàn èdè','Write the announcement in the block settings.'=>'Kọ ìkejì àìmọ̀ nínú àwọn ètò bálóòkù náà.','One per line'=>'Ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan','Headings'=>'Àwọn àkọlé','Add the pros and cons in the sidebar, one per line.'=>'Fi àwọn ànfàní àti àìlánfàní kún apá ìsàlẹ̀, ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Optional, for example “Reading time:”.'=>'Yiyan, fún àpẹrẹ “Àkókò kíkà:”.','Format'=>'Ọna kika','5 minutes read'=>'Ìṣẹ́jú márùn-ún láti kà','5 min read'=>'Ìṣẹ́jú 5 láti kà','Reading speed (words a minute)'=>'Iyara kika (awọn ọrọ ni iṣẹju kan)','How long the post takes to read shows here.'=>'Bí ó ti gba àkókò tó láti ka àpilẹ̀kọ náà ni ó hàn níbí.','Score'=>'Ìwọ̀n','Overall score'=>'Àwọn ìwọ̀n lápapọ̀','Verdict'=>'Ìpinnu','Criteria'=>'Àwọn ìlànà','Add a criterion'=>'Fi àfikún ìlànà kan','Criterion'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ','Set the score in the sidebar.'=>'Ṣe àmì-ìṣe sílẹ̀ nínú ọ̀pá ẹ̀gbẹ́.','Reviews'=>'Àwọn àyẹ̀wò','Google and Trustpilot'=>'Google àti Trustpilot','Lowest rating shown'=>'Àwọn ìwọ̀n tí ó kéré jùlọ tí ó hàn','Only 5-star reviews.'=>'Àwọn àyẹ̀wò 5-ìràwọ̀ nìkan.','Reviews below this are not shown.'=>'Àwọn àyẹ̀wò tí ó wà lísàlẹ̀ èyí kò hàn.','Order'=>'Pipa','Newest first'=>'Èyí tí ó tuntun jù lọ ní àkọ́kọ́','Best first'=>'Èyí tó dára jù lọ mọ́lẹ̀','Show the date'=>'Fi ọjọ han','Show the overall rating under them'=>'Fi gbogbo ìwọ̀n àlapapọ̀ hàn lábẹ́ wọn','Google and Trustpilot details (Site design › Reviews)'=>'Àwọn àlàyé Google àti Trustpilot (Apẹrẹ ojúsè › Àwọn àyẹ̀wò)','A grid of cards'=>'Àwọn káàdì tí a tò lẹ́sẹẹsẹ','A slider'=>'Gbọ̀rọ̀gìdìgbò','A badge: the overall rating'=>'Àmì ẹ̀rí kan: ìwọ̀n àpapọ̀ rẹ̀','Notice'=>'Àkíyèsí','Help link'=>'Ọna asopọ iranlọwọ','Show the age badge'=>'Fi àmì ọjọ́ hàn','Link the national help service'=>'So pọ̀ mọ́ iṣẹ́ ìrànlọ́wọ́ Orílẹ̀-èdè','For visitors from the UK, the US, Australia, Germany, France and Sweden, link that country’s help service. Check them against your licence, and add other countries below.'=>'Fun awọn alejo lati UK, US, Australia, Germany, France ati Sweden, sopọ iṣẹ iranlọwọ ti orilẹ-ede yẹn. Ṣayẹwo wọn lodi si iwe-aṣẹ rẹ, ki o si ṣafikun awọn orilẹ-ede miiran ni isalẹ.','Responsible gambling notice'=>'Àkíyèsí eré ìdárayá tó tọ́','The notice shows here.'=>'Àkíyèsí náà hàn níbí.','For example “Q3 2026” or “Spring”.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ “Q3 2026” tàbí “Orí Omi”.','A board: planned, in progress, done'=>'Àwo ńlá kan: èyí tí a ètò sílẹ̀, èyí tí ó ń lọ lọ́wọ́, èyí tí a parí','One list, each item with its status'=>'Atokọ kan, olukuluku nkan pẹlu ipo rẹ','Column heading level'=>'Ìpele àkọlé kọlọmù','Add the first item in the sidebar.'=>'Fi ohun kan akọkọ kun si ẹgbẹẹgbẹ.','Hidden labels are still read out by screen readers.'=>'Àwọn àmì tí ó pamọ́ ni àwọn olùkà aṣojú ojú-wẹ́bù (screen readers) ṣì ń kà jáde.','Icon instead of button text'=>'Àìmọ̀ àjẹmọ́ dípò ọ̀rọ̀ bọ́tìnì','Search in'=>'Wá ninu','The whole website'=>'Gbogbo oju opo wẹẹti naa','Device share menu'=>'Àkọsọ ìpín ẹ̀rọ','Share to'=>'Pín sí','Share bar'=>'Fọ́ọ̀mù pínpín','For example "Share". Left empty, no label is shown.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ "Pín". Tí a bá fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo, kò sí àmì tí yóò hàn.','Floating at the side (wide screens)'=>'Tí ó ń léfòó ní ẹ̀gbẹ́ (àwọn ojú-ìwọ̀n títóbi)','The buttons appear once the page has an address (save it as a draft).'=>'Àwọn bọ́tìnnì náà máa fara hàn nígbà tí ojúewé náà bá ní àdírẹ́sì kan (fipamọ́ bí àkọọ̀wé).','Networks'=>'Àwọn Nẹ́twọ̀kì','Device share button'=>'Bọtìnì pínpín ẹ̀rọ','Phones and some browsers offer their own share sheet; the button appears only where one exists.'=>'Àwọn fóònù àti àwọn aṣàwákiri kan ń pèsè ìwé ìpín pín tiwọn; bọ́tìnnì náà yóò hàn níbi tí ó ti wà níbẹ̀ nìkan.','Look'=>'Wo','Show network names'=>'Fi àwọn orúkọ néwòkì hàn','Shape'=>'Apẹẹrẹ','Rounded'=>'Ti a yipo','Circle'=>'Gbọngan','Square'=>'Square','Edit images (%d)'=>'Ṣatunkọ àwọn àwòrán (%d)','Choose images'=>'Yan àwọn àwòrán','Content type'=>'Iru akoonu','Items per page'=>'Àwọn ohun kọ̀ọ̀pọ̀ ní ojú ewé kan','Only these categories'=>'Awọn ẹka wọnyi nikan','None chosen: every category.'=>'Kò sí èyí tí a yan: gbogbo ẹ̀ka.','Oldest first'=>'Èyí tí ó pé jù lọ ni àkọkọ','Title, A to Z'=>'Àkọlé, Láti A dé Z','Recently updated'=>'Awon ti a se atunse laipe','Custom order'=>'Àṣàyàn àṣẹ','Random'=>'Àìṣọ̀kan','Summary'=>'Àkótán','Price (products)'=>'Iye (awọn ọja)','Card'=>'Kààtì','Previous and next buttons'=>'Awọn bọtini ti tẹlẹ ati ti nbọ','Start again after the last'=>'Bẹrẹ lẹẹkan si lẹhin eyi ti o kẹhin','Play automatically'=>'Ṣe afihan laifọwọyi','Never for visitors who prefer less motion; pauses on hover and focus, and has a Stop button.'=>'Ko ni ṣe fun awọn abẹwo ti o fẹ gbigbe diẹ; o nsinmi lori diduro ati idojukọ, ati pe o ni bọtini Iduro kan.','Seconds per slide'=>'Àáyán fún abala kọ̀ọ̀kan','Move up'=>'Gbe e soke','Move down'=>'Gbe e kalẹ','Remove column %s'=>'Yọ kọlọmọ %s lọ','The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces what is here.'=>'Laini akọkọ ni awọn orukọ kọlọmọ. Gbigbe wọle rọpo ohun ti o wa nibi.','Remove image'=>'Yọ aworan bi','%1$s %2$d'=>'%1$s %2$d','Pick the level that fits the outline of the page.'=>'Yan ipele ti o ba ilana ti oju-iwe naa mu.','Replace photo'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ fọ́tò','Move %s up'=>'Gbe %s soke','Move %s down'=>'Gbe %s silẹ','Duplicate %s'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá %s mìíràn','Remove %s'=>'Yọ %s','Rating (0 to 5)'=>'Ìwọ̀n (0 sí 5)','Highlights, one per line'=>'Àwọn kókó pàtàkì, ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan','Optional, for example “Top pick”.'=>'Aṣọ hàn, fún àpẹrẹ “Èyí tó dára jù”.','Terms (shown with the offer)'=>'Àwọn Òfin (tí a fi hàn pẹ̀lú ìfunni náà)','The key terms your licence requires next to the offer, for example the wagering requirement.'=>'Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ pàtàkì tí ìwé àṣẹ rẹ ń béèrè lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ ìfàráhàn náà, fún àpẹẹrẹ ohun tí a ń béèrè fún títẹ tẹlifísọ̀n tàbí ìtẹ́wọ́gbà.','Replace logo'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ àwòrán logo','Choose logo'=>'Yan àmì-ìdánimọ̀','Remove logo'=>'Yọ aami','Give the short link a name, and the offer a full address starting with https://.'=>'Fún ọ̀na àjọ̀kúrú náà ní orúkọ kan, kí o sì fún ìfisọnà náà ní àdírẹ́sì kíkún tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú https://.','The short link could not be saved.'=>'A ko le fipamọ ọna asopọ kukuru na.','Offer address'=>'Adirẹsi ìfunni','Your affiliate link. Links to offers are always marked as sponsored for search engines.'=>'Ọna asopọ alabaṣepọ rẹ. Awọn ọna asopọ si awọn ipese ni a ma n samisi nigbagbogbo gẹgẹbi igbowo fun awọn mọto wiwa.','Go through a short link'=>'Lọ nipasẹ ọna aṣiṣe kukuru kan','Visitors see a short address on your site, and every click is counted in Short links.'=>'Awọn olubẹwo rii adirẹsi kukuru kan lori aaye rẹ, a si ka gbogbo tẹ ninu Awọn ọna asopọ kukuru.','Visitors will see %s'=>'Awọn olẹ̀bẹ yoo ri %s','Or make a new one, named'=>'Tàbí kí o dá tuntun sílẹ̀, tí a sọ̀ kalẹ̀ ní orúkọ','spin-palace'=>'spin-palace','Create short link from the address'=>'Ṣẹda ọna asopọ kukuru lati adirẹsi naa','Height before the button'=>'Giga ṣaju bọtínì náà','Button text when open'=>'Ọrọ bọtini nigbati o ba ṣii','Header'=>'Ori','Sticky'=>'Olóǹlẹ̀','Stays at the top of the screen while visitors scroll.'=>'O wa ni oke iboju lakoko ti awọn alejo n yiyi.','Transparent'=>'Gbangba','Lies over the first section of the page, and takes the site’s background colour once the page scrolls. Give the first section enough space at the top.'=>'Ó wà lórí apá kinni ti ojú ewé náà, ó sì máa ń gbá àwọ̀ ẹ̀yìn ojú ewé náà nígbà tí ojú ewé náà bá yí lọ sílẹ̀. Fún apá kinni náà ní àyè tó tó lókè.','Slides come from'=>'Awọn yiyan wa lati','Blocks I add'=>'Awọn àfikún tí mo fi kun','Posts'=>'Àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́','Products (WooCommerce)'=>'Awọn ọja (WooCommerce)','Slide'=>'Yọ̀','Ken Burns (slow zoom, images)'=>'Ken Burns (sun-un si ara, àwọn àwòrán)','Slides in view: desktop'=>'Awọn fọto ninu wiwo: kọmputa tabili','Slides in view: tablet'=>'Awọn aworan ti o han: tabulẹti','Slides in view: phone'=>'Àwọn yàrá inú ìwòran: fóònù','What the slides are, for example "Customer stories".'=>'Kí ni àwọn àwòrán wọ̀nyí, fún àpẹẹrẹ "Àwọn ìtàn oníbàárà".','Image slider'=>'Atọka àwòrán','Images from the media library, one after another.'=>'Àwọn àwòrán láti inú ilé kíkójọ àwọn ohun èlò ìròyìn, lẹ́yìn òmíràn.','Post slider'=>'Fọ́tò tó ń yí pa a','Product slider'=>'Olùfihan ọjà','WooCommerce products as a carousel.'=>'Àwọn ọjà WooCommerce gẹ́gẹ́ bí káńṣèlì (carousel).','Ken Burns slideshow'=>'Ifihan aworan Ken Burns','Full-width images with a slow zoom, fading from one to the next.'=>'Awọn aworan gbohungbohun-kikun pẹlu sisun ti o lọra, ti n parẹ lati ọkan si ekeji.','Recent sales notices — example, shown only in the editor'=>'Àwọn ìkéde ìtawò nísinsìyí — àpẹẹrẹ, ó hàn nìkan nínú olùṣàtúnṣẹ rẹ̀','First name from Town bought Product'=>'Orúkọ kinni láti Town ra Product','2 hours ago'=>'Wakati 2 sẹyin','Orders'=>'Àwọn àṣẹ','Orders from'=>'Awọn aṣẹ lati ara','WooCommerce and Easy Digital Downloads'=>'WooCommerce àti Easy Digital Downloads','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Easy Digital Downloads'=>'Easy Digital Downloads','Most recent orders to show'=>'Awọn aṣẹ tuntun julọ lati fihan','Oldest order (days)'=>'Àṣẹ àtijọ́ jùlọ (àwọn ọjọ́)','Name the product'=>'Sọ ọja naa di lẹ́kọ̀ọ́','Say how long ago'=>'Sọ bí pípẹ́ ti pẹ́ tó ti kọjá','Timing and place'=>'Àkókò àti ibì','Each notice shows for (seconds)'=>'Gbogbo àkíyèsí máa ń hàn fún (seconds)','Pause between notices (seconds)'=>'Sinmi laarin awọn akiyesi (awọn aaya)','Bottom, reading start'=>'Isale, kika bẹrẹ','Bottom, reading end'=>'Ìsàlẹ̀, òpin kíkà','Where the notices come from'=>'Nibo ni awọn akieti ti wa','Only real, paid orders are shown, and only when the buyer ticked the box at checkout that lets this site show their first name and town. Once this page is saved, the checkout offers that box. Until an order with it arrives, visitors see nothing.'=>'Àwọn ìbéèrè tó ní ìsanwó gidi nìkan ni a ń fi hàn, bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni wọ́n ń hàn nígbà tí olùrà náà bá sàmì sí àpótí tó wà ní ojú ìwé ìsanwó tí ó jẹ́ kí ojú ìwé yìí lè fi orúkọ àkọ́kọ́ wọn àti ìlú hàn. Ní kete tí a bá fipamọ́ ojú ìwé yìí, ìsanwó náà yóò pèsè àpótí yẹn. Títí di ìgbà tí ìbéèrè kan pẹ̀lú rẹ̀ bá dé, àwọn alábẹ̀wò kò ní rí ohunkóhun.','Find the coordinates from the address'=>'Wá àwọn kọ́ọ̀dìnètà láti inú àdírẹ́sì náà','Found. Check the pin on the map on the page.'=>'A rí i. Ṣàyẹ̀wò pín (pin) tó wà lórí máàpù ní ojú ewé náà.','No match. Try the street, town and postcode, or type the coordinates.'=>'Ko si abajade. Gbiyanju opopona, ilu ati koodu ifiweranse, tabi tẹ awọn asopọ aaye sii.','OpenStreetMap did not answer. Try again in a minute, or type the coordinates.'=>'OpenStreetMap kò fèsì. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi ní minitọ̀ kan, tàbí tẹ àwọn kordinati sínú rẹ̀.','Sends the address to OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) and fills in the latitude and longitude.'=>'Ó fi àdírẹ̀sì náà ránṣẹ́ sí OpenStreetMap (Nominatim)ó sì kún latitude àti longitude náà.','Locations'=>'Àwọn ibi','Add a location'=>'Fi ipo kun','Search and “Nearest to me”'=>'Ṣàwárí àti “Sunmọ mi jùlọ”','Offer a map'=>'Fi maapu han','Visitors press “Show the map” first: nothing loads from OpenStreetMap until they do.'=>'Àwọn àlejò máa n tẹ “Fi mápù hàn” ní àkọ́kọ́: kò sí ohun tí ó n kó láti OpenStreetMap títí tí wọ́n fi ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀.','Map zoom (0 = fit every location)'=>'Sun un ńlá lórí mápù (0 = fi gbogbo ipò hàn)','Add the first location in the sidebar.'=>'Fi ipo akọkọ kun si ọpa ẹgbẹ.','Pane'=>'Páànù','Name on the switch'=>'Orukọ lori iyipada naa','Person'=>'Ẹni','Short bio'=>'Ìtàn kúkurú ọ̀rọ̀ ayé rẹ','Photo'=>'Fọ́tò','Photo: alternative text'=>'Foto: ọrọ aropo','Leave empty when the photo only repeats the name.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo nígbà tí fọ́tò náà bá tún orúkọ náà sọ nìkan.','Profile links'=>'Àwọn ìjápọ̀ profáìlì','Add a link'=>'Fi ọna asopọ kun','Network'=>'Nẹ́twọ̀kì','LinkedIn'=>'LinkedIn','X'=>'X','Facebook'=>'Facebook','Instagram'=>'Instagram','GitHub'=>'GitHub','YouTube'=>'YouTube','Mastodon'=>'Mastodon','Bluesky'=>'Bluesky','Add a person in the block settings.'=>'Fi eniyan kun ninu Awọn eto idinanọ.','Event'=>'Ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀','Add an event in the block settings.'=>'Fi ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ kan kun nínú àwọn ètò àkójọ.','Badges'=>'Àwọn àmì ìdánimọ̀','Add a badge'=>'Fi àmì kún un','Trust badges'=>'Àwọn àmì ìgbẹ́kẹ̀lé','Row'=>'Ahọnni','Add a badge in the block settings.'=>'Fi àmì kún inú àwọn ètò àkójọpọ̀ náà.','Videos'=>'Àwọn Fídíò','Add a video'=>'Fi fidio kun','Video address (YouTube, Vimeo or a file)'=>'Àdírẹ́sì fídíò (YouTube, Vimeo tàbí fáìlì kan)','Poster image (optional)'=>'Àwòrán àfihàn (tó bá wù ú)','Replace poster'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ fọ́tò ìpolówó','Add videos in the sidebar.'=>'Fi awọn fidio kun ninu Pẹpẹ ẹgbẹ.','Name of the list'=>'Orukọ atẹ','Web address or text'=>'Adirẹsi wẹbu tabi ọrọ','QR code'=>'Koodu QR','Description for screen readers'=>'Àpèjúwe fún àwọn olùkà kọ̀ǹpútà fún àwọn afọ̀jú','Leave empty to use "QR code for" and the text.'=>'Fi si silẹ lati lo "Koodu QR fun" ati ọrọ naa.','Type a web address, a phone link (tel:) or any text.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi wẹbu kan, ìjápọ̀ foonu kan (tel:) tàbí èyíkéyìí ọ̀rọ̀.','This is too long for a QR code. Shorten it.'=>'Èyí gùn jù fún kòdù QR. Kúrú rẹ̀.','Add a caption'=>'Fi àkọlé kún un','Reading progress bar'=>'Pẹpẹ ìlọsíwájú kika','Edge of the window'=>'Etí fèdirán náà','Top'=>'Apẹrẹ','Bottom'=>'Isale','Shown along the bottom of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Awon eniyan le rii ni isale ferese bi awon alejo se n yi oju-iwe na kiri.','Shown along the top of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Awon nkan ti n han ni oke ferese bi awon alejo se n yi lo si isale.','Related by'=>'Nipa ti','Categories or tags'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀ka tàbí àwọn àmì','When nothing is related, show the newest instead'=>'Nígbà tí ohunkohun kò bá ní í ṣe pẹ̀lú ara wọn, fi èyí tó tuntun jù lọ hàn dípò rẹ̀','Leave empty for "Related posts".'=>'Fi o sọ di òfo fún "Àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ tó ní í ṣe pẹ̀lú rẹ̀".','Show the featured image'=>'Fi àwòrán àkọkọ hàn','Show a summary'=>'Fi àkópọ̀ hàn','No posts share this post’s categories or tags yet. When some do, they show here.'=>'Kò sí àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ tó pín àwọn ẹ̀ka tàbí àmì àkọsílẹ̀ yìí ní báyìí. Nígbà tí àwọn kan bá wà, wọn yóò hàn níhìn-ín.','Modal'=>'Apoti agbède','Off-canvas panel'=>'Pẹlẹẹdẹ ita','Slides in from'=>'Yiyọ wọle láti','Start is the side where reading begins: the left in English, the right in Arabic.'=>'Ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ni apá ibi tí kika ti bẹ̀rẹ̀: apá òsì ní èdè Gẹ̀ẹ́sì, apá ọ̀tún ní èdè Lárúbáwá.','Close when the page behind is clicked'=>'Pa nigbati a tẹ oju-iwe ti o wa lẹhin','Title of the window'=>'Àkọlé fèrèsé náà','Check mark'=>'Àmì ìṣàyẹ̀wò','Cross'=>'Gige','Dot'=>'Àìpẹ','Arrow'=>'Àfẹ̀fẹ̀múlẹ̀','Star'=>'Fà á sí ààyè ayò','Icon colour'=>'Àwọ̀ àmì kékeré','Same as the text'=>'Bakanna bi oro naa','Theme primary'=>'Akọkọ akọsilẹ','Theme secondary'=>'Ẹya keji','Theme contrast'=>'Àìṣò tàbí ìyàtọ̀ àwọn àwọ̀ ojú-iṣẹ́','Keep headings in order down the page: a heading one level below the section it sits in.'=>'Tọ́ àwọn àkọlé sẹ́sẹ́ lẹ́sẹ̀sẹ́ lórí ojú ìwé náà: àkọlé kan tí ó wà ní ìpele kan ní ìsàlẹ̀ apá kan tí ó wà nínú rẹ̀.','Choose icon'=>'Yan àami','Use the default icon'=>'Lo aami aiyipada','Choose an icon'=>'Yan aami kan','Show a heading for each type'=>'Fi akọle han fun iru kọọkan','Nothing published yet in the types you chose.'=>'Kò tíì sí ohun tí a té jáde nínú àwọn irú tí o yan.','Links'=>'Àwọn Ìjápọ̀','Link %d'=>'Ọna asopọ %d','A profile address, mailto:you@example.com or tel:+441234567890.'=>'Adirẹsi profaili kan, mailto:you@example.com tabi tel:+441234567890.','Name read to screen readers'=>'Orúkọ tí a kà sí àwọn olùkà ojú-ìwé fún àwọn afọ̀jú','Other icon'=>'Àwọn àmì mìíràn','Add link'=>'Fi ọna asopọ kun','Icon only'=>'Àwọn àmì nìkan','Rounded square'=>'Onigun merin ti o ni eti ti o ro','Open profiles in a new tab'=>'Ṣí àwọn mọ̀ọ̀kàn àkọsílẹ̀ sí tàbù tuntun kan','Star rating'=>'Ìwọ̀n ìrààwọ̀','Number of stars'=>'Iye awon irawo','Show the number'=>'Fi nọ́mbà náà hàn','Down the page'=>'Isalẹ ojiji peji náà','Side by side (stacks on phones)'=>'Ẹgbẹ́ pẹ̀lú ẹgbẹ́ (ó n ṣe àkójọ lórí fóònù)','Number colour'=>'Àwọ̀ nọ́mbà','Order of the steps'=>'Àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ náà','Step %d'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ %d','Step…'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀…','What to do…'=>'Ohun tí a lè ṣe...','Add step'=>'Fi igbesẹ kun','Tab'=>'Tábì','Add headings to the page and they will be listed here.'=>'Fi awọn akọle kun oju-iwe naa, wọn si yoo wa ni atọju nibi.','Table of contents'=>'Atokọ awọn akọle','From heading level'=>'Lati ipele ori','To heading level'=>'Si ipele akọlé','Numbered'=>'Ti a ka nọmba rẹ','Can be collapsed'=>'A lè kó jọ','Start collapsed'=>'Bẹrẹ pẹ̀lú wípé ó di pọ̀','Highlight the section being read'=>'Se apakan ti a n ka lowo','Tabs'=>'Àwọn tàbù','Optional. Says what the tabs are about, for example "Plans".'=>'O pọn dandan kọ. Ó n sọ ohun ti awọn taabu jẹ nipa, fún apẹẹrẹ "Awọn ètò".','Open on page load'=>'Ṣí nígbà tí ojúewé bá ń kó','Tabs down the side'=>'Awọn taabu ni ẹgbẹ','Add a tab'=>'Fi taabu kun','Testimonial'=>'Ẹ̀rí Ìjẹ́rìísí','Choose photo'=>'Yan fọto','Remove photo'=>'Yọ fọ́tò náà','Photo description'=>'Àpèjúwe fọ́tò','Leave empty when the photo only shows the person named next to it.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo nígbà tí fọ́tò náà bá fi ẹnì tí a darúkọ rẹ̀ lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ rẹ̀ hàn nìkan.','Star rating (0 = none)'=>'Iwọn ìrààwọ̀ (0 = kò sí)','Name under the quote'=>'Orukọ labẹ agbasọ ọrọ na','Photo beside the quote'=>'Fọ́tò lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ ọ̀rọ̀ náà','What the customer said…'=>'Ohun tí oníbàárà sọ…','Role or company'=>'Ipò tàbí ilé-iṣẹ́','Tooltip'=>'Àlàyé Ọ̀rọ̀','Tooltip text'=>'Ọrọ ìtọ́sọ́nà ìrànlọ́wọ́','Keep it short: one or two sentences. Screen readers read it with the word it explains.'=>'Jẹ́ kí ó kúrú: gbólóhùn kan tàbí méjì. Àwọn olùkàwé ojú-ibò máa ń kà á pẹ̀lú ọ̀rọ̀ tí ó ń ṣàlàyé rẹ̀.','Show it'=>'Fi hàn ọ','Above'=>'Loke','Below'=>'Isale','Word or phrase'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ tàbí gbólóhùn','Apply'=>'Lo siṣẹ','Profile'=>'Ojú-iwe aṣojútùú','Whose profile'=>'Profaifì tani','The post’s author'=>'Olùkọ̀wọ́fééṣì náà','Show the profile picture'=>'Fi aworan profaილები han','Show the biography'=>'Fi ìtàn igbesi aye rẹ han','Show links to posts and website'=>'Fi awọn ọna aṣojulọ si awọn atẹ̀jade ati oju opo wẹẹbu hàn','Author profile'=>'Àkọsílẹ olùkọwé','Choose whose profile to show.'=>'Yan profaイル to fihan.','WhatsApp number, with country code'=>'Nọ́mbà WhatsApp, pẹ̀lú koodu orílẹ̀-èdè','For example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ +44 7700 900123.','Message to start with (optional)'=>'Ìfiránṣẹ́ láti bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í lo (aṣàyàn)','Show the text next to the icon'=>'Fi ọrọ naa han lẹgbẹẹ àmì-ìrántí náà','Bottom end (right in English)'=>'Isale (ọtún ni Gẹẹsi)','Bottom start (left in English)'=>'Isale bẹrẹ (osì ni Gẹ̀ẹ́sì)','Add your WhatsApp number in the sidebar. Until then the button is not shown on the page.'=>'Fi nọmba WhatsApp rẹ kun inu apakan ẹgbẹ. Titi di igba naa, bọtini naa ko ni han lori oju-iwe naa.','On the page, this button floats in a bottom corner of the screen.'=>'Lori oju-iwe naa, bọtọni yii n léfòó ni igun isalẹ ti iboju naa.','Saved to your cloud library.'=>'A fipamọ sinu ibi ipamọ awọsanma rẹ.','Save to cloud library'=>'Fipamọ sinu ile-ikawe awọsanma','Save to'=>'Fipamọ si','Images are resized, stored once and brought back into the media library of any site that inserts this design.'=>'Awon aworan naa n gba iwọn tuntun, wọn n fipamọ lẹẹkan soso, a si n mu wọn pada si inu ile-ikawe media ti eyikeyi aaye ti o fi apẹrẹ yii sori ẹrọ.','%s style'=>'%s àṣà','Save style to cloud library'=>'Fi aṣa pamọ si ibi ipamọ awọsanma','Select a block first, then apply the style.'=>'Yan bɔ́ọ̀kì kan kọ́kọ́, lẹ́yìn náà lo ẹ̀dà náà.','Library'=>'Ilé-kíkọ','Save this page to the library'=>'Fi ojú ewé yìí pamọ́ sínú ilé kíkà','Insert'=>'Fi sii','Shortcode tag'=>'Àmì kékeré fún ìlà kíkúrú','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Lo lẹta, nọmba, àmì iyọkuro ati àmì abẹlẹ nikan.','Attribute name'=>'Orúkọ ànímọ́','Add attribute'=>'Fi àfikún kún un','Shortcode'=>'Koodu Kúrúsì','Other attributes'=>'Àwọn ànímọ́ míràn','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Yan ami aami kukuru kan ninu awọn eto bulọọki naa.','Image size'=>'Iwọn àwòrán','Thumbnail'=>'Àwòrán kékeré','Full size'=>'Ìwọ̀n tó kún','Link to'=>'So si','Attachment page'=>'Ojú ìwé ìfikún','Media file'=>'Fáìlì média','Audio'=>'Ohùn','Video'=>'Fidio','File address'=>'Adirẹsi fáìlì','Poster image'=>'Aworan àmúlò','Media IDs, separated by commas'=>'Àwọn ID media, tí a pín pẹ̀lú àwọn ìsòroro','Show the track list'=>'Fi atokọ awọn orin hàn','Embed'=>'Fi sílẹ','Address to embed'=>'Adirẹsi lati fi sinu rẹ','Maximum width'=>'Iwọn ti o pọ julọ','Image and caption HTML'=>'HTML àwòrán àti àkọlé rẹ̀','Tip: the Form block shows this form styled to match your site.'=>'Ìmọ̀ràn: Ìdènà Fọ́ọ̀mù fi fọ́ọ̀mù yìí hàn pẹ̀lú ìrísí tí ó bá ojula rẹ mu.','Show the form title'=>'Fi akọle fọọmu han','Show the form description'=>'Fi apejuwe fọọmu han','Submit without reloading the page'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ láìṣe àtúnṣe ojúewé náà','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Ìṣàkóso "%s" láti inú olootu àtijọ́ kò sí ní olootu bọ́lọ́kì náà. Tẹ iye náà sínú gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀.','Choose file'=>'Yan fáìlì','— Default —'=>'— Aiyipada —','Advanced styling'=>'Ìlànà aṣọ tó ga julọ','Inline CSS'=>'CSS Abẹnu','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Àwọn ìkéde CSS, fún àpẹrẹ: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Àwọn ipa (àwọn kíláìsì ìṣẹ̀dá àtijọ́)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Àwọn orúkọ ipa tí a pín nípa lílo àlàfo tí ó wá láti àwọn ẹ̀dà àtijọ́, fún àpẹẹrẹ: hover-shadow','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Fífẹ̀ kíkún, a pa àwọn àkóónú mọ́ láàárín','Link relationship'=>'Asiko idapo awon oju-opona','Left'=>'Apa osi','Right'=>'Ọtún','Add text…'=>'Fi ọrọ kun…','Placement'=>'Ipò','On its own line'=>'Lori laini tirẹ','In the line, beside other content'=>'Nínú ìlà náà, lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ àwọn ohun àfikún yòókù','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'Fífúnni lọ́fẹ̀ẹ́ (ojú ìwé tuntun ní ìpele tó ga jù lọ lórí ojú ìwé náà)','Accessible label'=>'Àmìwò ẹ̀rọ alábòójútó tí ó ṣeé wọlé','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ láìsí nǹkankan fún àmì ìṣọ́ṣọ́.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Yan àmì kan ninu awọn eto bulọọki.','New setting name'=>'Orúkọ ètò tuntun','For example: title or text'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ: àkọlé tàbí ọrọ̀','Add setting'=>'Fi ètò kun','Widget'=>'Wíjẹ̀tì','Choose a widget'=>'Yan wiṣeti kan','Widget area'=>'Agbegbe Wigi','Choose a widget area'=>'Yan agbegbe fídíìítì kan','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Àwòrán yìí kò ní ìbú tàbí gíga, nítorí náà ojú ìwé náà yóò fò nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Yan án láti inú Àkójọ Àwòrán, tàbí kí o ṣètò ìbú àti gíga rẹ̀.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Fidio yìí kò wá láti Ilé Ìkópamọ́ Àwòrán, nítorí náà a kò mọ ìwọ̀n rẹ̀, ojú ewé náà yóò sì fó lọ sókè nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Ṣe àgbéṣọ rẹ̀ sí Ilé Ìkópamọ́ Àwòrán dípò bẹ́ẹ̀.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Àwòrán, fídíò tàbí fífírù kankan nínú HTML yìí kò ní ìbú àti gíga, nítorí náà ojú ewé náà yóò fò nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Fi àwọn àbùdá ìbú àti gíga kún un.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Èké yìí ń tún iwọn ara rẹ̀ ṣe lẹ́yìn tí ó bá gbé wọlé, èyí tí ó ń gbe àwọn ohun inú tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ rẹ̀ kúrò ní ipò. Fún ní àyè tàbí gbé e sí ìsàlẹ̀ diẹ lórí ojú ewé náà.','Layout shift'=>'Yiyipada Iṣeto','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'Widget yii kii ṣe apejuwe awọn eto rẹ, nitorina a ṣatunkọ wọn gẹgẹbi oruko ati awọn orisii iye.','Problem'=>'Àwọn Ìṣòro','Check'=>'Ṣayẹwo','Show block'=>'Fi àwòrán hàn','Use a readable theme colour'=>'Lo awọ akori ti o le kika daradara','Make it H%d'=>'Sọ ọ di H%d','Alt text'=>'Àwọn àpèjúwe àfidípò','Save alt text'=>'Fipamọ ọrọ alt','This image is decorative'=>'Àwòrán yìí jẹ́ ohun ọ̀ṣọ́ ni','Checking…'=>'Níbẹ̀ wò lọ́wọ́ lọ́wọ́…','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'A kò rí ìṣòro ìwọlé kankan lórí ojú ewé yìí.','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s, %2$s.','%d problem'=>'Ìṣòro %d','%d thing to check'=>'Ohun %d lati ṣayẹwo','Check again'=>'Ṣayẹwo lẹẹkan si','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'Ayẹwo aládàáṣiṣẹ́ kan ń rí ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìṣòro ṣùgbọ́n kì í ṣe gbogbo wọn. Gbìyànjú ojú ewé náà pẹ̀lú titẹ bọ́tìnnì nìkan àti pẹ̀lú olùkà ojú-iboju pẹ̀lú.','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'Ìyàtọ̀ àwọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ jẹ́ %1$s:1; ó nílò ó kéré tán %2$s:1 láti jẹ́ kí ó ṣe é kà.','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'tẹ ibi,ibi,ka siwaju,siwaju,ọna asopọ,ọna asopọ yii,kọ diẹ sii,lo','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'Ọna asopọ kan ko ni ọrọ kankan, nitorina oluka iboju n kede “link” nikan. Fi ọrọ tabi aami kun.','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ ìjápọ̀ “%s” kò sọ ibi tí ó ń lọ. Dípò bẹ́ẹ̀, ṣe àpèjúwe ibi tí ó ń lọ.','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'Ohun kan ni tabindex ti o dara, eyiti o yipada aṣẹ bọtini itẹwe kuro ninu aṣẹ kika. Lo 0 tabi yọ kuro.','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'A kò lè dé ohun tí a lè tẹ pẹ̀lú bọ́tìnnì tẹ́pù. Lo bọ́tìnnì tàbí àjápọ̀ gidi kan.','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'Foonu tí a fi sínú kò ní àkọlé, nítorí náà olùkà aṣọ-ojú kò lè sọ ohun tí ó jẹ́.','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'Ko si àmì lórí pápá fọ́ọ̀mù kan, nítorí náà a kò mọ ète rẹ̀.','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'Akọlé yìí ṣofo. Àwọn olùmúlò olùkà ojú-ibẹ̀ ń lọ kiri nípa lílo àwọn àkọlé; yọ ọ́ kúrò tàbí fi ọ̀rọ̀ kún un.','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'Àkọlé ojú-ewé náà jẹ́ H1 tẹ́lẹ̀; lo H2 fún ìpele òkè jù lọ ti àkóópọ̀ náà.','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'H%1$d yii fo ipele kan; eyi ti o wa ṣaju rẹ jẹ H%2$d. Ṣe e ni H%3$d kan.','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'Àwòrán yìí kò ní ọ̀rọ̀ àlàyé yiyan. Ṣàlàyé rẹ̀, tàbí kí o sàmì sí i gẹ́gẹ́ bí ohun ọ̀ṣọ́ tí kò bá fi bẹ́ẹ̀ ṣe tàbí kò fi kún ohunkóhun.','Close panel'=>'Pa pátákì náà','Desktop'=>'Kọmputa ti tabili','Default'=>'Àiyàsọ','Every track'=>'Gbogbo orin','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Àwọn ìwọ̀n ọ̀nà, fún àpẹẹrẹ: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Awọn iwọn orin aṣa','Equal tracks'=>'Àwọn ojú ọ̀nà tí ó dọ́gba','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'Àwọn ìlà tí a fọ̀rọ̀ mọ́lẹ̀ kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan, fún àpẹẹrẹ: "head head" "side main". Fún agbègbè náà ní orúkọ lórí ẹ̀yà àtẹ̀lé kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Automatic'=>'Láìsí àtúnṣe','Square (1:1)'=>'Onigun Mẹrin (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Ọ̀wọ̀n (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Kilikiya (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Gbooro (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Sinima (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Giga (9:16)','Custom'=>'Àṣà','Width / height'=>'Ìbú / giga','Background image'=>'Àwòrán ẹ̀yìn','Inherited image — replace'=>'Àwòrán tí a jogún — rọ́pò','Cover'=>'Bo','Contain'=>'Ni','Original size'=>'Ìwọ̀n àkọ́kọ́','Repeat'=>'Tún ṣe','No repeat'=>'Má tún ṣe e','Tile'=>'Orílé-èdè','Tile across'=>'Sọ̀ kalẹ̀ jákèjádò','Tile down'=>'Fi pẹlẹbẹ silẹ','Fixed while scrolling'=>'Ti o wa titi nigba ti o n yipo','Solid'=>'Lile','Dashed'=>'Ti a fi ila gige ṣe','Dotted'=>'A ni àmì àpẹẹrẹ','Double'=>'Lọ́po méjì','Each side separately'=>'Ọkọ̀ọ̀kan ní ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀','Side'=>'Ẹ̀gbẹ́','Add a shadow'=>'Fi ojiji kun','Horizontal'=>'Gbọọrọ','Vertical'=>'Inaro','Blur'=>'Fẹ́lẹ̀fẹ́lẹ̀','Spread'=>'Tan','Inside'=>'Ninu','Remove this shadow'=>'Yọ ojiji yii','Opacity'=>'Àìríjọ','Transform'=>'Yipada','Shadow'=>'Ojiji','Ease'=>'Ìrọ̀rùn','Linear'=>'Onígbàgbọ́','Ease in'=>'Rọrun lati lo','Ease out'=>'Yọ kúrò ni rírọ̀','Ease in and out'=>'Fi rọrun bọ̀ wọ́n kí o sì yọ wọ́n kúrò','Duration (milliseconds)'=>'Ìgbà (milísẹ̀kọ́ndì)','What animates'=>'Ohun tí ń mú un wààyè','Easing'=>'Ìdínkù','Delay (milliseconds)'=>'Aago Ìdúró (mílísèkọǹdì)','Remove the preset'=>'Yọ àkọsẹ̀tán náà','More options'=>'Àwọn àṣàyàn míràn','Number and unit'=>'Nọ́mbà àti ẹ̀ka','Custom CSS value (calc, clamp…)'=>'Iye CSS àṣà (calc, clamp…)','Set each side separately'=>'Ṣe ẹnikan lọtọ lọtọ','Set all sides together'=>'Ṣe gbogbo ẹ̀gbẹ̀ papọ̀','All sides'=>'Gbogbo awọn apa','Top start'=>'Ibẹrẹ oke','Top end'=>'Ibi giga julọ','Bottom start'=>'Isale bere','Bottom end'=>'Opin the isale','Between rows'=>'Laarin awọn ila','Between columns'=>'Láàrin àwọn òpó','Choose a preset'=>'Yan àwọn àṣàyàn tẹ́lẹ̀','Presets'=>'Àwọn ètò tẹ́lẹ̀','Preset: %s'=>'Ààyè tẹ́lẹ̀: %s','Spacing'=>'Ààyè Àlàfo','Typography'=>'Àwọn ìrísí lẹtà','Colours & background'=>'Àwọ̀ & abẹ́lẹ̀','Border'=>'Ààrẹ','Effects'=>'Àwọn ipa','Motion'=>'Ìṣípò','Advanced'=>'Ilọsiwaju','up to %d px'=>'titi di %d px','from %d px'=>'lati %d px','all widths'=>'gbogbo ìbú','Screen size'=>'Iwọn iboju','Hover'=>'Lé e lùú','Reset every value set for %s'=>'Tún gbogbo ìye tí a ṣètò fún %s ṣe','Inherited from %s'=>'Ti a jogun lati ọdọ %s','Reset %s'=>'Tun %s se','Hide on'=>'Fi pamọ́ sí','%1$s (%2$d set)'=>'%1$s (%2$d ti a ṣeto)','Replace icon'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ àmì ìdánimọ̀','No icons match.'=>'Ko si aami ti o baamu.','Regular'=>'Deede','Brands'=>'Àwọn àmì ọjà','Sharp'=>'Mú','Bold'=>'Gbọ́nọ́n','Fill'=>'Fọ́','Duotone'=>'Duotone','This icon set could not be loaded. Check your connection and try again.'=>'A ko le gbe ètò àwọn àwòrán yìí sórí ẹ̀rọ. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìsopọ̀ rẹ kí o sì tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Search icons'=>'Awọn àmì ìwádìí','Search all sets'=>'Wá gbogbo àwọn ṣẹ́tì náà','%d icons'=>'Àwọn àmì %d','Loading icon sets…'=>'N ṣe