 ohun inú rẹ̀ gba ara wọn lọ́wọ́','Space between'=>'Ààyè láàárọ̀','Space around'=>'Ààyè tó yípo','Space evenly'=>'Fiaye si dede','Letter spacing'=>'Àlàfo lẹ́tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀','Line height'=>'Gig giga laini','Margin'=>'Ààyè títẹ̀','Max height'=>'Giga to ga julọ','Max width'=>'Iwọn giga julọ','Min height'=>'Giga kúrú jù lọ','Min width'=>'Ìbú tó kéré jù','Overflow'=>'Àpọ̀jù','Visible'=>'Han-an','Clip'=>'Gbe kuro','Scroll when needed'=>'Yi lọ sí ìṣàlẹ̀ nígbà tí ó bá yẹ','Always scroll'=>'Máa yípa nígbà gbogbo','Padding'=>'Abajade Àlà','Place items'=>'Gbe awọn nkan si ipo','Relative'=>'Tí ó mọ̀ ẹ̀yà','Absolute'=>'Pipele','Fixed'=>'Ti a tunše','Corner radius'=>'Ìgbun igun','Row span'=>'Ààyè ìlà','Justify'=>'Ṣe ìpínlẹ̀','Decoration'=>'Ìṣọ́ṣì','Overline'=>'Langooke Oke','Strikethrough'=>'Atọ kọja','Text shadow'=>'Ojiji ọrọ','Letter case'=>'Ìrísí lẹ́tà','Uppercase'=>'Àwọn lẹ́tà ńlá','Lowercase'=>'Kekere','Capitalise'=>'Fi àmì ńlá kọ','Transition'=>'Ìyípadà','Stack order (z-index)'=>'Ìlànà àkójọ (z-index)','Add screen sizes of your own, such as a large desktop, a landscape tablet or a small phone.'=>'Fi awọn iwọn iboju tirẹ kun, bii deskitọpu nla kan, tabulẹti ala-ilẹ tabi foonu kekere kan.','Applies'=>'Ó kàn án','up to a width'=>'titi di iwọn kan','from a width'=>'lati iwọn fife','Width (px)'=>'Ìbú (px)','Remove this breakpoint'=>'Yọ àlàfo yìí kúrò','Large desktop'=>'Ojumo oju-iwe nla','Add a breakpoint'=>'Fi àfojúsùn kún un','Radial'=>'Radiọlì','Conic'=>'Kóníìkì','Angle (degrees)'=>'Igun (ìwọn)','Ellipse'=>'Elipiisi','Colour stop %d'=>'Àwọ̀ ìdúró %d','Position (%)'=>'Ipò (%)','Remove stop'=>'Yọ duro','Add colour stop'=>'Fi awọ kun duro','Clear gradient'=>'Ko gradient rẹẹ','Blur behind (px)'=>'Ikunlẹ lẹhin (px)','Saturation behind (%)'=>'Ìkún lẹ́yìn (%)','Tint (use a see-through colour)'=>'Tàǹtì (lo àwọ̀ tí a lè rígbà)','Blob'=>'Blob','Hexagon'=>'Hẹ́ságọ̀nì','Triangle'=>'Triangle','Diamond'=>'Diamond','Heart'=>'Ọkàn','Arch'=>'Ògiri','Brush stroke'=>'Àìtàn àwòrán','Mask shape'=>'Àwòrán ìbojú','Custom image'=>'Àwòrán tí a ṣe àṣìṣe / Àwòrán tí a ṣe àṣìṣe','Replace mask image'=>'Rọ́pò àwòrán ìbojú','Choose mask image'=>'Yan aworan iboju-boju','Fit'=>'Baamu','Repeat across'=>'Tun un ṣe lori gbogbo rẹ','Repeat down'=>'Tún ṣe si isalẹ','Space out'=>'Fiaye sile','Stretch to fit'=>'Nà láti máa bá mu','Multiply'=>'Ṣe ìlọpo méjì','Screen'=>'Ibju','Overlay'=>'Ìbora','Darken'=>'Fi okunkun sori','Lighten'=>'Sẹ fúyẹ́','Colour dodge'=>'Yiyọ awọ rọpo','Colour burn'=>'Mú àwòràn pọ̀ sí i','Hard light'=>'Imọlẹ lile','Soft light'=>'Ìmọ́lẹ̀ rírọ̀','Difference'=>'Ìyàtọ̀','Exclusion'=>'Àìkọ́','Hue'=>'Awọ','Saturation'=>'Iwonba Mimu','Luminosity'=>'Luminosity','Blend mode'=>'Ọ̀nà ìpọ̀pọ̀','Blur (px)'=>'Àìrí (px)','Brightness (%)'=>'Imọlẹ (%)','Contrast (%)'=>'Ìyàtọ̀ (%)','Greyscale (%)'=>'Àwọn ìlànà ìwọ̀ (Grisè) (%)','Hue rotation (degrees)'=>'Yiyi awọ pada (awọn iwọn)','Saturation (%)'=>'Ìkún (%)','Sepia (%)'=>'Sepia (%)','Drop shadow'=>'Ojiji isasilẹ','Across (px)'=>'Nígbà (px)','Down (px)'=>'Isalẹ (px)','Softness (px)'=>'Rírọ (px)','Shadow colour'=>'Àwọ̀ ojiji','Remove drop shadow'=>'Yọ ojiji ti o wa lẹhin','Applies on every screen size.'=>'Ó kàn sí gbogbo ìwọ̀n iboju.','Applies to the screen size chosen in the design panel.'=>'Ó kàn sí ìwọ̀n iboju tí a yàn nínú pátákì apẹrẹ.','Background gradient'=>'Ìpìlẹ̀ ìwọ̀ oòrùn','Add gradient'=>'Fi gbolohun bẹ́ ẹ̀rọ kún','Glass'=>'Gíìsì','Mask'=>'Bo','Filters'=>'Àwọn ohun ìlọ́wọ́ọ̀dù','Wave'=>'Rùgùn','Waves'=>'Àwọn Ìgbì Omi','Curve'=>'Ìtẹ̀','Curve (asymmetric)'=>'Kọ́ọ̀bù (àìdọ́gba)','Arc'=>'Àìrí','Tilt'=>'Ti tìi','Tilt (layered)'=>'Tẹ́ (tí a kó sórí ara wọn)','Triangle (asymmetric)'=>'Onírúurú (aláìdọ́gba)','Split'=>'Pín','Zigzag'=>'Zigzag','Mountains'=>'Awọn òkè','Clouds'=>'Awọn ikuku','Drops'=>'Àwọn tí ó sánlẹ̀','Pyramids'=>'Àwọn Pyramids','Book'=>'Fi pamọ́','Stairs'=>'Àwọn àlẹ̀kọ́','Fan'=>'Afẹfẹ','Height (px)'=>'Giga (px)','Mirror'=>'Ṣe àwòkọ','Invert'=>'Yípadà','In front of the content'=>'Níwájú àkóópọ̀ náà','Video file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'Fáìlì fídíò (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'Yan fideo MP4 tabi WebM','MP4 address'=>'Adirẹsi MP4','WebM address'=>'Adirẹsi WebM','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'Àìámọ̀ fídíò YouTube (àwọn lẹ́tà tàbí nọ́mbà 11)','Vimeo video number'=>'Nọmba fidio Vimeo','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Awọn alabewo nikan ni o kan si iṣẹ fidio nigbati wọn yi lọ si apakan yii, ṣugbọn kii ṣe nigbati ẹrọ wọn ba beere fun iṣipopada ti o dinku. Titi di igba yẹn, wọn ri aworan panini naa.','Replace poster image'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ àwòrán àfihàn','Choose poster image'=>'Yan àworò ìfihàn','Background slideshow'=>'Fọ́tò abẹ́lẹ́ tó ń yí padà','Change images'=>'Yipada awọn aworan','Choose at least two images.'=>'Yan o kere ju aworan meji lo.','Seconds per image'=>'Àwọn àáyá fún àwòrán kọ̀ọ̀kan','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Sísùn lọ́dọ̀raun (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Yọ slideshow kuro','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Àwọn àlejò tí wọ́n bá béèrè fún ìgbésẹ̀ díẹ̀ lórí ẹ̀rọ wọn yóò rí àwòrán àkọ́kọ́ nìkan.','Section effects'=>'Awọn ipa apakan','Top divider'=>'Apakan oke','Bottom divider'=>'Apá ìsàlẹ̀','Choose the logo'=>'Yan aami-idanimọ náà','Not set'=>'Ko ti ni aago','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Ṣàyẹ̀wọ̀ àwọn àwọ̀ àmì-ìdánimọ̀ náà: olúkúlùkù nílò orúkọ àrà ọ̀tọ̀ àti àwọ̀ tó tọ̀nà.','Brand name'=>'Orukọ àmì ọjà','A logo is chosen.'=>'A yan aami-idanimọ kan.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Yan aami-idanimọ lati oju-iwe apẹrẹ aaye.','Brand colours'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀ àmì ọjà','Brand %d'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀yà %d','Add brand colour'=>'Fi àwọ̀ ami si','Heading font'=>'Fọọmu àkọlé','Body font'=>'Fọọntì ara','Tone of voice'=>'Ohùn ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Bii ami-iṣowo rẹ ṣe kọ, f.apẹrẹ “Ore-ọfẹ ati rọrun, awọn gbolohun kukuru, ko si ẹ̀dá-ọ̀rọ̀ asan.” AI n tẹle e nígbàkugbà ti o ba kọ fun aaye yii.','Brand kit saved.'=>'A fipamọ ohun elo ami iyasọtọ naa.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'A ti lo aami naa: awọn awọ, awọn fọọti ati aami rẹ jẹ ti aaye naa bayi.','Apply to site'=>'Fi sori aaye','All classes'=>'Gbogbo kilasi','Class name on the page'=>'Orukokilasi lori ojú-ewe rẹ','Printed as %s.'=>'A tẹ̀ sí %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Bẹrẹ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan; àwọn lẹ́tà kékeré, àwọn nọ́mbà àti àwọn àmì ìfàmọ̀ nìkan.','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Awọn ìṣàkóso àṣà kò kún. Ṣe àtúnṣe ojú-ewé náà; tí èyí bá ń bá a lọ, tún fi sọ́tùn-ún plugin náà.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'A ti fi kilasi naa pamọ. Gbogbo nkan ti o nlo o ni aṣa tuntun naa.','Save class'=>'Fipamọ kilasi','Class created.'=>'A ti dá kilásì náà sílẹ̀.','New class'=>'Kilásì tuntun','e.g. Card'=>'fagan Kààtì','Create'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá','Search classes'=>'Wá awọn kilasi','No class matches.'=>'Kò sí kilàsí tó báamu.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Kò sí àwọn kílàsì kankan ṣì. Ṣẹda ọ̀kan, ṣe àṣà rẹ̀, lẹ́yìn náà fi kún èyíkéyìí ẹ̀yà láti inú àwọn ètò rẹ̀.','Edit %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ %s','Class duplicated.'=>'A ṣe ẹ̀dà kíláìsì náà.','Delete %s'=>'Pa %s rẹ́','Class deleted.'=>'A ti pa kilasi naa rẹ́.','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Ṣe o fẹ́ pa kíláàsì "%s" rẹ́? Àwọn ohunèlò tó ń lò ó yóò mú àkóónú wọn dúró ṣùgbọ́n wọn yóò sọ àwọn àṣà rẹ̀ nù.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Àwọn olùmúlò tí wọ́n le fi HTML tí kò ní àlẹmọ kún nìkan ló lè yí CSS àṣà padà.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Apakan ninu CSS yii ni a kii yoo lo: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" ati awọn àmì ìdúró ti ko ni ibamu ni a yọ kuro fun aabo.','Upload a font'=>'Gbe fọọntii soke','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Igbékálsẹ̀ àwọn fóǹtì nílò WordPress 6.5 tàbí jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ.','Font name'=>'Oruko fọọmu','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'fami. o. Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s ti wọle ati pe o ṣetan lati lo.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Yan faili fọọntu (lailai %s)','Font library'=>'Ilé-kíkọ fòntì','%d files'=>'%d àwọn fáìlì','Font switched off for the site.'=>'A ti pa fọndì kúrò fún ojula náà.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'A ti tan fọnti sori aaye naa.','Switch off'=>'Pa kuro','Switch on'=>'Tan si','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Fi ìdámọ̀ ohun elo wẹ́bù Adobe Fonts rẹ̀ sílẹ̀. A óò bá a gbe àwọn lẹ́tà wọ̀nyí wọlé láti Adobe sórí àwọn ojú ìwé rẹ̀.','Your web projects'=>'Awọn iṣẹ wẹẹbu rẹ','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'A ti sopọ Adobe Fonts.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'A ti ge Adobe Fonts kuro.','Kit id'=>'Àmì ẹ̀mọ́ ohun èlò','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Iye òkùnkùn fún "%s" kì í ṣe àwọ̀ tó tọ́.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Nígbà tí àlejò kan kò bá ti yan','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Tẹ̀ lé ẹ̀rọ alejo náà','Dark colours'=>'Awọn àwọ̀ dúdú','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Fun awọ kọọkan ni ẹya dudu rẹ. Awọn awọ ti o fi silẹ ni ṣofo yoo wa ni kanna ni awọn eto mejeeji. Ẹya dudu wa lori ni kete ti awọ kan ba ni iye dudu kan.','Dark version of %s'=>'Ẹ̀dà dúdú ti %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ ipo òkùnkùn.','Page CSS'=>'CSS Ojú-ewé','Global classes'=>'Àwọn kílàsì gbogbo gbòò','Classes'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀ka','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn kilasi ni Apẹrẹ aaye (Site design), lẹhinna fi them kun nibi.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS Ti A Ṣe Àṣàyàn Rẹ̀','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Kọ awọn ofin fun eroja yii. "selector" tumọ si eroja yii, fun apẹẹrẹ selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — awọn alaye ti o rọrun kan si eroja funrararẹ.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Awọn faili fọọti gbọdọ jẹ %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Fáìlì fọ́ọ̀tù yẹn jẹ́ òfo tàbí ó tóbi ju 10 MB lọ.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Ṣe àṣà lẹ́ẹ̀kan, tún lò ó ní ibi gbogbo, yí padà ní ibi kan.','Variables'=>'Àwọn ohun tí a lè yí padà','Named values any element can use.'=>'Awọn iye tí a sọ fúnni tí ohunèlò èyíkéyìí lè lò.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Ààyè, ìwọ̀n àti àwọn ojiji','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Àwọn iwọ̀n tí olùyànàyè ààyè kọ̀ọ̀kan, igun àti ojiji fúnni.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Ẹya dídúùkú àwọn àwọ̀ rẹ, fún àwọn alábẹ̀wò tí wọ́n fẹ́ ẹ.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Àmì ilé-iṣẹ́, àwọn àwọ̀, àwọn ìrí lẹ́tà àti irú ohùn, tí AI àti àwọn àdàkọ ń lò.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'Gbe awọn fọọti tirẹ soke tabi sopọ Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS fun ojú-ewé yii nikan.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS fún ojú-ewé yìí','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Wọ́n kó o sí ojúewé yìí nìkan, lẹ́yìn àwọn àṣà ojúewé náà. Wọ́n fi pamọ́ pẹ̀lú ojúewé náà.','Short name'=>'Oríkì kúkurú','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'Awon oruko kukuru "%s" ti lo ni eemeji.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": àwọn orúkọ kúkúrú ń lò àwọn lẹ́tà kékeré, nọ́mbà àti àmì ìyàsọtọ̀.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Iye "%s" kii ṣe eyiti eto yii gba.','Radius'=>'Rediosi','Add a step'=>'Fi igbese kun','Scales saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn iwọn naa.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'A ti da awọn iwọn pada si awọn aiyipada.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Túnṣe sí ìwọ̀ntúnwọ̀ntún àìyípadà','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Kò sí àwọn iyipada kankan síbẹ̀. Iyipada kan máa ń mú iye kan — ìfẹ̀, àpapọ̀ àwọ̀, ìwọ̀n fọ́ọ̀tì — tí ọ̀pọ̀ àwọn ohunèlò pín.','Add variable'=>'Fi ayipada kun','Variables saved.'=>'Àwọn ohun tí a fipamọ́.','Entrance animation'=>'Animation wíwọlé','Fade in'=>'Fi bọ','Fade in, rising'=>'Fífihan n bọ, ó ń goke','Fade in, dropping'=>'Ṣe àfihàn bẹẹrẹ, tí ń sọ̀ kalẹ̀','Fade in from the start side'=>'Fihan lati ibẹrẹ ibẹrẹ','Fade in from the end side'=>'Fi ipò rọ́ bẹ̀rẹ̀ láti ẹ̀gbẹ́ ìparí','Zoom out'=>'Sun kuro','Flip up'=>'Yi pada si oke','Animation length (ms)'=>'Gigun Animation (ms)','Animation delay (ms)'=>'Ìpẹ́ ìdúróṣinṣin (ms)','While scrolling'=>'Nígbà tó ń lọ bẹ́ẹ̀','Fade in as it scrolls into view'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ sí i bí ó ṣe ń yọ̀ yọ̀ sí ojú ojú-wọ̀n','Rise as it scrolls into view'=>'Gbígbé sókè bí ó ṣe ń yọ̀ sí ojú ìwòye','Grow as it scrolls into view'=>'Dagba bi o ṣe n yọ si wiwo','Straighten as it scrolls into view'=>'Fi tọ̀ sípò bí o ṣe ń yí sí ojú rẹ̀','On hover'=>'Nígbà tí a bá gbé e lórí','Lift'=>'Gbe soke','Glow'=>'Glow','Stay in view (px from the top)'=>'Duro sí ojú (px láti òkè)','Parallax speed (-10 to 10)'=>'Iyara Parallax (-10 si 10)','Follow the pointer (strength)'=>'Tẹle itọka (agbara)','Place ID'=>'Àmì Ìdánimọ̀ Ibẹ̀','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'Wa pẹ̀lú olùwá Place ID ti Google: wá iṣowo rẹ ki o da ID naa kọ silẹ.','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'Bọtìlì API kan láti inú iṣẹ́ agbese Google Cloud rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú Places API (New) tí a ti mú ṣiṣẹ́. Fi opin sí i sí API yẹn.','Business unit ID'=>'ID Ẹka Iṣowo','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'ID ti o ni ohun kikọ 24 ti iṣowo rẹ lori Trustpilot, lati inu akọọlẹ Trustpilot Business rẹ (Integrations › API).','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Bọtìlì API ti akanti Trustpilot Business rẹ.','Not set up.'=>'Kò tíì ṣètò.','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'A kò lè ka kọ́kọ́rọ́ tí a fi pamọ́ mọ́ (àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ ààbò ojú-wẹ́bù náà ti yí padà). Tẹ́ ẹ síwájú sí i.','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'Ó nílò ìdánimọ̀ méjèèjì àti bọ́tìnnì API.','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'Ṣe agbekalẹ rẹ. Awọn itọnisọna Google ni a n gbejade ni akoko gidi ni igbakugba ti oju-iwe kan ti o ni bulọọki Awọn atunyẹwo ba han: ibeere Alaye Ibi kan kan lori bọtini tirẹ fun wiwo kọọkan, ti ko ni ipamọ ri (awọn ofin Google ko gba laaye lati tọju wọn).','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'Ìsọ̀túnṣe àkọ́kọ́ náà kùnà: %s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'Nduro fun imudojuiwọn akọkọ (laarin iṣẹju kan tabi meji).','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'A tún %1$s ṣe: wọ́n tọ́jú àwọn àyẹ̀wò %2$d, pẹ̀lú ìwọ̀n %3$s láti ọwọ́ %4$d.','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'Ìgbìyànjú tó kẹ́yìn, %1$s, kò yọrí sọ́rí, a sì pa àwọn àtẹ̀yìnwá tó wà lókè mọ́: %2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'A ti fi pamọ́. A ń gba àwọn àyẹ̀wò Trustpilot wọlé lẹ́yìn ìplẹ̀ ní ìṣẹ́jú kan tàbí méjì; àwọn àyẹ̀wò Google ń hàn tààrà lórí ojú-ewé náà.','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Àwọn àyẹ̀wò Trustpilot ni a ń gba wọlé lẹ́ẹ̀kan ní ọjọ́ kan ní ẹ̀yìn-ọ̀fẹ́, a sì ń tọ́jú wọn sórí ojú òpó wẹ́bù rẹ, nítorí náà ojú ìwé tí ó kún fún iṣẹ́ kò ní san owó kankan lórí àkántì Trustpilot rẹ; bí ìtúnṣe bá kùnà, àwọn àyẹ̀wò tó gbẹ̀yìn yóò wà níbẹ̀. Google kò gba láàyè kí a fipamọ́ àwọn àyẹ̀wò rẹ̀, nítorí náà a ń kó wọn sórí ayélujára ní tààràtà nígbà tí àlejò bá wo ojú ìwé náà: ìwòran kọ̀ọ̀kan jẹ́ ìbéèrè kan lórí bọ́tìnnì Google tirẹ, èyí tí Google yóò gba owó lé lórí.','Where to find it'=>'Ibikębi ti o ti lè rí i','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'A ti fipamọ (…%s). Tẹ èmi tuntun kan lati rọpo rẹ.','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'Yọ awọn alaye %s ati awọn atunyẹwo rẹ kuro','Refreshed.'=>'A ti sọ di tuntun.','Refresh now'=>'Sọ di tuntun bayii','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'Ìsọ̀dọ̀tún ojoojúmọ́ tó kàn: %s.','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'Àwọn alaye Google rẹ ati Trustpilot, fun apakan Awọn atunyẹwo.','No colours yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí àwọn àwọ̀ kankan.','Colour %d'=>'Àwọ̀ %d','Add colour'=>'Fi awọ kun','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Àwùjọ àwọ̀ méjì náà ní orúkọ kan náà. Tún sọ̀rọ̀ fún ọ̀kan lára wọn orúkọ mìíràn.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" kò ṣeé ṣe láti lò gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọ̀ tó tọ́.','Theme colours'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀ ojú-iṣẹ́','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Àwọ̀ ojú-ìwé rẹ̀. Iyipada kan níhìn-ín ni a má a ń pamọ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ẹ̀yà àwọ̀ ojú-wẹ̀bù rẹ̀, gẹ́gẹ́ gangan bí Ọ̀gáǹgàn Olootu Ojú-ìwé (Site Editor) ṣe ń pa á mọ́, ó sì wúlò ní gbogbo ibi tí a ti ń lò àwọ̀ náà.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Awọn àwọ̀ ojú-ìwé ti padà sí àwọn iye ti ojú-ìwé fúnra rẹ̀.','Reset theme colours'=>'Tún àwọn àwọ̀ ojú-ìwé ṣe','Your colours'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀ rẹ','Colours saved.'=>'Awọn àwọ̀ ti fi pamọ́.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'Yan àwọ̀ kan fún %s','Clear'=>'Ko kuro','The change could not be saved.'=>'A ko le fi iyipada naa pamọ.','Theme default'=>'Àkọ́ṣẹ́ńsì kókó','Theme fonts'=>'Àwọn fọ́ọ̀tù àkòrí','Your fonts'=>'Àwọn fọ́ǹtì rẹ','Font stack'=>'Àkójọ lẹ́tà fọ́ntì','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Fọnt tí a gbejade: àwọn fáìlì rẹ̀ wá láti ilé-ìkàwọ̀ fọnt.','System sans-serif'=>'Sistemù sans-serif','Add font stack'=>'Fi akójọ fọ́ọ̀tù kún un','Fonts saved.'=>'Àwọn fífọ̀n pamọ́.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'Tí a pín pẹ̀lú àkòrí rẹ àti Olootu Aaye.','Fonts'=>'Àwọn fọ́ọ̀tù','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Àwọn fọ́ǹtì àkọlé àti ara fún gbogbo ojú òpó wẹ́bù náà.','Back to Site design'=>'Padà sí Apẹẹrẹ ojula','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Awọn kilasi, àmì, ipò òkùnkùn, ohun elo aami ati awọn fọọmu aṣa wa pẹlu Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Ṣí àwọn àṣà Ṣátì Ẹ̀dítọ̀ (Site Editor)','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Ori akọle kan pẹlu giga laini to sunmọ diẹ sii, ti a ṣe lọṣọ pẹlu taabu 𝖲𝗍𝗒𝗅𝖾.','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Ẹka ọrọ kan, ti a fi taabu Ara ṣe àṣà.','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Awọn aworan pẹlu awọn igun ti o yipo, ti a fi aṣa pẹlu taabu Aṣa.','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Fidio kan lati inú Ilé Òkè Ẹ̀rọ Ìgbóhùnsáfẹ́fẹ́, tí a ṣe lọ́sọ̀ọ̀gbọ́ pẹ̀lú tàbù Style.','Spacer'=>'Ààyè ìfàsí','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'Ààyè tí ó ṣófo láàárín àwọn bálọ̀kì; ṣètìgbò gíga tí ó yàtọ̀ fún ìwọ̀n iboju kọ̀ọ̀kan ní taabu Àṣà.','Divider'=>'Pínpín','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Ìlà pẹlẹbẹ kan laarin awọn apakan, ti a ṣe pẹlu taabu Ìfarahan.','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'Akoonu lati aaye miiran (fideo, positi, maapu) nipa lilo adirẹsi rẹ.','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Àwọn àwòrán púpọ̀ ní inú gírìdì kan, tí a ṣe lọ́sọ̀ọ́ pẹ̀lú tàbù Style.','Plain'=>'Wọn','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Ko si awọn ede ti o le yipada laarin wọn. Oluyipada naa yoo han nigbati afikun itumọ ba ṣe at তালিকা ede meji tabi ju bẹẹ lọ.','Switcher'=>'Olùyípadà','Show the current language'=>'Fi ede lọwọlọwọ hàn','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Fi Tranzly sori ki o si ṣe atọju awọn ede meji tabi ju bẹẹ lọ, yoo si han nibi.','Pills'=>'Àwọnéǹtìkéré','Dropdown'=>'Àlejò ìtẹ̀sílé','Language codes'=>'Àwọn kóòdù èdè','Show each language as'=>'Fi èdè kọọkan han gẹgẹ bi','Language name'=>'Orúkọ èdè','Language code'=>'Koodu ede','Name and code'=>'Oruko ati koodu','Flags'=>'Àwọn àmì','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Pa kuro ni aiyipada: asia jẹ orilẹ-ede kan, kii ṣe ede kan.','Include the current language'=>'Fi ede lọwọlọwọ kun un','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Fi awọn ede ti a ko tumọ oju-iwe yii si pamọ','Stack vertically'=>'Ko sori si isale','Current language text'=>'Èdè lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́','Current language background'=>'Àyíká èdè lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́','Size and spacing'=>'Iwọn ati aaye','Space between languages'=>'Ààyè láàárín àwọn èdè','Text size'=>'Iwọn ọrọ','Connected (key %s).'=>'A ti sopọ (bọtini %s).','API URL'=>'Àlàkọ́ṣe API URL','Replace the API key'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ kọ́kọ́rọ́ API náà','Where to find your %s API key'=>'Nibo ni lati wa bọtìki API %s rẹ','Check and save'=>'Ṣàyẹ̀wọ̀ kí o sì fi pamọ́','Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block\'s settings → After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.'=>'So pínpín iṣẹ́ ifiranṣẹ pẹlu olùpèsè lẹ́ẹ̀kan ṣoṣo; lẹ́hin náà fọ́ọ̀mù èyíkéyìí lè fi àwọn ènìyàn tí ó fọwọ́ sí i kún ọ̀kan nínú àwọn àkójọ rẹ (ètò àpapọ̀ fọ́ọ̀mù → Lẹ́hin fifiranṣẹ). A ń yẹ̀ àwọn bọ́tìnnì wò pẹlu olùpèsè náà, a tún pa wọ́n mọ́ pẹlu ààbò lórí ojú-wẹ́bù yìí a kò sì ní fi wọ́n hàn mọ́ láéláé.','Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a "Conversion event" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.'=>'Fi awọn ifakalẹ fọọmu ati awọn tẹ bọtini ranṣẹ si awọn iṣiro rẹ laisi koodu kankan. Fi ID kan silẹ ni ṣofo lati fo iṣẹ yẹn. Awọn bọtini gba aaye "Conversion event" kan ninu nronu Ilọsiwaju wọn. Pẹlu asia kuki tan, ko si nkan ti o kojọpọ titi ti alejo yoo fi gba.','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID'=>'Google Analytics 4 id titwọn','Google Tag Manager container ID'=>'ID apoti Google Tag Manager','Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)'=>'Meta Pixel ID (nọ́mbà tí ó hàn nínú Meta Events Manager)','Load these tags on my site'=>'Fi àwọn tágì wọ̀nyí sori ojù opo wẹ́bù mi','Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.'=>'Pa si bi akori rẹ tabi àfikún miiran ti n ṣafikun wọn tẹlẹ; a tun n ran awọn iṣẹlẹ jade.','Event name for form submissions'=>'Orúkọ ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ fún àwọn ìfọwọ́sọ́pọ̀ fọ́ọ̀mù','The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for "save"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays "denied", and the scripts you list stay switched off.'=>'Banna náà jẹ́ pópù tí o ṣe pẹ̀lú àwọn bálọ́ọ̀kì. Àwọn bọtìnnì rẹ̀ so pọ̀ mọ́ #consent-accept, #consent-reject àti #consent-save (pẹ̀lú àwọn àpótí àmì tí a sọ ní magbè nẹ́tíwọ̀kì (analytics) àti títaja (marketing) fún "save"); ọ̀nà ìsopọ̀ kan sí #consent-open ní ibikíbi fi hàn lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i. Títí di ìgbà tí àlejò kan bá gbà, àwọn tágì ìtẹ̀lé kò kó pẹ̀lú rẹ̀, Google Consent Mode wà ní "denied", àti àwọn ìwé àkọsílẹ̀ (scripts) tí o tò sílẹ̀ wà ní pípa.','Create a ready-made banner'=>'Da banner ti a ti pese silẹ','Show a cookie banner'=>'Fi bẹ́nrì kuki hàn','Banner'=>'Bánà','Choose a popup…'=>'Yan aṣoju kan…','%s (draft)'=>'%s (àkọpamọ́)','Edit the banner'=>'Ṣatunkọ asia náà','Remember the choice for (days)'=>'Rántí àṣàyàn náà fún (days)','Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no'=>'Ni ita Agbegbe Iṣowo ti Yuroopu, EEA ati UK: kojọpọ ipasẹ titi di igba ti alejo ba sọ pé bẹẹkọ','Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor\'s country (for example Cloudflare\'s CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.'=>'Pipa: gbogbo alejo gbọdọ gba tẹlẹ (ofin ti o muna julọ, ati aiyipada). Tan: nigbati olùgbalejo rẹ tabi CDN ba royin orilẹ-ede alejo (fun apẹẹrẹ olori CF-IPCountry ti Cloudflare) ti o si wa ni ita EU, EEA, UK ati Switzerland. A n ṣafihan asia na sibẹsibẹ, a si ka aimọ orilẹ-ede bi ẹni pe o wa ninu EU.','Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)'=>'Awọn iwe afọwọkọ miiran lati di titi di igba igbanilaaye (oju-amọ̀: analytics tabi oju-amọ̀: marketing, ti a ya sọtọ pẹlu aami àmì-ìse)','Popups, slide-ins and bars'=>'Awọn àtakora, àwọn ìfìsọ̀kalẹ̀ ati àwọn ọ̀pá','A/B test results'=>'Àbájáde ìdánwò A/B','Mailing-list connections'=>'Àwọn ìsopọ̀ àkójọ ìfiránṣẹ́','Popup settings'=>'Ètò agbejade','Popup (in the middle, page dimmed)'=>'Ojú-fẹ́ kíkọ́ (ní àárín, ojú ìwé ṣókùnkùn)','Slide-in (in a corner)'=>'Fífò sínú (ní igun kan)','Bar (top or bottom)'=>'Pẹpẹ (oke tabi isalẹ)','Bottom, end side'=>'Ìsàlẹ̀, apá òpin','Bottom, start side'=>'Isale, apa ibere','When the page loads'=>'Nígbà tí ojú ewé bá ń kọ́ lọ','After a delay'=>'Lẹ́ẹ̀yìí tó bá pé tàbí lẹ́yìn àkókò díẹ̀','After scrolling part of the page'=>'Lẹ́yìn tí o ti lọ́ apá kan ojú-ewé náà lọ sílẹ̀','When the visitor is about to leave'=>'Nígbà tí àlejò náà fẹ́ kúrò','When something is clicked'=>'Nígbà tí a tẹ ohun kan','Percent of the page'=>'Ìdá nínú ọgọ́rùn-ún ti ojú ewé náà','CSS selector of the element'=>'Yiyan CSS ti ohun elo naa','How often'=>'Ìgbà melo','Every page view'=>'Gbogbo wiwo ojú-ewé','Once per visit'=>'Ẹ̀lẹ̀kan fún ìbẹ̀wò kọ̀ọ̀kan','Once every few days'=>'Lẹ́ẹ̀kan lọ́jọ́ mélòó kan','Until the visitor converts'=>'Titi di igba ti alejo ba yipada','Every page'=>'Gbogbo oju-iwe','The front page'=>'Ojú ìwé iwájú','Chosen pages (IDs)'=>'Àwọn ojúewé tí a yàn (Àwọn ID)','Chosen content types'=>'Àwọn onírúurú ohun àkóónú tí a yàn','Page IDs, comma separated'=>'Àwọn ID ojúewé, tí a pín pẹ̀lú kòmà','Content types, comma separated (post, page, product)'=>'Awọn iru akoonu, ti a ya sọtọ pẹlu aami àmọ̀ (post, page, product)','Devices'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀rọ','Desktop only'=>'Ojú-iṣẹ́ kọmputa nìkan','Mobile only'=>'Foonu alagbeka nikan','Close when the dimmed page is clicked'=>'Paade nígbà tí ojú Ewé tí ó rẹ̀wù bá tẹ́e','Link a button to #popup-close to close the popup, or to #popup-convert to count a conversion.'=>'So bọtìnì náà pọ̀ mọ́ #popup-close láti pa pọ́pù náà, tàbí sí #popup-convert láti ka ìyípadà kan.','Conversion event'=>'Ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ ìyípadà','Sent to your analytics when this is clicked (for example sign_up). Set up the services under Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.'=>'A fi ranṣẹ si awọn eto iṣiro rẹ nigbati a tẹ eyi (fun apẹẹrẹ sign_up). Ṣeto awọn iṣẹ labẹ Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'A gba àwọn aṣojú AI laaye. Ṣe àtúnṣe ojúewé yìí láti rí àwọn irinṣẹ́ náà.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'Àwọn olùṣètò AI ti wà ní pípa. Àdírẹ́sì ìsopọ̀ wọn kò sì dáhùn mọ́.','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s náà tún ń ṣe àtúnṣe ojú ewé yìí. Ìpamọ́ lè sọ àwọn àtúnṣe wọn di asán.','Block library'=>'Ilé kíkọ àwọn ohun tí a dènà','Layers'=>'Àwọn ìpele','Page canvas'=>'Ojú ìwé fọ́nrán','Revisions'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe','Block settings'=>'Àwọn ètò ìdènà','Add block: %s'=>'Fi bulọọki kun: %s','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Ṣí nínú Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Fagile mo','Redo'=>'Tun se','Show or hide layers'=>'Fi han tabi tọ́ fẹlẹfẹlẹ','Show or hide the block library'=>'Fi hàn tàbí pa ile ikawe bulọọki mọ','Show revisions'=>'Fi awọn atunyẹwo han','Open the normal editor'=>'Ṣii olùṣatunṣo déédéé','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Àwọn ọ̀nà àbájọ bọ́tìnnì tẹlifóònù','Preview: desktop'=>'Ayẹwo: kọmputa tabili','Preview: tablet'=>'Àwòrán Àkọ́kọ́: tábìlì','Preview: mobile'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ: mobile','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Ṣe àwọn àṣà àti ìrísí ohun tí o ti yàn lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Lẹ́ mọ́ sórí blọ́kì tí a yàn','Copy the selected section'=>'Da apakan ti a yan n’ṣe','Paste a copied section'=>'Lẹ̀ mọ́ apá kan tí a dá se ẹ̀dọ̀kọ̀wé','Turn off safe mode'=>'Pa ipo ailewu rẹ kuro','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Tan ipo aabo (awọn afikun miiran pa, fun ọ, ni Studio nikan)','Scheduled'=>'A ti ṣètò rẹ̀','Pending review'=>'Wọ́n ń ṣe àyẹ̀wò rẹ̀','Private'=>'Ikọọkan','Draft'=>'Àkọpamọ́','All changes saved'=>'Gbogbo ayipada ti wa ni ipamọ','Saving…'=>'Ìpamọ́ lọ́wọ́…','Autosaving…'=>'Ìfipamọ́ fúnra rẹ̀…','Unsaved changes'=>'Àwọn àyípadà tí kò tíì fipamọ́','autosaved'=>'ti a fipamọ laifọwọyi','Desktop preview'=>'Ayẹwo oju opo wẹẹmu lori kọmputa tabili','Tablet preview'=>'Àwòrán àkọkọ ti tábìlì','Mobile preview'=>'Ààyè àwòrán fún fóònù alágbèékùn','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'%1$s ifihan tẹlẹ (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Ọpa irinṣẹ Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Pad bẹ sí olùṣàtúnṣe déédéé','Page title'=>'Akọlé ojú-ewé','Preview width'=>'Iwọn awotẹlẹ','Command palette'=>'Paleti àṣẹ','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Wo ojú-ewé náà (ó ṣí ní tàbù tuntun kan)','Save draft'=>'Fipamọ iwe afọwọkọ','Publish'=>'Tẹjade','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Ṣe o fẹ́ mú àwọn àyípadà tí kò tíì fipamọ́ padà bọ̀ sípò?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Ojú-ewé yìí ní àwọn àtúnṣe tí kò tíì fipamọ́ rí. A tọ́jú wọn sínú aṣàwákiri yìí:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Ojúewé yìí ní ìpamọ́ àràǹgbá tó tuntun ju ẹ̀yà tó ti dáná sílẹ̀ lọ:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Mu awọn ayipada ti a ko fipamọ bọ sipọ','Discard'=>'Pa tì','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe kò lè kó àwọn wọlé.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'Àtúnṣe ti padà bọ̀ sípò. Ṣe ìpamọ́ láti tọ́jú rẹ̀, tàbí kí o fagile láti padà sẹ́yìn.','Close revisions'=>'Pa awọn atunyẹwo kuro','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Ko si àtúnyẹwò kankan síbẹ̀. Ìpamọ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan máa ń ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀kan.','Revision from %s'=>'Àtúnyẹ̀wẹ̀ láti ọwọ́ %s','Restore this revision'=>'Muu àtúnṣe yìí bọ̀ sípò','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'A kò lè yí ipò àìléwu padà.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Ipo ailewu wa ni titan.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'%d àfikọ̀ tòótọ́ míràn ti pa, fún ọ àti ní Sandwich Studio nìkan. Ojú-wẹ́bù wíwà alààyè àti àwọn olùṣe mìíràn kò ní ipa kankan.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Modo ailewu: pa àwọn àfikún yòókù ní Studio, fún ìwọ nìkan','Save as pattern'=>'Fi pamọ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí àpẹẹrẹ','Synced'=>'A ti ṣiṣẹpọ pọ̀','Editing the pattern later changes it everywhere it is used.'=>'Yíyí àpẹẹrẹ náà padà nígbà tó yá máa yí i padà ní gbogbo ibi tí a ti ǹ lò ó.','Each copy can be edited on its own.'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀dà kọ̀ọ̀kan ni a lè ṣàtúnṣe lọtọ̀.','Save your changes.'=>'Fipamọ awọn ayipada rẹ.','Undo your last change.'=>'Pa iyipada rẹ ti o kẹhin kuro.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Tun ṣe iṣẹ afipamọ rẹ to kẹhin.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Fi hàn tàbí fi pa pálẹ̀ kíkún sẹ́hìn.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Fi awọn ọna abuja kiibọọju wọnyi han.','Select a block first.'=>'Yan bulọọki kan ni akọkọ.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'Aṣọ tii daakọ. Lẹẹmọ sori eyikeyi bulọọki, lori aaye yii tabi omiran.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Ẹ̀rọ àwárí kò jẹ́ kó ṣe ẹ̀dà.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'A ti da apakan naa. Ṣe lẹẹmọ rẹ sinu eyikeyi oju-iwe, lori aaye yii tabi omiran.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ko si àṣà tí a dá kọ̀ sí orí clipboard láti Sandwich Studio.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Àwoṣe ti a lẹ̀ mọ́ori bọ́ọ̀lu %d.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Ara yẹn kò bá bọ́ síi pẹ̀lú bọ́ọ̀kì tí a yan.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Pátì kọ́ọ̀bù náà kò ní apá kan tí a dá.','Section pasted.'=>'A ti lẹ apakan na.','Paste style'=>'Fi aṣa pamọ','Paste section'=>'Ṣẹ́gun abala','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Tẹ Ctrl+V (tabi Cmd+V lori Mac) nibi lati lẹ mọ́ ọn','Copy style'=>'Da aṣa kọọkan','Copy section'=>'Ṣàkọ́ ìpín náà','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe nínú Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Ìpamọ́ kùnà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìsopọ̀ rẹ kí o sì tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; a ti pa àwọn àtúnṣe rẹ mọ́ sínú aṣàwákiri yìí.','Published.'=>'Ti a tẹjade.','Maintenance and pre-launch mode'=>'Ipo ìtọjú ati ìpèsè ṣáájú ìfilọlẹ','What visitors see'=>'Ohun ti awọn alejo n rii','The site, as normal'=>'Ojula, gẹgẹ bii ti iṣe','Maintenance: a notice, and search engines are told to come back later'=>'Itọju: akiyesi kan, ati pe a sọ fun awọn ẹrọ wiwa lati padanu nigbamii','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'Ìgbà akọkọ iṣẹ́: àkíyèsí kan, a sì sọ fún àwọn ẹ̀rọ àwárí pé kí wọ́n má ṣe ṣe Àkọọ́lẹ̀ ojú-wọ̀n náà','Page to show instead'=>'Ojú-ewé tí a ó fi hàn dípò rẹ̀','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'Ṣe apẹrẹ eyikeyi oju-iwe pẹlu oluṣe ki o yan aṣayan yẹn nibi. Laisi rẹ, awọn alejo yoo ri akiyesi kukku pẹlu orukọ aaye naa.','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'Tani o tun n rii aaye gidi (awọn olutọju nigbagbogbo n rii):','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'Ṣí ojú-wẹ́bù náà nínú fèrèsí ìpamọ́ láti rí ohun tí àwọn alábàábẹ̀wò rí.','Network settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto nẹtiwọọki naa.','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'Àwọn ètò wọ̀nyí kàn sí ojú-wọ́òbù %d nínú nẹ́twọ̀kì yìí.','Shared templates'=>'Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ tí a pín lò','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its own copy.'=>'Àwọnà tí a fi pamọ́ sórí ojú-òpó wẹ́bù àkọ́kọ́ tí a fàmì sí níbí máa ń hàn sórí gbogbo ojú-òpó wẹ́bù, lábẹ́ “Network templates”. Ojú-òpó wẹ́bù kọ̀ọ̀kan fi ẹ̀dà tirẹ̀ síbẹ̀.','The main site has no saved patterns yet.'=>'Ko si àpẹẹrẹ kankan ti a fipamọ sori ojula akọkọ sibẹsibẹ.','White label for every site'=>'Àwìṣẹ fún ojú òpó wẹ́bù kọ̀ọ̀kan','Used by every site that has not saved its own white-label settings.'=>'Lilo nipasẹ gbogbo aaye ti ko ti fipamọ awọn eto white-label tirẹ.','Turn white label on'=>'Tan aami funfun si tan','Builder name'=>'Oruko olùkọ́','Visual editor name'=>'Orúkọ olóòtú ojú-iṣẹ́ awòrán','Author website'=>'Oju opo webu onkowe','Menu icon'=>'Àwòrán àkójọ aṣàyàn','Role defaults for every site'=>'Àwọn ohun àìyípadà ipò fún gbogbo ojú òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù','Save network settings'=>'Fipamọ awọn eto nẹtiwọki','Searching… %d item checked so far.'=>'Wiwa… A ti ṣayẹwo nkan %d di isisiyi.','No matches in %d items. Nothing to replace.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó báramù nínú àwọn nǹkan %d. Kò sí ohun láti rọ́pò.','%1$d matches on %2$d pages (%3$d items searched). Nothing has changed yet.'=>'%1$d baramu lori oju-iwe %2$d (awọn ohun %3$d ti a wa). Ko si ohun ti o ti yipada sibẹsibẹ.','Replacing… %1$d of %2$d pages done.'=>'Ní rirọ́pọ̀… %1$d nínú %2$d ojú ewé ti parí.','Done: %d page changed. You can undo this.'=>'Ti ṣe: %d ojú-ewé ti yípadà. O le yí eyi pada.','Undoing…'=>'Ní báyìí ló ń yí padà…','Undone: %1$d pages restored. %2$d pages were edited after the replacement and were left as they are.'=>'A ti fagile: Oju-iwe %1$d ni a tunṣe. Oju-iwe %2$d ni aṣatọ ti a ṣe lẹhin rirọpo naa a si fi silẹ bi wọn ṣe wa.','Undone: %d page restored.'=>'A ti ṣe é: Oju-iwe %d ti tunṣe.','Replace'=>'Rọ́pọ̀','Find'=>'Wa','A hex colour such as #1a73e8. Short forms (#fff) match too.'=>'Àwọ̀ hex kan bí #1a73e8. Àwọn ẹ̀dà kúkúrú (#fff) náà bá mu.','Replace with'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ pẹ̀lú','Match upper and lower case'=>'Bar lẹta 𱃡tọ ati kekere','Find matches'=>'Wa awọn ibamu','Matches'=>'Awọn ti o baamu','Replace on %d page'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ lórí ojú ewé %d','Undo this replacement'=>'Fagile rirọpo yii','Review comments'=>'Ṣe àyẹ̀wò àwọn àlàyé','Add a comment'=>'Fi àlàyé kun un','Comment %1$d by %2$s: %3$s'=>'Àsọyé %1$d láti ọwọ́ %2$s: %3$s','%d comments on this page.'=>'Awọn asọye %d lori oju-iwe yii.','Your comment'=>'Àlàyé rẹ','Send comment'=>'Fi asọye ranṣẹ','Thank you, your comment was sent.'=>'Ẹ ku iṣẹ, a ti fi asọye rẹ ranṣẹ.','Click the part of the page your comment is about.'=>'Tẹ apakan ojú-ewé tí asọye rẹ da lori.','Client review'=>'Àyẹ̀wọ̀ alabára','That part of the page could not be found: it may have been changed or removed since the comment was made.'=>'A ko le ri apakan oju-iwe yẹn: o le ti yipada tabi yọ kuro lati igba ti a ti sọ asọye naa.','Review link'=>'Ayẹwo àjápọ̀','Let a client comment on this page'=>'Jẹ́ kí oníbàárà sọ̀rọ̀ lórí ojú ewé yìí','Anyone with the link can see this page, even before it is published, and leave comments. No account is needed.'=>