ress.'=>'Orukọ Dashicons kan (fún àpẹrẹ dashicons-admin-customizer) tàbí àdírẹsì àwòrán https:// kan.','Hide the plugin from the Plugins screen'=>'Fi pọọluín náà pamọ́ kuro lori iboju Pọọluín (Plugins)','Agency users who still see the real product and these settings'=>'Awọn olumulo ajọṣepọ ti o tun rii ọja gidi ati awọn eto wọnyi','%d new'=>'%d titun','%d replaced'=>'A ti rọ́pọ̀ %d','%d kept as they were'=>'%d ni a tọju bi wọn ti wa tẹlẹ','%d setting'=>'ètò %d','Importing will give: %s.'=>'Gbigbe wọle yoo funni ni: %s.','Imported: %s.'=>'A gbe wọle: %s.','Exported %d item.'=>'A ti gbe nkan %d jade.','That file could not be read as an export file.'=>'Ko le ka fáìlì yẹn gẹ́gẹ́ bí fáìlì ìṣáfihàn.','Export'=>'Gbe jade','Download your templates, patterns and site design as one file, to import on another site.'=>'Gbà àwọn àdàkọ rẹ, àwọn àpẹẹrẹ ati ìṣètò ojú-wọ́ọ̀bù gẹ́gúù fáìlì kan, láti gbé wọlé sórí ojú-wọ́ọ̀bù mìíràn.','There are no templates or patterns to export yet.'=>'Ko si awọn awoṣe tabi awọn ilana lati gbe jade yet.','Include the settings'=>'Fi àwọn ètò náà kún un','Download the export file'=>'Ṣe agbekale faili wẹẹbọ wọle','Choose an export file'=>'Yan faili ifawọjade kan','The file holds %1$d item from %2$s.'=>'Fáìlì náà ní ohun kan %1$d láti ọdọ %2$s.','When an item with the same name already exists here'=>'Nígbà tí ohun kan tí ó ní orúkọ kan náà bá ti wà níhìn-ín tẹ́lẹ̀','Keep the one on this site'=>'Fi eyiti o wa lori aaye yii si silẹ','Replace it with the imported one'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú èyí tí a gbé wọlé','Import a copy beside it'=>'Gbe ẹ̀dà kan wọlé lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ rẹ̀','Apply the settings in the file'=>'Lo awọn eto ti o wa ninu faili naa','Copy the images into this site’s media library'=>'Da awọn aworan naa kọ sinu ile-ikawe media aaye yii','Show what will happen'=>'Fi ohun tí yóò ṣẹlẹ hàn','block titleAccordion item'=>'Apakan akọọdun','block descriptionOne section of an accordion: a title that opens its content.'=>'Apá kan ti akọọdọni: akọle kan ti o ṣi ako